// ˜˜˜˜˜ ˜˜˜˜˜˜˜˜˜ ˜ ˜˜˜˜˜˜˜ Black Russia ˜ 40 ˜˜˜˜˜ (GUI 33); sl/ns ˜˜˜˜˜˜ ˜˜˜˜˜˜˜˜˜.
#define MAX_INV_SLOTS 40
#define GUI_JSON_PACKET_BUF (16384)
#define GUI_JSON_IN_BUF (8192)
static g_GuiJsonOutBuf[GUI_JSON_PACKET_BUF];
static g_GuiJsonInBuf[GUI_JSON_IN_BUF];
#define MAX_ITEM_STACK 5
#define ITEM_SIM_CARD 58
#define SIM_CARD_ACTIVE_POS 255
#define ITEM_MEDKIT 22
#define ITEM_REPAIR_KIT 23
#define ITEM_FUEL_CANISTER 21

// ˜ ˜˜ ˜˜˜˜˜ ˜˜˜˜˜˜ catalog id ˜˜˜ legacy modelid (907 = ˜˜˜˜˜˜ id 1). ˜ ˜˜˜˜˜ GUI ˜ ˜˜˜˜˜˜ catalog id ˜˜ items.json.
stock Inv_ClientCatalogId(raw_id)
{
    if(raw_id <= 0) return 0;

    switch(raw_id)
    {
        case 21: return 21;
        case 22: return 22;
        case 23: return 23;
        case 58: return 58;
        case 1650: return 21;
        case 951: return 22;
        case 952: return 23;
        case 997: return 58;
        case 944: return 24;
        case 1000: return 58;
    }

    // ˜˜˜ catalog id (˜˜˜˜ ˜ InventoryItems[][0]).
    for(new i = 0; i < INV_CATALOG_ROWS; i++)
    {
        if(InventoryItems[i][0] == raw_id)
            return raw_id;
    }

    // Legacy: modelid -> catalog id (907, 918, 951˜) ˜ ˜˜ ˜˜˜˜˜˜˜˜˜ 900˜1008, ˜˜˜˜˜ 918?918 ˜˜˜˜˜˜ 7.
    for(new i = 0; i < INV_CATALOG_ROWS; i++)
    {
        if(InventoryItems[i][1] == raw_id)
            return InventoryItems[i][0];
    }

    if(raw_id >= 900 && raw_id <= 1008)
        return raw_id;

    if(raw_id <= 1008)
        return raw_id;

    return 0;
}

stock Inv_GetBackpackAddw(item_id)
{
    item_id = Inv_ClientCatalogId(item_id);
    switch(item_id)
    {
        case 1, 5, 6, 160, 290, 317, 318, 493, 562, 578, 661, 664, 970, 155, 291:
            return 50;
        case 2, 3, 7, 18, 19, 20, 42, 43, 44, 45, 46, 47, 63, 64, 65, 135, 188, 189, 190, 191, 192, 193,
             494, 497, 498, 538, 540, 541, 544, 545, 546, 547, 549, 550, 555, 556, 557,
             558, 559, 560, 565, 566, 568, 569, 570, 571, 572, 573, 574, 575, 576, 588, 602, 603, 604, 606,
             659, 670, 705, 708, 728, 877, 879, 886, 888, 891, 905, 906, 908, 909, 910, 911, 912, 913, 917, 918,
             945, 955, 962, 963, 969, 981, 985, 991, 997, 999, 1003:
            return 30;
        case 4, 361:
            return 15;
        case 141:
            return 0;
    }
    return 0;
}

// ˜˜˜˜˜˜˜ BR (addw > 0 ˜ ˜˜˜˜˜˜˜˜; id 8˜17 ˜ ˜˜˜˜˜, ˜˜ ˜˜˜˜˜˜˜)
stock bool:Inv_IsBackpackItem(item_id)
{
    item_id = Inv_ClientCatalogId(item_id);
    return (Inv_GetBackpackAddw(item_id) > 0);
}

// ˜˜˜˜˜˜˜˜˜˜˜˜ ˜˜˜˜˜˜˜˜˜˜ (˜˜ ˜˜˜˜ / SIM / ˜˜˜˜˜˜)
stock bool:Inv_IsWearableAccessory(item_id)
{
    if(item_id <= 0) return false;
    if(item_id == ITEM_SIM_CARD || item_id == 134) return false;
    if(Inv_IsBackpackItem(item_id)) return false;
    return (IsItemAccessory(item_id) > 0);
}

// BR / acs.inc: ˜˜˜˜˜ 1=˜˜˜˜˜, 2=˜˜˜˜˜˜, 6=˜˜˜˜˜˜ ˜˜˜˜ (˜˜˜˜˜). ˜˜˜˜˜˜˜˜ ˜˜˜ ˜ Accessory_StartEditor ˜ 0,0,0.
stock Inv_GetAccessoryPreset(item_id, &bone, &Float:px, &Float:py, &Float:pz, &Float:rx, &Float:ry, &Float:rz, &Float:sc)
{
    item_id = Inv_ClientCatalogId(item_id);
    new modelid = Inv_ResolveAttachModel(item_id);
    bone = Inv_GetExpectedBoneForAccessory(item_id, modelid);

    px = 0.0; py = 0.0; pz = 0.0;
    rx = 0.0; ry = 0.0; rz = 0.0;
    sc = 1.0;

    if(Inv_IsBackpackItem(item_id))
    {
        bone = 1;
        px = -0.11; py = -0.02; pz = 0.0;
        return 1;
    }
    if(bone == 6)
    {
        px = 0.0; py = 0.0; pz = 0.0;
        return 1;
    }
    if(bone == 2)
    {
        px = 0.0; py = 0.0; pz = 0.0;
        return 1;
    }
    if(bone == 1)
    {
        px = 0.0; py = -0.02; pz = 0.0;
        return 1;
    }
    return 1;
}

#define ACC_CAT_NONE     (0)
#define ACC_CAT_HEAD     (1)
#define ACC_CAT_SPINE    (2)
#define ACC_CAT_HAND     (3)
#define ACC_CAT_BACKPACK (4)

#define INV_ACC_SLOT_PHONE    (0)
#define INV_ACC_SLOT_BACKPACK (1)
#define INV_ACC_SLOT_HEAD     (5)
#define INV_ACC_SLOT_SPINE    (6)
#define INV_ACC_SLOT_HAND     (7)

stock Inv_GetAccessoryCategory(item_id)
{
    item_id = Inv_ClientCatalogId(item_id);
    if(item_id == ITEM_SIM_CARD || item_id == 134) return ACC_CAT_NONE;
    if(item_id == ITEM_FUEL_CANISTER || item_id == ITEM_MEDKIT || item_id == ITEM_REPAIR_KIT) return ACC_CAT_NONE;
    if(IsPlateItem(item_id)) return ACC_CAT_NONE;

    if(Inv_IsBackpackItem(item_id)) return ACC_CAT_BACKPACK;
    new modelid = Inv_ResolveAccessoryModel(item_id, 0);
    new bone = Inv_GetAccessoryBoneByModel(modelid);
    if(bone <= 0)
    {
        if(item_id >= 8 && item_id <= 20) return ACC_CAT_HEAD;
        return ACC_CAT_SPINE;
    }
    switch(bone)
    {
        case 2: return ACC_CAT_HEAD;
        case 6: return ACC_CAT_HAND;
        case 1: return ACC_CAT_SPINE;
    }
    return ACC_CAT_SPINE;
}

stock Inv_ResolveAccessoryModel(item_id, db_model)
{
    #pragma unused db_model
    return Inv_ResolveAttachModel(item_id);
}

// ID ˜˜˜˜˜˜˜ ˜˜ ˜˜˜˜˜˜˜˜˜˜˜ items_*.json (Black Russia). ˜˜ ˜˜˜˜˜˜ ˜˜˜ ˜˜˜˜˜˜ ˜˜˜˜˜˜˜!
//   59 -> model 1754 (˜˜˜˜˜˜), 81 -> 1755 (˜˜˜˜˜˜˜), 82 -> 1756 (˜˜˜˜˜˜˜˜), 83 -> 1757 (˜˜˜˜˜˜˜˜˜)
#define ITEM_PLATE_RUS 59
#define ITEM_PLATE_UA  81
#define ITEM_PLATE_BY  82
#define ITEM_PLATE_KZ  83
#define ITEM_PLATE_FIRST ITEM_PLATE_RUS
#define ITEM_PLATE_LAST  ITEM_PLATE_KZ

forward bool:Gibdd_RepairPlate(country, plate[], plate_size, region[], region_size);
forward Gibdd_NormalizePlateText(country, text[]);

enum p_inv_info {
    invID,
    invItem,
    invCount,
    invValue
}
new PlayerInventory[MAX_PLAYERS][MAX_INV_SLOTS][p_inv_info];

// 16 ˜ ˜˜˜˜˜ ˜˜˜˜˜˜˜˜˜ ˜˜˜˜˜ ˜˜˜˜˜˜˜ ˜˜˜˜˜˜ ˜AA 0000 AA˜ (10 ˜˜˜˜˜˜˜˜ + ˜˜˜˜˜ ˜˜˜ '\0').
new g_InvPlateNumber[MAX_PLAYERS][MAX_INV_SLOTS][16];
new g_InvPlateRegion[MAX_PLAYERS][MAX_INV_SLOTS][8];

// ˜˜˜˜˜˜˜˜ ˜˜˜˜˜˜˜˜˜˜˜ ˜˜˜˜˜˜˜˜˜˜˜˜ (˜˜˜˜˜˜˜˜ ˜˜˜˜˜˜˜˜˜˜˜) ˜˜˜ ˜˜˜˜˜˜˜˜˜˜ ˜˜˜˜˜˜ ˜˜˜˜˜˜˜˜˜.
stock bool:Inv_LoadAccessoryParamsForSlot(playerid, inv_slot, &modelid, &bone,
    &Float:px, &Float:py, &Float:pz, &Float:rx, &Float:ry, &Float:rz, &Float:sc)
{
    if(inv_slot < 0 || inv_slot >= MAX_INV_SLOTS) return false;

    new item_id = Inv_ClientCatalogId(PlayerInventory[playerid][inv_slot][invItem]);
    if(item_id <= 0) return false;

    modelid = IsItemAccessory(item_id);
    if(modelid <= 0 && !Inv_IsBackpackItem(item_id)) return false;

    Inv_GetAccessoryPreset(item_id, bone, px, py, pz, rx, ry, rz, sc);

    new inv_db_id = PlayerInventory[playerid][inv_slot][invID];
    if(inv_db_id > 0)
    {
        new q[192];
        mysql_format(db_handle, q, sizeof q,
            "SELECT * FROM `player_accessories` WHERE `inv_id`=%d ORDER BY `id` DESC LIMIT 1",
            inv_db_id);
        new Cache:result = mysql_query(db_handle, q, true);
        if(Inv_FetchAccessoryRowFromCache(playerid, item_id, inv_db_id, modelid, bone, px, py, pz, rx, ry, rz, sc))
        {
            cache_delete(result);
            return true;
        }
        cache_delete(result);
    }

    if(modelid <= 0) modelid = Inv_ResolveAttachModel(item_id);
    if(modelid > 0 && Player[playerid][pID] > 0)
    {
        new q2[220];
        mysql_format(db_handle, q2, sizeof q2,
            "SELECT * FROM `player_accessories` WHERE `uid`=%d AND `modelid`=%d ORDER BY `id` DESC LIMIT 1",
            Player[playerid][pID], modelid);
        new Cache:result2 = mysql_query(db_handle, q2, true);
        if(Inv_FetchAccessoryRowFromCache(playerid, item_id, inv_db_id, modelid, bone, px, py, pz, rx, ry, rz, sc))
        {
            cache_delete(result2);
            return true;
        }
        cache_delete(result2);
    }
    return false;
}

stock bool:Inv_HasAccessorySaveForSlot(playerid, inv_slot)
{
    if(inv_slot < 0 || inv_slot >= MAX_INV_SLOTS) return false;
    new inv_db_id = PlayerInventory[playerid][inv_slot][invID];
    if(inv_db_id <= 0) return false;

    new q[96];
    mysql_format(db_handle, q, sizeof q,
        "SELECT `id` FROM `player_accessories` WHERE `inv_id`=%d ORDER BY `id` DESC LIMIT 1", inv_db_id);
    new Cache:result = mysql_query(db_handle, q, true);
    new bool:found = (cache_num_rows() > 0);
    cache_delete(result);
    return found;
}

// ----- begin: trade / exchange (GUI 33, i=1) -----
#define MAX_TRADE_OFFER_SLOTS   20
#define TRADE_MAX_MONEY         20000000
#define TRADE_NEAR_DIST         5.0
#define TRADE_OPEN_GRACE_MS     3500
enum E_TRADE_OFFER
{
    troItem,
    troCount,
    troValue,
    troInvSlot,
    troInvID
}

new g_TradePartner[MAX_PLAYERS] = {INVALID_PLAYER_ID, ...};
new g_TradeOffer[MAX_PLAYERS][MAX_TRADE_OFFER_SLOTS][E_TRADE_OFFER];
new g_TradePlateNum[MAX_PLAYERS][MAX_TRADE_OFFER_SLOTS][16];
new g_TradePlateReg[MAX_PLAYERS][MAX_TRADE_OFFER_SLOTS][8];
new g_TradeMoney[MAX_PLAYERS];
new bool:g_TradeReady[MAX_PLAYERS];
new bool:g_TradeFinal[MAX_PLAYERS];

#define NOTIFY_TRADE_OFFER      47
#define DIALOG_TRADE_PICK       19390
#define DIALOG_TRADE_MONEY      19391
#define MAX_TRADE_NEARBY        16

new g_TradeInviteFrom[MAX_PLAYERS] = {INVALID_PLAYER_ID, ...};
new g_TradeInviteTo[MAX_PLAYERS] = {INVALID_PLAYER_ID, ...};
new g_TradePickList[MAX_PLAYERS][MAX_TRADE_NEARBY];
new g_TradePickCount[MAX_PLAYERS];

stock bool:Trade_IsActive(playerid)
{
    new p = g_TradePartner[playerid];
    if(p == INVALID_PLAYER_ID || !IsPlayerConnected(p))
        return false;
    return (g_TradePartner[p] == playerid);
}

stock Trade_ClearGhostTradeState(playerid)
{
    if(Trade_IsActive(playerid))
        return 0;
    if(g_TradePartner[playerid] != INVALID_PLAYER_ID)
        Trade_ResetPlayer(playerid);
    DeletePVar(playerid, "trade_peer");
    return 1;
}

stock Trade_MarkSessionOpened(playerid)
{
    SetPVarInt(playerid, "trade_opened_ms", GetTickCount());
}

// BR-˜˜˜˜˜˜ ˜ onDestroy ˜˜˜˜˜˜˜˜˜ ˜˜˜ t:16 ˜ ˜˜˜˜˜ ˜˜˜˜˜ ˜˜˜˜˜ ˜˜˜˜˜˜ ˜˜˜˜˜˜.
stock bool:Trade_ShouldIgnoreClosePacket(playerid)
{
    if(GetPVarInt(playerid, "inv_refreshing") > 0)
        return true;
    if(!Trade_IsActive(playerid)) return false;
    if(!GetPVarType(playerid, "trade_opened_ms")) return false;
    new opened = GetPVarInt(playerid, "trade_opened_ms");
    new elapsed = GetTickCount() - opened;
    if(elapsed < 0 || elapsed > TRADE_OPEN_GRACE_MS) return false;
    return true;
}

stock Trade_GetPartner(playerid)
{
    new p = g_TradePartner[playerid];
    if(p == INVALID_PLAYER_ID || !IsPlayerConnected(p)) return INVALID_PLAYER_ID;
    return p;
}

stock Trade_SendJson(playerid, Node:packet)
{
    OnPacketIncoming(playerid, 33, packet);
}

stock Trade_SendJsonStr(playerid, const json_str[])
{
    OnPacketIncomingStr(playerid, 33, json_str);
    return 1;
}

stock Trade_SendSimple(playerid, type, success)
{
    new buf[96];
    format(buf, sizeof buf, "{\"t\":%d,\"s\":%d}", type, success);
    Trade_SendJsonStr(playerid, buf);
}

stock Trade_SendResultW(playerid, type, success, weight)
{
    new buf[96];
    format(buf, sizeof buf, "{\"t\":%d,\"s\":%d,\"w\":%d}", type, success, weight);
    Trade_SendJsonStr(playerid, buf);
}

// BR-˜˜˜˜˜˜ ˜˜˜˜˜ t:5/t:24 ˜˜˜ ˜˜˜˜˜˜˜˜˜˜ it[]/ai[], ˜˜˜˜˜ ˜˜˜˜˜ ˜˜˜˜˜˜˜.
stock Trade_SendResultFull(playerid, type, success, weight)
{
    new flat_it[4096], flat_ai[1024];
    Inv_BuildFlatItJsonString(playerid, flat_it, sizeof flat_it);
    Inv_BuildFlatAiJsonString(playerid, flat_ai, sizeof flat_ai);

    g_GuiJsonOutBuf[0] = '\0';
    format(g_GuiJsonOutBuf, sizeof g_GuiJsonOutBuf,
        "{\"t\":%d,\"s\":%d,\"w\":%d,\"it\":%s,\"ai\":%s,\"nw\":%d,\"ns\":%d,\"m\":%d}",
        type, success, weight, flat_it, flat_ai,
        Inventory_GetMaxCarryWeight(playerid), MAX_INV_SLOTS, GetPlayerMoneyEx(playerid));
    Trade_SendJsonStr(playerid, g_GuiJsonOutBuf);
}

stock Trade_NotifySuccess(playerid, const msg[])
{
    if(!IsPlayerConnected(playerid)) return 0;
    new caption[128];
    format(caption, sizeof caption, "%s", msg);
    ShowNotification(playerid, NOTIFY_TYPE_TEXT_GREEN, 4, 0, 0, caption, "");
    return 1;
}

stock Trade_NotifyError(playerid, const msg[])
{
    if(!IsPlayerConnected(playerid)) return 0;
    new caption[128];
    format(caption, sizeof caption, "%s", msg);
    ShowNotification(playerid, NOTIFY_TYPE_TEXT_RED, 5, 0, 0, caption, "");
    return 1;
}

stock Trade_ExchangeToast(playerid, const msg[])
{
    return Trade_NotifySuccess(playerid, msg);
}

stock Trade_GetDistMetersStr(playerid, targetid, dest[], dest_size)
{
    new Float:px, Float:py, Float:pz, Float:tx, Float:ty, Float:tz;
    GetPlayerPos(playerid, px, py, pz);
    GetPlayerPos(targetid, tx, ty, tz);
    new Float:d = floatsqroot((px - tx) * (px - tx) + (py - ty) * (py - ty) + (pz - tz) * (pz - tz));
    if(d < 0.01) d = 0.01;
    format(dest, dest_size, "%.2f ˜", d);
    return 1;
}

stock Trade_SendStatus(playerid, status)
{
    Trade_SendSimple(playerid, 7, status);
}

stock bool:Trade_IsTradePacket(type)
{
    switch(type)
    {
        case 5, 6, 7, 8, 9, 16, 24, 27, 31, 34: return true;
    }
    return false;
}

stock bool:Trade_IsPlayerNear(playerid, targetid, Float:max_dist = TRADE_NEAR_DIST)
{
    if(!IsPlayerConnected(targetid) || targetid == playerid) return false;
    new Float:px, Float:py, Float:pz, Float:tx, Float:ty, Float:tz;
    GetPlayerPos(playerid, px, py, pz);
    GetPlayerPos(targetid, tx, ty, tz);
    return (floatsqroot((px - tx) * (px - tx) + (py - ty) * (py - ty) + (pz - tz) * (pz - tz)) <= max_dist);
}

stock Trade_TryRestoreSession(playerid)
{
    if(Trade_IsActive(playerid)) return 1;

    new peer = GetPVarInt(playerid, "trade_peer");
    if(peer < 0 || peer >= MAX_PLAYERS || !IsPlayerConnected(peer) || peer == playerid)
        return 0;
    if(Player[peer][pID] <= 0) return 0;
    if(g_TradePartner[peer] != INVALID_PLAYER_ID && g_TradePartner[peer] != playerid)
        return 0;
    if(!Trade_IsPlayerNear(playerid, peer))
        return 0;

    g_TradePartner[playerid] = peer;
    g_TradePartner[peer] = playerid;
    return 1;
}

stock Trade_ResetPlayer(playerid)
{
    g_TradePartner[playerid] = INVALID_PLAYER_ID;
    g_TradeMoney[playerid] = 0;
    g_TradeReady[playerid] = false;
    g_TradeFinal[playerid] = false;
    DeletePVar(playerid, "trade_peer");
    DeletePVar(playerid, "trade_opened_ms");
    DeletePVar(playerid, "trade_picking");
    DeletePVar(playerid, "inv_gui_open");
    for(new i = 0; i < MAX_TRADE_OFFER_SLOTS; i++)
    {
        g_TradeOffer[playerid][i][troItem] = 0;
        g_TradeOffer[playerid][i][troCount] = 0;
        g_TradeOffer[playerid][i][troValue] = 0;
        g_TradeOffer[playerid][i][troInvSlot] = -1;
        g_TradeOffer[playerid][i][troInvID] = 0;
        g_TradePlateNum[playerid][i][0] = '\0';
        g_TradePlateReg[playerid][i][0] = '\0';
    }
}

stock Trade_ClearOfferSlot(playerid, offer_slot)
{
    g_TradeOffer[playerid][offer_slot][troItem] = 0;
    g_TradeOffer[playerid][offer_slot][troCount] = 0;
    g_TradeOffer[playerid][offer_slot][troValue] = 0;
    g_TradeOffer[playerid][offer_slot][troInvSlot] = -1;
    g_TradeOffer[playerid][offer_slot][troInvID] = 0;
    g_TradePlateNum[playerid][offer_slot][0] = '\0';
    g_TradePlateReg[playerid][offer_slot][0] = '\0';
}

stock Trade_FindFreeInvSlot(playerid)
{
    for(new i = 0; i < MAX_INV_SLOTS; i++)
        if(PlayerInventory[playerid][i][invItem] == 0) return i;
    return -1;
}

stock Trade_NormalizeOfferItemId(item_id)
{
    new cid = Inv_ClientCatalogId(item_id);
    if(cid > 0) return cid;
    return item_id;
}

stock bool:Trade_HasRoomForItem(playerid, item_id, count)
{
    item_id = Trade_NormalizeOfferItemId(item_id);
    if(item_id <= 0) return false;
    if(count < 1) count = 1;

    if(item_id == 134 || item_id == ITEM_SIM_CARD || IsPlateItem(item_id) || item_id == ITEM_FUEL_CANISTER ||
        IsItemAccessory(item_id) > 0 || Inv_IsBackpackItem(item_id))
        return (Trade_FindFreeInvSlot(playerid) != -1);

    if(item_id == ITEM_MEDKIT || item_id == ITEM_REPAIR_KIT || item_id == 22 || item_id == 23)
    {
        new need = count;
        for(new i = 0; i < MAX_INV_SLOTS && need > 0; i++)
        {
            if(PlayerInventory[playerid][i][invItem] == item_id)
                need -= (MAX_ITEM_STACK - PlayerInventory[playerid][i][invCount]);
        }
        for(new i = 0; i < MAX_INV_SLOTS && need > 0; i++)
        {
            if(PlayerInventory[playerid][i][invItem] == 0)
                need -= MAX_ITEM_STACK;
        }
        return (need <= 0);
    }

    new need_slots = count;
    for(new i = 0; i < MAX_INV_SLOTS && need_slots > 0; i++)
    {
        if(PlayerInventory[playerid][i][invItem] == 0)
            need_slots--;
    }
    return (need_slots <= 0);
}

stock bool:Trade_CanReceiveOffers(receiver, seller)
{
    new add_w;
    for(new i = 0; i < MAX_TRADE_OFFER_SLOTS; i++)
    {
        if(g_TradeOffer[seller][i][troItem] <= 0) continue;
        new id = Trade_NormalizeOfferItemId(g_TradeOffer[seller][i][troItem]);
        new cnt = g_TradeOffer[seller][i][troCount];
        if(id == 134 || id == ITEM_SIM_CARD || IsPlateItem(id) || id == ITEM_FUEL_CANISTER ||
            IsItemAccessory(id) > 0 || Inv_IsBackpackItem(id))
            cnt = 1;
        if(cnt < 1) cnt = 1;
        if(!Trade_HasRoomForItem(receiver, id, cnt))
            return false;
        add_w += Inventory_GetItemUnitWeight(id) * cnt;
    }
    if(Inventory_GetTotalWeight(receiver) + add_w > Inventory_GetMaxCarryWeight(receiver))
        return false;
    return true;
}

stock Trade_DbInsertInv(playerid, slot, item_id, count, value)
{
    new q[280];
    mysql_format(db_handle, q, sizeof q,
        "INSERT INTO `inventory` (`uid`, `item_id`, `count`, `slot`, `value`) VALUES (%d, %d, %d, %d, %d)",
        Player[playerid][pID], item_id, count, slot, value);
    mysql_query(db_handle, q, false);
    PlayerInventory[playerid][slot][invID] = cache_insert_id();
    return PlayerInventory[playerid][slot][invID];
}

stock Trade_DbInsertPlate(playerid, slot, inv_id)
{
    new q[300];
    mysql_format(db_handle, q, sizeof q,
        "INSERT INTO `inventory_plates` (`inv_id`, `plate_number`, `plate_region`) VALUES (%d, '%e', '%e') \
         ON DUPLICATE KEY UPDATE `plate_number`=VALUES(`plate_number`), `plate_region`=VALUES(`plate_region`)",
        inv_id, g_InvPlateNumber[playerid][slot], g_InvPlateRegion[playerid][slot]);
    mysql_query(db_handle, q, false);
    return 1;
}

stock Trade_StripOfferFromReceiver(receiver, seller, offer_slot)
{
    new item_id = Trade_NormalizeOfferItemId(g_TradeOffer[seller][offer_slot][troItem]);
    new val = g_TradeOffer[seller][offer_slot][troValue];
    new cnt = g_TradeOffer[seller][offer_slot][troCount];
    if(cnt < 1) cnt = 1;

    if(item_id == ITEM_SIM_CARD)
    {
        for(new i = 0; i < MAX_INV_SLOTS; i++)
        {
            if(PlayerInventory[receiver][i][invItem] == ITEM_SIM_CARD && PlayerInventory[receiver][i][invValue] == val)
            {
                RemoveInventorySim(receiver, i);
                return 1;
            }
        }
        return 0;
    }
    if(item_id == 134)
    {
        for(new i = 0; i < MAX_INV_SLOTS; i++)
        {
            if(PlayerInventory[receiver][i][invItem] == 134 && PlayerInventory[receiver][i][invValue] == val)
            {
                Inv_DeleteItemFromSlot(receiver, i);
                return 1;
            }
        }
        return 0;
    }
    if(IsPlateItem(item_id))
    {
        for(new i = 0; i < MAX_INV_SLOTS; i++)
        {
            if(!IsPlateItem(PlayerInventory[receiver][i][invItem])) continue;
            if(strcmp(g_InvPlateNumber[receiver][i], g_TradePlateNum[seller][offer_slot], true) != 0) continue;
            RemoveInventoryPlate(receiver, i);
            return 1;
        }
        return 0;
    }

    for(new i = 0; i < MAX_INV_SLOTS; i++)
    {
        if(Trade_NormalizeOfferItemId(PlayerInventory[receiver][i][invItem]) != item_id) continue;
        if(item_id == ITEM_FUEL_CANISTER && PlayerInventory[receiver][i][invValue] != val) continue;
        if(cnt > 1 && PlayerInventory[receiver][i][invCount] >= cnt)
        {
            while(cnt > 0 && PlayerInventory[receiver][i][invItem] == item_id)
            {
                Inv_DeleteItemFromSlot(receiver, i);
                cnt--;
            }
            return 1;
        }
        Inv_DeleteItemFromSlot(receiver, i);
        return 1;
    }
    return 0;
}

stock bool:Trade_TransferOfferToPlayer(receiver, seller, offer_slot)
{
    new item_id = Trade_NormalizeOfferItemId(g_TradeOffer[seller][offer_slot][troItem]);
    if(item_id <= 0) return true;

    new cnt = g_TradeOffer[seller][offer_slot][troCount];
    new val = g_TradeOffer[seller][offer_slot][troValue];
    if(cnt < 1) cnt = 1;
    if(item_id == 134 || item_id == ITEM_SIM_CARD || IsPlateItem(item_id) || item_id == ITEM_FUEL_CANISTER ||
        IsItemAccessory(item_id) > 0 || Inv_IsBackpackItem(item_id))
        cnt = 1;

    if(item_id == 134)
    {
        if(!GivePlayerSkin(receiver, val)) return false;
    }
    else if(item_id == ITEM_SIM_CARD)
    {
        if(!GivePlayerSimCardItem(receiver, val)) return false;
        Phone_SetSimOwner(val, Player[receiver][pID]);
    }
    else if(IsPlateItem(item_id))
    {
        new country = PlateCountryFromItem(item_id);
        if(GivePlayerPlateItem(receiver, country, g_TradePlateNum[seller][offer_slot], g_TradePlateReg[seller][offer_slot]) < 0)
            return false;
    }
    else if(item_id == ITEM_FUEL_CANISTER)
    {
        if(!GivePlayerFuelCanister(receiver, val)) return false;
    }
    else if(item_id == ITEM_MEDKIT || item_id == ITEM_REPAIR_KIT || item_id == 22 || item_id == 23)
    {
        if(!GivePlayerItem(receiver, item_id, cnt)) return false;
    }
    else
    {
        if(!GivePlayerItem(receiver, item_id, cnt)) return false;
    }

    return true;
}

stock Trade_ClearAllOffers(playerid)
{
    for(new i = 0; i < MAX_TRADE_OFFER_SLOTS; i++)
        Trade_ClearOfferSlot(playerid, i);
}

stock Trade_CollectNearby(playerid, list[], &count, max_count = MAX_TRADE_NEARBY)
{
    count = 0;
    new Float:px, Float:py, Float:pz;
    GetPlayerPos(playerid, px, py, pz);
    for(new i = 0; i < MAX_PLAYERS && count < max_count; i++)
    {
        if(i == playerid || !IsPlayerConnected(i)) continue;
        if(Player[i][pID] <= 0) continue;
        if(Trade_IsActive(i)) continue;
        new Float:tx, Float:ty, Float:tz;
        GetPlayerPos(i, tx, ty, tz);
        new Float:d = floatsqroot((px - tx) * (px - tx) + (py - ty) * (py - ty) + (pz - tz) * (pz - tz));
        if(d <= TRADE_NEAR_DIST)
            list[count++] = i;
    }
}

stock Trade_FindNearestPlayer(playerid, Float:max_dist = TRADE_NEAR_DIST)
{
    new list[MAX_TRADE_NEARBY], count;
    Trade_CollectNearby(playerid, list, count);
    if(count == 0) return INVALID_PLAYER_ID;

    new Float:px, Float:py, Float:pz;
    GetPlayerPos(playerid, px, py, pz);
    new best = list[0];
    new Float:best_d = max_dist;
    for(new c = 0; c < count; c++)
    {
        new i = list[c];
        new Float:tx, Float:ty, Float:tz;
        GetPlayerPos(i, tx, ty, tz);
        new Float:d = floatsqroot((px - tx) * (px - tx) + (py - ty) * (py - ty) + (pz - tz) * (pz - tz));
        if(d <= best_d)
        {
            best_d = d;
            best = i;
        }
    }
    return best;
}

stock Trade_ClearInvite(playerid)
{
    new from = g_TradeInviteTo[playerid];
    new to = g_TradeInviteFrom[playerid];
    if(from != INVALID_PLAYER_ID && g_TradeInviteFrom[from] == playerid)
        g_TradeInviteFrom[from] = INVALID_PLAYER_ID;
    if(to != INVALID_PLAYER_ID && g_TradeInviteTo[to] == playerid)
        g_TradeInviteTo[to] = INVALID_PLAYER_ID;
    g_TradeInviteFrom[playerid] = INVALID_PLAYER_ID;
    g_TradeInviteTo[playerid] = INVALID_PLAYER_ID;
    DeletePVar(playerid, "trade_pick");
    DeletePVar(playerid, "trade_picking");
    g_TradePickCount[playerid] = 0;
}

stock Trade_SendPlayersList(playerid)
{
    new list[MAX_TRADE_NEARBY], count;
    if(GetPVarInt(playerid, "trade_pick"))
        Trade_CollectNearby(playerid, list, count);
    else
    {
        for(new i = 0; i < MAX_PLAYERS && count < MAX_TRADE_NEARBY; i++)
        {
            if(!IsPlayerConnected(i) || Player[i][pID] <= 0) continue;
            list[count++] = i;
        }
    }

    new Node:data = JSON_Array();
    for(new c = 0; c < count; c++)
    {
        new tid = list[c];
        new Node:row = JSON_Object();
        JSON_SetInt(row, "id", tid);
        JSON_SetString(row, "nick", Player[tid][pName], strlen(Player[tid][pName]));
        JSON_SetInt(row, "level", Player[tid][pLevel]);
        JSON_SetInt(row, "ping", GetPlayerPing(tid));
        JSON_Append(data, row);
        JSON_Cleanup(row);
    }

    new Node:resp = JSON_Object();
    JSON_SetInt(resp, "t", 1);
    JSON_SetArray(resp, "data", data);
    OnPacketIncoming(playerid, 25, resp);
    JSON_Cleanup(resp);
    JSON_Cleanup(data);
}

stock Trade_ShowPickDialog(playerid)
{
    if(g_TradePickCount[playerid] <= 0) return 0;

    new valid[MAX_TRADE_NEARBY], valid_count;
    new body[768], line[96], dist[24];
    format(body, sizeof body, "˜˜˜\t˜˜˜˜˜˜˜˜˜˜\n");
    for(new i = 0; i < g_TradePickCount[playerid]; i++)
    {
        new tid = g_TradePickList[playerid][i];
        if(!IsPlayerConnected(tid) || !Trade_IsPlayerNear(playerid, tid)) continue;
        valid[valid_count++] = tid;
        Trade_GetDistMetersStr(playerid, tid, dist, sizeof dist);
        format(line, sizeof line, "%s\t%s\n", Player[tid][pName], dist);
        strcat(body, line, sizeof body);
    }
    g_TradePickCount[playerid] = valid_count;
    for(new i = 0; i < valid_count; i++)
        g_TradePickList[playerid][i] = valid[i];
    if(valid_count == 0)
    {
        Trade_NotifyError(playerid, "˜˜˜˜˜ ˜˜˜ ˜˜˜˜˜˜ ˜˜˜.");
        g_TradePickCount[playerid] = 0;
        return 0;
    }
    SetPVarInt(playerid, "trade_picking", 1);
    ShowPlayerDialog(playerid, DIALOG_TRADE_PICK, DIALOG_STYLE_TABLIST_HEADERS,
        "˜˜˜˜˜", body, "˜˜˜˜˜˜˜", "˜˜˜˜˜");
    return 1;
}

stock Trade_BeginPlayerSelect(playerid)
{
    if(Trade_IsActive(playerid))
    {
        Trade_NotifyError(playerid, "˜˜ ˜˜˜ ˜˜˜˜˜˜˜˜˜˜ ˜ ˜˜˜˜˜˜.");
        return 0;
    }
    Trade_ClearGhostTradeState(playerid);

    if(g_TradeInviteTo[playerid] != INVALID_PLAYER_ID)
    {
        Trade_NotifyError(playerid, "˜˜˜˜˜˜˜˜˜ ˜˜˜˜˜˜ ˜˜ ˜˜˜˜˜˜˜˜˜˜˜.");
        return 0;
    }

    new list[MAX_TRADE_NEARBY], count;
    Trade_CollectNearby(playerid, list, count);
    if(count == 0)
    {
        Trade_NotifyError(playerid, "˜˜˜˜˜ ˜˜˜ ˜˜˜˜˜˜ ˜˜˜.");
        return 0;
    }

    g_TradePickCount[playerid] = count;
    for(new i = 0; i < count; i++)
        g_TradePickList[playerid][i] = list[i];
    DeletePVar(playerid, "trade_pick");

    return Trade_ShowPickDialog(playerid);
}

stock Trade_SendInvite(playerid, targetid)
{
    if(!IsPlayerConnected(targetid) || targetid == playerid || Player[targetid][pID] <= 0)
        return 0;
    if(Trade_IsActive(playerid) || Trade_IsActive(targetid))
    {
        Trade_NotifyError(playerid, "˜˜˜˜ ˜˜ ˜˜˜˜˜˜˜ ˜˜˜ ˜ ˜˜˜˜˜˜.");
        return 0;
    }
    if(!Trade_IsPlayerNear(playerid, targetid))
    {
        Trade_NotifyError(playerid, "˜˜˜˜˜ ˜˜˜˜˜˜˜ ˜˜˜˜˜˜.");
        return 0;
    }
    if(g_TradeInviteTo[playerid] != INVALID_PLAYER_ID)
    {
        Trade_NotifyError(playerid, "˜˜ ˜˜˜ ˜˜˜˜˜˜˜˜˜ ˜˜˜˜˜˜˜˜˜˜˜.");
        return 0;
    }
    if(g_TradeInviteFrom[targetid] != INVALID_PLAYER_ID)
    {
        Trade_NotifyError(playerid, "˜˜˜˜ ˜˜˜˜˜ ˜˜˜ ˜˜˜˜˜˜˜ ˜˜˜˜˜˜ ˜˜˜˜˜˜˜˜˜˜˜.");
        return 0;
    }

    Trade_ClearInvite(playerid);
    Trade_ClearInvite(targetid);
    g_TradeInviteFrom[targetid] = playerid;
    g_TradeInviteTo[playerid] = targetid;

    new msg[128];
    format(msg, sizeof msg, "%s ˜˜˜˜˜˜˜˜˜˜ ˜˜˜˜˜ ˜˜˜˜˜˜˜˜˜", Player[playerid][pName]);
    ShowNotification(targetid, 4, 15, NOTIFY_TRADE_OFFER, playerid, msg, ">>");

    format(msg, sizeof msg, "˜˜˜˜˜˜˜˜˜˜˜ ˜˜ ˜˜˜˜˜ ˜˜˜˜˜˜˜˜˜˜ ˜˜˜˜˜˜ %s.", Player[targetid][pName]);
    Trade_NotifySuccess(playerid, msg);
    return 1;
}

stock Trade_AcceptInvite(playerid, fromid)
{
    if(!IsPlayerConnected(fromid) || fromid == playerid || Player[fromid][pID] <= 0)
        return 0;
    if(g_TradeInviteFrom[playerid] != fromid || g_TradeInviteTo[fromid] != playerid)
    {
        Trade_NotifyError(playerid, "˜˜˜˜˜˜˜˜˜˜˜ ˜˜˜˜˜˜˜˜.");
        return 0;
    }
    if(!Trade_IsPlayerNear(fromid, playerid))
    {
        Trade_ClearInvite(playerid);
        Trade_ClearInvite(fromid);
        Trade_NotifyError(playerid, "˜˜˜˜˜ ˜˜˜˜˜˜˜ ˜˜˜˜˜˜.");
        SendClientMessage(fromid, 0xFF6347FF, "˜˜˜˜˜ ˜˜˜˜˜˜˜: ˜˜ ˜˜˜˜˜˜˜ ˜˜˜˜˜˜.");
        return 0;
    }

    Trade_ClearInvite(playerid);
    Trade_ClearInvite(fromid);

    if(!Trade_StartPair(fromid, playerid))
    {
        SendClientMessage(playerid, 0xFF6347FF, "˜˜ ˜˜˜˜˜˜˜ ˜˜˜˜˜˜ ˜˜˜˜˜.");
        SendClientMessage(fromid, 0xFF6347FF, "˜˜ ˜˜˜˜˜˜˜ ˜˜˜˜˜˜ ˜˜˜˜˜.");
        return 0;
    }
    return 1;
}

stock bool:Trade_OnPlayersListPacket(playerid, const raw[], type)
{
    switch(type)
    {
        case 1:
        {
            Trade_SendPlayersList(playerid);
            return true;
        }
        case 2:
        {
            new sel = -1;
            if(!Tune_ExtractJsonIntField(raw, "id", sel))
                sel = -1;

            if(sel != -1 && IsPlayerConnected(sel) && Trade_SendInvite(playerid, sel))
            {
                DeletePVar(playerid, "trade_pick");
                g_TradePickCount[playerid] = 0;
                return true;
            }

            if(GetPVarInt(playerid, "trade_pick"))
            {
                DeletePVar(playerid, "trade_pick");
                Trade_ShowPickDialog(playerid);
            }
            return true;
        }
        case 3:
        {
            new sel = -1;
            if(!Tune_ExtractJsonIntField(raw, "id", sel))
                sel = -1;
            if(sel != -1 && IsPlayerConnected(sel))
                Trade_SendInvite(playerid, sel);
            DeletePVar(playerid, "trade_pick");
            g_TradePickCount[playerid] = 0;
            return true;
        }
    }
    return false;
}

stock Trade_FindEmptyOfferSlot(playerid)
{
    for(new i = 0; i < MAX_TRADE_OFFER_SLOTS; i++)
        if(g_TradeOffer[playerid][i][troItem] == 0) return i;
    return -1;
}

stock Trade_GetOfferWeight(playerid)
{
    new total;
    for(new i = 0; i < MAX_TRADE_OFFER_SLOTS; i++)
    {
        if(g_TradeOffer[playerid][i][troItem] <= 0) continue;
        new cnt = g_TradeOffer[playerid][i][troCount];
        if(cnt < 1) cnt = 1;
        total += Inventory_GetItemUnitWeight(g_TradeOffer[playerid][i][troItem]) * cnt;
    }
    return total;
}

stock Trade_FormatPlateNt(playerid, offer_slot, nt[], nt_size)
{
    nt[0] = '\0';
    if(offer_slot < 0 || offer_slot >= MAX_TRADE_OFFER_SLOTS) return;
    if(strlen(g_TradePlateNum[playerid][offer_slot]) == 0)
    {
        format(nt, nt_size, "%s", g_TradePlateNum[playerid][offer_slot]);
        return;
    }
    if(strlen(g_TradePlateReg[playerid][offer_slot]) > 0)
        format(nt, nt_size, "%s|%s", g_TradePlateNum[playerid][offer_slot], g_TradePlateReg[playerid][offer_slot]);
    else
        format(nt, nt_size, "%s", g_TradePlateNum[playerid][offer_slot]);
}

stock Trade_GetNotifyValue(item_id, count, value)
{
    if(item_id == ITEM_SIM_CARD) return value;
    if(item_id == 134) return value;
    if(IsPlateItem(item_id)) return 1;
    return count;
}

stock Trade_NotifyPartnerAdd(playerid, offer_slot)
{
    new partner = Trade_GetPartner(playerid);
    if(partner == INVALID_PLAYER_ID) return;
    new item_id = g_TradeOffer[playerid][offer_slot][troItem];
    if(item_id <= 0) return;

    new nt[48], esc_nt[64];
    Trade_FormatPlateNt(playerid, offer_slot, nt, sizeof nt);
    Inv_EscapeJsonString(nt, esc_nt, sizeof esc_nt);

    new buf[192];
    format(buf, sizeof buf, "{\"t\":0,\"s\":%d,\"ga\":%d,\"nt\":\"%s\"}",
        Trade_GetNotifyValue(item_id, g_TradeOffer[playerid][offer_slot][troCount], g_TradeOffer[playerid][offer_slot][troValue]),
        item_id, esc_nt);
    Trade_SendJsonStr(partner, buf);
}

stock Trade_NotifyPartnerRemove(playerid, item_id, sub_val, nt[])
{
    new partner = Trade_GetPartner(playerid);
    if(partner == INVALID_PLAYER_ID) return;

    new esc_nt[64];
    Inv_EscapeJsonString(nt, esc_nt, sizeof esc_nt);
    new buf[128];
    format(buf, sizeof buf, "{\"t\":1,\"s\":%d,\"ga\":%d,\"nt\":\"%s\"}", sub_val, item_id, esc_nt);
    Trade_SendJsonStr(partner, buf);
}

stock Trade_NotifyPartnerMoney(playerid)
{
    new partner = Trade_GetPartner(playerid);
    if(partner == INVALID_PLAYER_ID) return;

    new buf[64];
    format(buf, sizeof buf, "{\"t\":3,\"s\":1,\"gm\":%d}", g_TradeMoney[playerid]);
    Trade_SendJsonStr(partner, buf);
}

// ˜˜˜˜˜˜ ˜ ˜˜˜ ˜˜˜˜˜˜ (GUI 33, t:31) ˜ ˜˜˜˜˜ ˜ ˜˜˜˜˜ ˜˜˜˜˜˜.
stock Trade_SendTradeChatLine(playerid, const msg[])
{
    if(!IsPlayerConnected(playerid) || !strlen(msg)) return 0;
    new esc[256], pkt[320];
    Inv_EscapeJsonString(msg, esc, sizeof esc);
    format(pkt, sizeof pkt, "{\"t\":31,\"tx\":\"%s\"}", esc);
    Trade_SendJsonStr(playerid, pkt);
    return 1;
}

stock Trade_NotifyMoneyInExchangeChat(playerid, amount)
{
    #pragma unused amount
    new partner = Trade_GetPartner(playerid);
    if(partner == INVALID_PLAYER_ID) return 0;

    // ˜˜˜˜˜˜ t:3 ˜ ˜˜˜˜˜˜ ˜˜˜ ˜˜˜˜˜˜ ˜˜˜˜˜˜ ˜ ˜˜˜˜ ˜˜˜˜˜˜ (˜˜˜ ˜˜˜˜˜ t:31).
    Trade_NotifyPartnerMoney(playerid);
    return 1;
}

stock Trade_ShowMoneyDialog(playerid)
{
    if(!Trade_IsActive(playerid)) return 0;
    ShowPlayerDialog(playerid, DIALOG_TRADE_MONEY, DIALOG_STYLE_INPUT,
        "˜˜˜˜˜˜˜ ˜˜˜˜˜",
        "˜˜˜˜˜ ˜˜˜˜˜ ˜˜ ˜˜˜˜˜˜ ˜˜˜˜˜˜˜˜?",
        "˜˜˜˜˜˜˜˜˜˜˜", "˜˜˜˜˜˜");
    return 1;
}

stock bool:Trade_ApplyMoneyAmount(playerid, amount, bool:from_dialog)
{
    if(!Trade_IsActive(playerid)) return false;

    new partner = Trade_GetPartner(playerid);
    if(partner == INVALID_PLAYER_ID)
    {
        Trade_Cancel(playerid, true);
        return false;
    }

    if(amount < 0) amount = 0;
    if(amount > TRADE_MAX_MONEY) amount = TRADE_MAX_MONEY;
    if(amount > GetPlayerMoneyEx(playerid))
    {
        Trade_SendSimple(playerid, 6, 0);
        Trade_NotifyError(playerid, "˜˜˜˜˜˜˜˜˜˜˜˜ ˜˜˜˜˜ ˜˜˜ ˜˜˜˜˜˜˜.");
        return false;
    }

    g_TradeMoney[playerid] = amount;
    g_TradeReady[playerid] = false;
    g_TradeReady[partner] = false;
    g_TradeFinal[playerid] = false;
    g_TradeFinal[partner] = false;
    Trade_SendStatus(playerid, 2);
    Trade_SendStatus(partner, 2);

    // t:6 s:1 ˜˜˜˜˜˜ ˜˜˜˜˜ ˜˜˜˜˜ ˜ CEF-˜˜˜˜ (˜˜˜ exchangeYourMoney ˜˜˜ ˜˜˜˜˜˜˜˜).
    // ˜˜˜˜˜ SA-MP ˜˜˜˜˜˜˜ t:6 s:1 ˜˜˜˜˜˜˜˜ ˜˜˜˜˜ ˜˜ ˜˜˜˜˜˜ ˜ ˜˜˜ ˜˜˜˜˜˜ t:3 ˜˜˜˜˜˜ (˜˜˜ ˜˜˜˜˜˜ ˜˜˜˜˜˜).
    if(!from_dialog)
    {
        new mbuf[64];
        format(mbuf, sizeof mbuf, "{\"t\":6,\"s\":1,\"gm\":%d}", amount);
        Trade_SendJsonStr(playerid, mbuf);
    }

    Trade_NotifyMoneyInExchangeChat(playerid, amount);

    new toast[80];
    if(amount > 0)
        format(toast, sizeof toast, "˜˜˜˜˜˜˜ %d ˜˜˜. ˜˜˜˜˜˜˜˜˜˜˜.", amount);
    else
        format(toast, sizeof toast, "˜˜˜˜˜˜˜ ˜˜˜˜˜.");
    Trade_ExchangeToast(playerid, toast);
    return true;
}

stock Trade_ReturnOfferToInventory(playerid, offer_slot, inv_slot)
{
    new item_id = g_TradeOffer[playerid][offer_slot][troItem];
    if(item_id <= 0) return 0;

    new cnt = g_TradeOffer[playerid][offer_slot][troCount];
    new val = g_TradeOffer[playerid][offer_slot][troValue];

    if(IsPlateItem(item_id))
    {
        if(inv_slot < 0 || inv_slot >= MAX_INV_SLOTS || PlayerInventory[playerid][inv_slot][invItem] != 0)
            inv_slot = -1;
        if(inv_slot == -1)
        {
            for(new i = 0; i < MAX_INV_SLOTS; i++)
            {
                if(PlayerInventory[playerid][i][invItem] == 0) { inv_slot = i; break; }
            }
        }
        if(inv_slot == -1) return 0;

        new country = PlateCountryFromItem(item_id);
        if(GivePlayerPlateItem(playerid, country,
            g_TradePlateNum[playerid][offer_slot], g_TradePlateReg[playerid][offer_slot]) < 0)
            return 0;
    }
    else if(item_id == 134)
    {
        if(inv_slot < 0 || inv_slot >= MAX_INV_SLOTS || PlayerInventory[playerid][inv_slot][invItem] != 0)
        {
            if(!GivePlayerSkin(playerid, val)) return 0;
        }
        else
        {
            PlayerInventory[playerid][inv_slot][invItem] = 134;
            PlayerInventory[playerid][inv_slot][invCount] = 1;
            PlayerInventory[playerid][inv_slot][invValue] = val;
            new q[256];
            mysql_format(db_handle, q, sizeof q,
                "INSERT INTO `inventory` (`uid`, `item_id`, `count`, `slot`, `value`) VALUES (%d, 134, 1, %d, %d)",
                Player[playerid][pID], inv_slot, val);
            mysql_tquery(db_handle, q, "OnItemInserted", "ii", playerid, inv_slot);
        }
    }
    else if(item_id == ITEM_SIM_CARD)
    {
        if(!GivePlayerSimCardItem(playerid, val)) return 0;
    }
    else if(item_id == ITEM_FUEL_CANISTER)
    {
        if(!GivePlayerFuelCanister(playerid, val)) return 0;
    }
    else
    {
        if(inv_slot >= 0 && inv_slot < MAX_INV_SLOTS &&
            PlayerInventory[playerid][inv_slot][invItem] == item_id &&
            PlayerInventory[playerid][inv_slot][invCount] < MAX_ITEM_STACK)
        {
            new can = MAX_ITEM_STACK - PlayerInventory[playerid][inv_slot][invCount];
            new add = (cnt > can) ? can : cnt;
            PlayerInventory[playerid][inv_slot][invCount] += add;
            cnt -= add;
            new q[128];
            mysql_format(db_handle, q, sizeof q, "UPDATE `inventory` SET `count`=%d WHERE `id`=%d",
                PlayerInventory[playerid][inv_slot][invCount], PlayerInventory[playerid][inv_slot][invID]);
            mysql_tquery(db_handle, q);
        }
        while(cnt > 0)
        {
            if(!GivePlayerItem(playerid, item_id, cnt)) return 0;
            cnt = 0;
        }
    }

    Trade_ClearOfferSlot(playerid, offer_slot);
    return 1;
}

stock Trade_RemoveFromInventorySlot(playerid, inv_slot, item_id, amount, &out_val = 0)
{
    if(inv_slot < 0 || inv_slot >= MAX_INV_SLOTS) return 0;
    if(PlayerInventory[playerid][inv_slot][invItem] != item_id) return 0;

    out_val = PlayerInventory[playerid][inv_slot][invValue];

    if(item_id == 134 || item_id == ITEM_SIM_CARD || IsPlateItem(item_id) || item_id == ITEM_FUEL_CANISTER)
    {
        if(item_id == ITEM_SIM_CARD && Player[playerid][pSimCard] == out_val && out_val > 0)
            SetPlayerSimCardSilent(playerid, 0);
        if(IsPlateItem(item_id))
            RemoveInventoryPlate(playerid, inv_slot);
        else
        {
            new q[128];
            mysql_format(db_handle, q, sizeof q, "DELETE FROM `inventory` WHERE `id`=%d", PlayerInventory[playerid][inv_slot][invID]);
            mysql_tquery(db_handle, q);
            PlayerInventory[playerid][inv_slot][invID] = 0;
            PlayerInventory[playerid][inv_slot][invItem] = 0;
            PlayerInventory[playerid][inv_slot][invCount] = 0;
            PlayerInventory[playerid][inv_slot][invValue] = 0;
        }
        return 1;
    }

    if(PlayerInventory[playerid][inv_slot][invCount] <= amount)
    {
        amount = PlayerInventory[playerid][inv_slot][invCount];
        new q[128];
        mysql_format(db_handle, q, sizeof q, "DELETE FROM `inventory` WHERE `id`=%d", PlayerInventory[playerid][inv_slot][invID]);
        mysql_tquery(db_handle, q);
        PlayerInventory[playerid][inv_slot][invID] = 0;
        PlayerInventory[playerid][inv_slot][invItem] = 0;
        PlayerInventory[playerid][inv_slot][invCount] = 0;
        PlayerInventory[playerid][inv_slot][invValue] = 0;
    }
    else
    {
        PlayerInventory[playerid][inv_slot][invCount] -= amount;
        new q[128];
        mysql_format(db_handle, q, sizeof q, "UPDATE `inventory` SET `count`=%d WHERE `id`=%d",
            PlayerInventory[playerid][inv_slot][invCount], PlayerInventory[playerid][inv_slot][invID]);
        mysql_tquery(db_handle, q);
    }
    return amount;
}

stock Trade_Cancel(playerid, bool:notify_self)
{
    if(!Trade_IsActive(playerid))
    {
        Trade_ClearGhostTradeState(playerid);
        if(notify_self)
        {
            Trade_SendSimple(playerid, 7, 3);
            Trade_SendSimple(playerid, 16, 0);
        }
        return INVALID_PLAYER_ID;
    }

    new partner = Trade_GetPartner(playerid);

    for(new i = 0; i < MAX_TRADE_OFFER_SLOTS; i++)
    {
        if(g_TradeOffer[playerid][i][troItem] <= 0) continue;
        new inv_slot = g_TradeOffer[playerid][i][troInvSlot];
        if(!Trade_ReturnOfferToInventory(playerid, i, inv_slot))
        {
            inv_slot = Trade_FindFreeInvSlot(playerid);
            if(inv_slot != -1)
                Trade_ReturnOfferToInventory(playerid, i, inv_slot);
        }
    }

    if(g_TradeMoney[playerid] > 0)
    {
        g_TradeMoney[playerid] = 0;
        Trade_NotifyPartnerMoney(playerid);
    }

    Trade_ResetPlayer(playerid);

    if(notify_self)
    {
        Trade_SendStatus(playerid, 3);
        Trade_SendSimple(playerid, 16, 0);
        SendClientMessage(playerid, 0xFFD900FF, "˜˜˜˜˜ ˜˜˜˜˜˜˜.");
    }
    if(partner != INVALID_PLAYER_ID)
        Trade_SendSimple(partner, 16, 0);
    return partner;
}

stock Trade_EndSession(playerid, partner, bool:notify_msg)
{
    Trade_Cancel(playerid, false);
    if(partner != INVALID_PLAYER_ID && IsPlayerConnected(partner))
    {
        Trade_Cancel(partner, false);
        Trade_SendStatus(partner, 3);
        if(notify_msg)
            SendClientMessage(partner, 0xFFD900FF, "˜˜˜˜˜ ˜ ˜˜˜˜˜˜˜ ˜˜˜˜˜˜˜˜.");
    }
    if(notify_msg)
        SendClientMessage(playerid, 0xFFD900FF, "˜˜˜˜˜ ˜ ˜˜˜˜˜˜˜ ˜˜˜˜˜˜˜˜.");
}

stock Trade_OnDisconnect(playerid)
{
    Trade_ClearInvite(playerid);
    if(!Trade_IsActive(playerid)) return;
    new partner = Trade_GetPartner(playerid);
    Trade_Cancel(playerid, false);
    if(partner != INVALID_PLAYER_ID)
    {
        Trade_Cancel(partner, false);
        Trade_SendStatus(partner, 3);
        SendClientMessage(partner, 0xFFD900FF, "˜˜˜˜˜ ˜˜˜˜˜˜˜: ˜˜˜˜˜˜˜˜˜˜ ˜˜˜˜˜ ˜˜ ˜˜˜˜.");
    }
}

stock bool:Trade_StartPair(playerid, targetid)
{
    if(!IsPlayerConnected(playerid) || !IsPlayerConnected(targetid) || playerid == targetid)
        return false;
    if(Trade_IsActive(playerid) || Trade_IsActive(targetid))
        return false;

    new Float:px, Float:py, Float:pz, Float:tx, Float:ty, Float:tz;
    GetPlayerPos(playerid, px, py, pz);
    GetPlayerPos(targetid, tx, ty, tz);
    if(floatsqroot((px - tx) * (px - tx) + (py - ty) * (py - ty) + (pz - tz) * (pz - tz)) > TRADE_NEAR_DIST)
        return false;

    Trade_ResetPlayer(playerid);
    Trade_ResetPlayer(targetid);
    g_TradePartner[playerid] = targetid;
    g_TradePartner[targetid] = playerid;
    SetPVarInt(playerid, "trade_peer", targetid);
    SetPVarInt(targetid, "trade_peer", playerid);

    Trade_MarkSessionOpened(playerid);
    Trade_MarkSessionOpened(targetid);

    Trade_PushExchangeUi(playerid, targetid);
    Trade_PushExchangeUi(targetid, playerid);

    // s=2 ˜ ˜˜˜˜˜˜˜˜˜˜˜˜˜˜ ˜˜˜˜˜ ˜ ˜˜˜˜ ˜˜˜˜˜ (s=1 ˜˜˜˜˜˜˜˜˜ ˜˜˜˜˜ ˜ BR-˜˜˜˜˜˜˜)
    Trade_SendStatus(playerid, 2);
    Trade_SendStatus(targetid, 2);

    new msg[96], name[MAX_PLAYER_NAME];
    GetPlayerName(targetid, name, sizeof name);
    format(msg, sizeof msg, "˜˜ ˜˜˜˜˜˜ ˜˜˜˜˜ ˜ %s.", name);
    SendClientMessage(playerid, 0xFFD900FF, msg);
    GetPlayerName(playerid, name, sizeof name);
    format(msg, sizeof msg, "%s ˜˜˜˜˜˜˜˜˜˜ ˜˜˜ ˜˜˜˜˜.", name);
    SendClientMessage(targetid, 0xFFD900FF, msg);
    return true;
}

stock bool:Trade_ExecutePair(playerid, partner)
{
    if(g_TradeMoney[playerid] > GetPlayerMoneyEx(playerid) || g_TradeMoney[partner] > GetPlayerMoneyEx(partner))
    {
        Trade_NotifyError(playerid, "˜˜˜˜˜˜˜˜˜˜˜˜ ˜˜˜˜˜ ˜˜˜ ˜˜˜˜˜˜.");
        Trade_NotifyError(partner, "˜˜˜˜˜˜˜˜˜˜˜˜ ˜˜˜˜˜ ˜˜˜ ˜˜˜˜˜˜.");
        return false;
    }

    if(!Trade_CanReceiveOffers(partner, playerid) || !Trade_CanReceiveOffers(playerid, partner))
    {
        Trade_NotifyError(playerid, "˜˜˜˜˜ ˜˜˜˜˜˜˜˜˜˜: ˜˜˜ ˜˜˜˜˜ ˜˜˜ ˜˜˜˜˜˜˜˜ ˜˜˜.");
        Trade_NotifyError(partner, "˜˜˜˜˜ ˜˜˜˜˜˜˜˜˜˜: ˜˜˜ ˜˜˜˜˜ ˜˜˜ ˜˜˜˜˜˜˜˜ ˜˜˜.");
        return false;
    }

    new bool:transfer_ok = true;

    for(new i = 0; i < MAX_TRADE_OFFER_SLOTS; i++)
    {
        if(g_TradeOffer[playerid][i][troItem] <= 0) continue;
        if(!Trade_TransferOfferToPlayer(partner, playerid, i))
            transfer_ok = false;
    }
    for(new i = 0; i < MAX_TRADE_OFFER_SLOTS; i++)
    {
        if(g_TradeOffer[partner][i][troItem] <= 0) continue;
        if(!Trade_TransferOfferToPlayer(playerid, partner, i))
            transfer_ok = false;
    }

    if(!transfer_ok)
    {
        for(new i = 0; i < MAX_TRADE_OFFER_SLOTS; i++)
        {
            if(g_TradeOffer[playerid][i][troItem] <= 0) continue;
            Trade_StripOfferFromReceiver(partner, playerid, i);
        }
        for(new i = 0; i < MAX_TRADE_OFFER_SLOTS; i++)
        {
            if(g_TradeOffer[partner][i][troItem] <= 0) continue;
            Trade_StripOfferFromReceiver(playerid, partner, i);
        }
        Trade_NotifyError(playerid, "˜˜˜˜˜˜ ˜˜˜˜˜˜: ˜˜˜˜˜˜˜˜ ˜˜ ˜˜˜˜˜˜˜˜.");
        Trade_NotifyError(partner, "˜˜˜˜˜˜ ˜˜˜˜˜˜: ˜˜˜˜˜˜˜˜ ˜˜ ˜˜˜˜˜˜˜˜.");
        Trade_Cancel(playerid, false);
        Trade_Cancel(partner, false);
        Trade_SendStatus(playerid, 2);
        Trade_SendStatus(partner, 2);
        return false;
    }

    for(new i = 0; i < MAX_TRADE_OFFER_SLOTS; i++)
    {
        if(g_TradeOffer[playerid][i][troItem] > 0)
            Trade_ClearOfferSlot(playerid, i);
        if(g_TradeOffer[partner][i][troItem] > 0)
            Trade_ClearOfferSlot(partner, i);
    }

    SetPVarInt(playerid, "trade_no_money_notify", 1);
    SetPVarInt(partner, "trade_no_money_notify", 1);

    new money_msg[96], money_str[24];

    if(g_TradeMoney[playerid] > 0)
    {
        GivePlayerMoneyEx(playerid, -g_TradeMoney[playerid]);
        GivePlayerMoneyEx(partner, g_TradeMoney[playerid]);
        ConvertMoney(g_TradeMoney[playerid], money_str);
        format(money_msg, sizeof money_msg, "˜˜ ˜˜˜˜˜˜˜˜˜ %s ˜˜˜.", money_str);
        Trade_NotifySuccess(playerid, money_msg);
        format(money_msg, sizeof money_msg, "˜˜ ˜˜˜˜˜˜˜˜ %s ˜˜˜.", money_str);
        Trade_NotifySuccess(partner, money_msg);
    }
    if(g_TradeMoney[partner] > 0)
    {
        GivePlayerMoneyEx(partner, -g_TradeMoney[partner]);
        GivePlayerMoneyEx(playerid, g_TradeMoney[partner]);
        ConvertMoney(g_TradeMoney[partner], money_str);
        format(money_msg, sizeof money_msg, "˜˜ ˜˜˜˜˜˜˜˜˜ %s ˜˜˜.", money_str);
        Trade_NotifySuccess(partner, money_msg);
        format(money_msg, sizeof money_msg, "˜˜ ˜˜˜˜˜˜˜˜ %s ˜˜˜.", money_str);
        Trade_NotifySuccess(playerid, money_msg);
    }

    DeletePVar(playerid, "trade_no_money_notify");
    DeletePVar(partner, "trade_no_money_notify");

    g_TradeMoney[playerid] = 0;
    g_TradeMoney[partner] = 0;

    Trade_ResetPlayer(playerid);
    Trade_ResetPlayer(partner);

    Trade_NotifySuccess(playerid, "˜˜˜˜˜ ˜˜˜˜˜˜˜ ˜˜˜˜˜˜˜˜.");
    Trade_NotifySuccess(partner, "˜˜˜˜˜ ˜˜˜˜˜˜˜ ˜˜˜˜˜˜˜˜.");

    Trade_SendSimple(playerid, 16, 0);
    Trade_SendSimple(partner, 16, 0);
    return true;
}

stock bool:Trade_OnInventoryPacket(playerid, const raw[], type)
{
    if(type == 25)
    {
        Trade_BeginPlayerSelect(playerid);
        return true;
    }

    if(Trade_IsTradePacket(type))
        Trade_TryRestoreSession(playerid);

    if(!Trade_IsActive(playerid))
        return false;

    if(g_TradeReady[playerid] || g_TradeFinal[playerid])
    {
        if(type == 5 || type == 24 || type == 6 || type == 27)
        {
            Trade_SendSimple(playerid, type, 0);
            return true;
        }
    }

    new partner = Trade_GetPartner(playerid);
    if(partner == INVALID_PLAYER_ID)
    {
        Trade_Cancel(playerid, true);
        return true;
    }

    new item_id, amount, inv_slot, offer_slot, val;

    switch(type)
    {
        case 5:
        {
            if(!Tune_ExtractJsonIntField(raw, "ga", item_id)) item_id = 0;
            if(!Tune_ExtractJsonIntField(raw, "s", amount)) amount = 0;
            if(!Tune_ExtractJsonIntField(raw, "os", inv_slot)) inv_slot = -1;

            new pkt_ga = item_id, resolved_slot = inv_slot;
            if(!Inv_CorrectPacketInvSlot(playerid, pkt_ga, inv_slot, amount, resolved_slot, false))
            {
                Trade_SendSimple(playerid, 5, 0);
                return true;
            }
            inv_slot = resolved_slot;
            item_id = PlayerInventory[playerid][inv_slot][invItem];
            if(IsItemAccessory(item_id) > 0 && PlayerInventory[playerid][inv_slot][invValue] == 1)
            {
                Inv_RemoveWornAttach(playerid, item_id);
                PlayerInventory[playerid][inv_slot][invValue] = 0;
            }
            if(inv_slot < 0 || inv_slot >= MAX_INV_SLOTS || item_id <= 0)
            {
                Trade_SendSimple(playerid, 5, 0);
                return true;
            }

            if(item_id == 134 || item_id == ITEM_SIM_CARD || IsPlateItem(item_id))
                amount = PlayerInventory[playerid][inv_slot][invValue];
            else if(item_id == ITEM_FUEL_CANISTER)
                amount = PlayerInventory[playerid][inv_slot][invValue];
            else if(amount < 1)
                amount = 1;
            else if(amount > PlayerInventory[playerid][inv_slot][invCount])
                amount = PlayerInventory[playerid][inv_slot][invCount];

            offer_slot = Trade_FindEmptyOfferSlot(playerid);
            if(offer_slot == -1)
            {
                Trade_SendSimple(playerid, 5, 0);
                return true;
            }

            val = 0;
            new plate_tmp[16], plate_reg_tmp[8];
            plate_tmp[0] = '\0';
            plate_reg_tmp[0] = '\0';
            if(IsPlateItem(item_id))
            {
                format(plate_tmp, sizeof plate_tmp, "%s", g_InvPlateNumber[playerid][inv_slot]);
                format(plate_reg_tmp, sizeof plate_reg_tmp, "%s", g_InvPlateRegion[playerid][inv_slot]);
            }

            g_TradeOffer[playerid][offer_slot][troInvID] = PlayerInventory[playerid][inv_slot][invID];

            if(!Trade_RemoveFromInventorySlot(playerid, inv_slot, item_id, amount, val))
            {
                Trade_SendSimple(playerid, 5, 0);
                return true;
            }

            g_TradeOffer[playerid][offer_slot][troItem] = Inv_PacketItemId(item_id);
            if(g_TradeOffer[playerid][offer_slot][troItem] <= 0)
                g_TradeOffer[playerid][offer_slot][troItem] = item_id;
            g_TradeOffer[playerid][offer_slot][troInvSlot] = inv_slot;
            if(item_id == 134 || item_id == ITEM_SIM_CARD || item_id == ITEM_FUEL_CANISTER)
            {
                g_TradeOffer[playerid][offer_slot][troCount] = 1;
                g_TradeOffer[playerid][offer_slot][troValue] = amount;
            }
            else if(IsPlateItem(item_id))
            {
                g_TradeOffer[playerid][offer_slot][troCount] = 1;
                g_TradeOffer[playerid][offer_slot][troValue] = 0;
                format(g_TradePlateNum[playerid][offer_slot], 16, "%s", plate_tmp);
                format(g_TradePlateReg[playerid][offer_slot], 8, "%s", plate_reg_tmp);
            }
            else
            {
                g_TradeOffer[playerid][offer_slot][troCount] = amount;
                g_TradeOffer[playerid][offer_slot][troValue] = 0;
            }

            g_TradeReady[playerid] = false;
            g_TradeReady[partner] = false;
            g_TradeFinal[playerid] = false;
            g_TradeFinal[partner] = false;
            Trade_SendStatus(playerid, 2);
            Trade_SendStatus(partner, 2);

            Trade_SendResultFull(playerid, 5, 1, Inventory_GetTotalWeight(playerid));
            Trade_NotifyPartnerAdd(playerid, offer_slot);
            return true;
        }
        case 24:
        {
            if(!Tune_ExtractJsonIntField(raw, "ga", item_id)) item_id = 0;
            if(!Tune_ExtractJsonIntField(raw, "s", amount)) amount = 0;
            if(!Tune_ExtractJsonIntField(raw, "sl", inv_slot))
                Tune_ExtractJsonIntField(raw, "os", inv_slot);

            offer_slot = -1;
            for(new i = 0; i < MAX_TRADE_OFFER_SLOTS; i++)
            {
                if(g_TradeOffer[playerid][i][troItem] != item_id) continue;
                if(item_id == 134 || item_id == ITEM_SIM_CARD)
                {
                    if(g_TradeOffer[playerid][i][troValue] == amount) { offer_slot = i; break; }
                }
                else if(IsPlateItem(item_id))
                {
                    offer_slot = i;
                    break;
                }
                else if(g_TradeOffer[playerid][i][troCount] >= amount)
                {
                    offer_slot = i;
                    break;
                }
            }

            if(offer_slot == -1)
            {
                Trade_SendSimple(playerid, 24, 0);
                return true;
            }

            new nt[48];
            Trade_FormatPlateNt(playerid, offer_slot, nt, sizeof nt);
            new notify_val = Trade_GetNotifyValue(item_id, amount, g_TradeOffer[playerid][offer_slot][troValue]);

            if(item_id == 134 || item_id == ITEM_SIM_CARD || IsPlateItem(item_id) || item_id == ITEM_FUEL_CANISTER)
            {
                if(!Trade_ReturnOfferToInventory(playerid, offer_slot, inv_slot))
                {
                    Trade_SendSimple(playerid, 24, 0);
                    return true;
                }
            }
            else
            {
                new ret_cnt = amount;
                if(ret_cnt > g_TradeOffer[playerid][offer_slot][troCount])
                    ret_cnt = g_TradeOffer[playerid][offer_slot][troCount];

                if(ret_cnt >= g_TradeOffer[playerid][offer_slot][troCount])
                {
                    if(!Trade_ReturnOfferToInventory(playerid, offer_slot, inv_slot))
                    {
                        Trade_SendSimple(playerid, 24, 0);
                        return true;
                    }
                }
                else
                {
                    g_TradeOffer[playerid][offer_slot][troCount] -= ret_cnt;
                    if(inv_slot < 0 || inv_slot >= MAX_INV_SLOTS)
                    {
                        Trade_SendSimple(playerid, 24, 0);
                        return true;
                    }
                    if(PlayerInventory[playerid][inv_slot][invItem] == item_id &&
                        PlayerInventory[playerid][inv_slot][invCount] < MAX_ITEM_STACK)
                    {
                        PlayerInventory[playerid][inv_slot][invCount] += ret_cnt;
                        new q[128];
                        mysql_format(db_handle, q, sizeof q, "UPDATE `inventory` SET `count`=%d WHERE `id`=%d",
                            PlayerInventory[playerid][inv_slot][invCount], PlayerInventory[playerid][inv_slot][invID]);
                        mysql_tquery(db_handle, q);
                    }
                    else if(!GivePlayerItem(playerid, item_id, ret_cnt))
                    {
                        g_TradeOffer[playerid][offer_slot][troCount] += ret_cnt;
                        Trade_SendSimple(playerid, 24, 0);
                        return true;
                    }
                }
            }

            g_TradeReady[playerid] = false;
            g_TradeReady[partner] = false;
            g_TradeFinal[playerid] = false;
            g_TradeFinal[partner] = false;
            Trade_SendStatus(playerid, 2);
            Trade_SendStatus(partner, 2);

            Trade_SendResultFull(playerid, 24, 1, Inventory_GetTotalWeight(playerid));
            Trade_NotifyPartnerRemove(playerid, item_id, notify_val, nt);
            return true;
        }
        case 6:
        {
            if(!Tune_ExtractJsonIntField(raw, "em", amount))
                amount = 0;

            if(amount <= 0)
            {
                Trade_ShowMoneyDialog(playerid);
                return true;
            }

            if(!Trade_ApplyMoneyAmount(playerid, amount, false))
                Trade_SendSimple(playerid, 6, 0);
            return true;
        }
        case 34:
        {
            Trade_ShowMoneyDialog(playerid);
            return true;
        }
        case 7:
        {
            new partner_cancel = Trade_Cancel(playerid, true);
            if(partner_cancel != INVALID_PLAYER_ID)
            {
                Trade_Cancel(partner_cancel, false);
                Trade_SendStatus(partner_cancel, 3);
                SendClientMessage(partner_cancel, 0xFFD900FF, "˜˜˜˜˜ ˜˜˜˜˜˜˜ ˜˜˜˜˜˜˜.");
            }
            return true;
        }
        case 8:
        {
            if(g_TradeReady[playerid])
                return true;

            g_TradeReady[playerid] = true;
            Trade_SendStatus(playerid, 1);

            if(!g_TradeReady[partner])
            {
                // ˜˜ ˜˜˜ t:8 ˜˜˜˜˜˜˜˜ ˜ ˜˜˜˜˜˜ ˜˜˜˜˜˜ exchangeStatus=1 ˜ ˜˜˜˜˜˜ ˜˜˜˜˜˜˜˜˜˜˜˜ ˜˜˜˜˜˜˜˜ ˜˜˜˜˜˜˜˜.
                Trade_SendStatus(partner, 2);
                Trade_NotifySuccess(playerid, "˜˜ ˜˜˜˜˜˜˜˜˜˜˜ ˜˜˜˜˜. ˜˜˜˜˜ ˜˜˜˜˜˜˜ ˜˜˜˜˜˜.");
                Trade_NotifySuccess(partner, "˜˜˜˜˜ ˜˜˜˜˜. ˜˜˜˜˜˜˜ ˜˜˜˜˜˜˜˜˜˜˜˜.");
            }
            else
            {
                Trade_SendStatus(playerid, 2);
                Trade_SendStatus(partner, 2);
                Trade_SendJsonStr(playerid, "{\"t\":26,\"s\":1}");
                Trade_SendJsonStr(partner, "{\"t\":26,\"s\":1}");
                Trade_NotifySuccess(playerid, "˜˜˜ ˜˜˜˜˜˜. ˜˜˜˜˜˜˜ ˜˜˜˜˜˜˜˜˜˜˜˜˜.");
                Trade_NotifySuccess(partner, "˜˜˜ ˜˜˜˜˜˜. ˜˜˜˜˜˜˜ ˜˜˜˜˜˜˜˜˜˜˜˜˜.");
            }
            return true;
        }
        case 9:
        {
            if(!g_TradeReady[playerid] || !g_TradeReady[partner])
            {
                Trade_NotifyError(playerid, "˜˜˜˜˜˜˜ ˜˜˜ ˜˜˜˜˜˜ ˜˜˜˜˜˜ ˜˜˜˜˜˜˜˜˜˜˜ ˜˜˜˜˜.");
                return true;
            }
            if(g_TradeFinal[playerid])
                return true;

            g_TradeFinal[playerid] = true;

            if(g_TradeFinal[partner])
            {
                if(Trade_ExecutePair(playerid, partner))
                    Trade_EndSession(playerid, partner, false);
                else
                {
                    g_TradeFinal[playerid] = false;
                    g_TradeFinal[partner] = false;
                    g_TradeReady[playerid] = false;
                    g_TradeReady[partner] = false;
                    Trade_SendStatus(playerid, 2);
                    Trade_SendStatus(partner, 2);
                }
            }
            else
                Trade_NotifySuccess(playerid, "˜˜˜˜˜˜˜˜ ˜˜˜˜˜˜˜˜˜˜˜˜˜ ˜˜ ˜˜˜˜˜˜.");
            return true;
        }
        case 16:
        {
            if(Trade_ShouldIgnoreClosePacket(playerid))
                return true;

            DeletePVar(playerid, "inv_gui_open");
            new p = Trade_GetPartner(playerid);
            Trade_Cancel(playerid, true);
            if(p != INVALID_PLAYER_ID)
            {
                Trade_Cancel(p, false);
                Trade_SendStatus(p, 3);
                Trade_SendSimple(p, 16, 0);
                SendClientMessage(p, 0xFFD900FF, "˜˜˜˜˜ ˜˜˜˜˜˜ ˜˜˜˜ ˜˜˜˜˜˜.");
            }
            return true;
        }
        case 27:
        {
            new buf[128];
            if(!Tune_ExtractJsonIntField(raw, "ga", item_id)) item_id = 0;
            if(!Tune_ExtractJsonIntField(raw, "s", inv_slot)) inv_slot = -1;

            if(inv_slot < 0 || inv_slot >= MAX_INV_SLOTS || PlayerInventory[playerid][inv_slot][invItem] != 0)
            {
                Trade_SendSimple(playerid, 27, 0);
                return true;
            }

            if(item_id == 134)
            {
                new worn_skin = GetPlayerSkin(playerid);
                new already = 0;
                for(new i = 0; i < MAX_INV_SLOTS; i++)
                {
                    if(PlayerInventory[playerid][i][invItem] == 134 && PlayerInventory[playerid][i][invValue] == worn_skin)
                    {
                        already = 1;
                        break;
                    }
                }
                if(!already)
                {
                    PlayerInventory[playerid][inv_slot][invItem] = 134;
                    PlayerInventory[playerid][inv_slot][invCount] = 1;
                    PlayerInventory[playerid][inv_slot][invValue] = worn_skin;
                    new q[256];
                    mysql_format(db_handle, q, sizeof q,
                        "INSERT INTO `inventory` (`uid`, `item_id`, `count`, `slot`, `value`) VALUES (%d, 134, 1, %d, %d)",
                        Player[playerid][pID], inv_slot, worn_skin);
                    mysql_tquery(db_handle, q, "OnItemInserted", "ii", playerid, inv_slot);
                }
                format(buf, sizeof buf, "{\"t\":27,\"s\":1,\"nw\":%d,\"ns\":%d}",
                    Inventory_GetMaxCarryWeight(playerid), MAX_INV_SLOTS);
                Trade_SendJsonStr(playerid, buf);
                return true;
            }
            if(item_id == ITEM_SIM_CARD && Player[playerid][pSimCard] > 0)
            {
                new old_active = Player[playerid][pSimCard];
                SetPlayerSimCardSilent(playerid, 0);
                PlayerInventory[playerid][inv_slot][invItem] = ITEM_SIM_CARD;
                PlayerInventory[playerid][inv_slot][invCount] = 1;
                PlayerInventory[playerid][inv_slot][invValue] = old_active;
                new q[200];
                mysql_format(db_handle, q, sizeof q,
                    "INSERT INTO `inventory` (`uid`, `item_id`, `count`, `slot`, `value`) VALUES (%d, %d, 1, %d, %d)",
                    Player[playerid][pID], ITEM_SIM_CARD, inv_slot, old_active);
                mysql_tquery(db_handle, q, "OnItemInserted", "ii", playerid, inv_slot);

                format(buf, sizeof buf, "{\"t\":27,\"s\":1,\"nw\":%d,\"ns\":%d,\"nm\":%d}",
                    Inventory_GetMaxCarryWeight(playerid), MAX_INV_SLOTS, Player[playerid][pSimCard]);
                Trade_SendJsonStr(playerid, buf);
                return true;
            }

            Trade_SendSimple(playerid, 27, 0);
            return true;
        }
        case 31:
        {
            new tx[128], esc[256], pkt[320];
            if(!Tune_ExtractJsonStringField(raw, "tx", tx, sizeof tx))
                return true;
            if(!strlen(tx))
                return true;

            Inv_EscapeJsonString(tx, esc, sizeof esc);
            format(pkt, sizeof pkt, "{\"t\":31,\"tx\":\"%s\"}", esc);
            Trade_SendJsonStr(partner, pkt);
            return true;
        }
    }
    return false;
}
// ----- end: trade / exchange -----

stock bool:IsPlateItem(item_id)
{
    item_id = Inv_ClientCatalogId(item_id);
    return (item_id == ITEM_PLATE_RUS || item_id == ITEM_PLATE_UA ||
            item_id == ITEM_PLATE_BY  || item_id == ITEM_PLATE_KZ);
}

// id ˜˜˜ ˜˜˜˜˜˜ GUI 33 (˜˜˜˜˜˜˜ client inventory.json) ˜ ˜˜˜ ˜ last/16.05.26, ˜ ˜˜˜˜˜˜˜˜˜ modelid.
stock Inv_PacketItemId(raw_id)
{
    if(raw_id <= 0) return 0;

    new cid = Inv_ClientCatalogId(raw_id);
    if(cid > 0) return cid;

    if(raw_id == ITEM_MEDKIT || raw_id == 951) return ITEM_MEDKIT;
    if(raw_id == ITEM_REPAIR_KIT || raw_id == 952) return ITEM_REPAIR_KIT;
    if(raw_id == ITEM_FUEL_CANISTER || raw_id == 1650) return ITEM_FUEL_CANISTER;
    if(raw_id == ITEM_SIM_CARD || raw_id == 997 || raw_id == 1000) return ITEM_SIM_CARD;
    if(raw_id == 134) return 134;

    if(raw_id >= 1 && raw_id <= 1008) return raw_id;
    return 0;
}

stock bool:Inv_RawIsSimItem(raw_id)
{
    return (raw_id == ITEM_SIM_CARD || raw_id == 997 || raw_id == 1000);
}

stock bool:Inv_RawIsFuelCanister(raw_id)
{
    return (raw_id == ITEM_FUEL_CANISTER || raw_id == 1650);
}

stock PlateCountryFromItem(item_id)
{
    item_id = Inv_ClientCatalogId(item_id);
    switch(item_id)
    {
        case ITEM_PLATE_RUS: return 0;
        case ITEM_PLATE_UA:  return 1;
        case ITEM_PLATE_BY:  return 2;
        case ITEM_PLATE_KZ:  return 3;
    }
    return -1;
}

stock PlateItemFromCountry(country)
{
    switch(country)
    {
        case 0: return ITEM_PLATE_RUS;
        case 1: return ITEM_PLATE_UA;
        case 2: return ITEM_PLATE_BY;
        case 3: return ITEM_PLATE_KZ;
    }
    return 0;
}

stock PlateModelFromCountry(country)
{
    switch(country)
    {
        case 0: return 1754;
        case 1: return 1755;
        case 2: return 1756;
        case 3: return 1757;
    }
    return 1754;
}

// ˜˜˜ ˜˜˜˜˜˜˜˜˜ ˜˜˜ ˜˜˜˜ "w" ˜ GUI 33 (˜˜˜˜˜˜ Black Russia). ˜˜˜˜˜˜ ˜ catalog id ˜˜ items.json.
stock Inventory_GetItemUnitWeight(item_id)
{
    item_id = Inv_ClientCatalogId(item_id);
    if(IsPlateItem(item_id)) return 2;
    switch(item_id)
    {
        case ITEM_SIM_CARD: return 1;
        case ITEM_FUEL_CANISTER: return 7;
        case ITEM_MEDKIT: return 3;
        case ITEM_REPAIR_KIT: return 5;
        case 134: return 5;
    }
    if(Inv_GetBackpackAddw(item_id) > 0)
    {
        new w = Inv_GetBackpackAddw(item_id) / 10;
        if(w < 2) w = 2;
        if(w > 5) w = 5;
        return w;
    }
    if(IsItemAccessory(item_id) > 0) return 2;
    return 1;
}

stock Inventory_GetTotalWeight(playerid)
{
    if(!IsPlayerConnected(playerid)) return 0;
    new total;
    for(new i = 0; i < MAX_INV_SLOTS; i++)
    {
        new item_id = PlayerInventory[playerid][i][invItem];
        if(item_id <= 0) continue;
        new cnt = PlayerInventory[playerid][i][invCount];
        if(cnt < 1) cnt = 1;
        total += Inventory_GetItemUnitWeight(item_id) * cnt;
    }
    return total;
}

stock Inventory_GetMaxCarryWeight(playerid)
{
    new mw = 50;
    for(new i = 0; i < MAX_INV_SLOTS; i++)
    {
        if(PlayerInventory[playerid][i][invItem] <= 0 || PlayerInventory[playerid][i][invValue] != 1) continue;
        new item_id = Inv_ClientCatalogId(PlayerInventory[playerid][i][invItem]);
        if(!Inv_IsBackpackItem(item_id)) continue;
        mw += Inv_GetBackpackAddw(item_id);
    }
    return mw;
}

stock PlateRPCType(country)
{
    switch(country)
    {
        case 0: return 1;
        case 1: return 2;
        case 2: return 3;
        case 3: return 4;
    }
    return 1;
}

forward LoadPlayerInventoryPlates(playerid);
public LoadPlayerInventoryPlates(playerid)
{
    new rows = cache_num_rows();
    for(new i = 0; i < rows; i++)
    {
        new inv_id = cache_get_field_content_int(i, "inv_id");
        for(new s = 0; s < MAX_INV_SLOTS; s++)
        {
            if(PlayerInventory[playerid][s][invID] == inv_id && IsPlateItem(PlayerInventory[playerid][s][invItem]))
            {
                cache_get_field_content(i, "plate_number", g_InvPlateNumber[playerid][s], _, sizeof g_InvPlateNumber[][]);
                cache_get_field_content(i, "plate_region", g_InvPlateRegion[playerid][s], _, sizeof g_InvPlateRegion[][]);

                // ˜˜˜˜˜˜ ˜˜˜˜˜˜˜˜˜˜˜ ˜˜˜˜˜ ˜˜˜˜˜ ˜˜˜˜:
                //   1) ˜ ˜˜˜˜˜˜˜˜˜˜˜˜ ˜˜˜˜˜˜˜˜ (uppercase ˜˜˜ RU/KZ);
                //   2) ˜ ˜˜˜˜˜˜˜˜˜ ˜˜˜˜˜˜˜˜˜˜˜˜ ˜˜˜˜˜˜˜ (˜˜˜˜˜˜˜˜, KZ region ˜136˜ ˜˜˜˜˜˜ ˜01..17˜,
                //      ˜˜˜ RUS plate ˜069OCK˜ ˜˜˜˜˜˜ ˜a123bc˜).
                // ˜˜˜˜˜˜˜ ˜˜˜˜˜˜˜˜˜˜˜ ˜˜˜˜˜˜˜, ˜˜˜˜˜ ˜˜˜˜˜˜˜˜˜˜ ˜˜˜˜˜˜ ˜ ˜˜˜˜ ˜˜ ˜˜˜˜˜˜˜˜,
                // ˜˜˜˜˜˜˜˜˜˜˜˜˜˜ ˜˜˜˜˜ RandomNumberPlate/Region. ˜ ˜˜˜˜˜ ˜˜˜˜˜˜˜ ˜˜˜˜˜ DB ˜˜˜˜˜˜˜.
                new country = PlateCountryFromItem(PlayerInventory[playerid][s][invItem]);
                if(country >= 0)
                {
                    new before_n[16], before_r[8];
                    format(before_n, sizeof before_n, "%s", g_InvPlateNumber[playerid][s]);
                    format(before_r, sizeof before_r, "%s", g_InvPlateRegion[playerid][s]);

                    Gibdd_RepairPlate(country,
                        g_InvPlateNumber[playerid][s], sizeof g_InvPlateNumber[][],
                        g_InvPlateRegion[playerid][s], sizeof g_InvPlateRegion[][]);
                    Gibdd_NormalizePlateText(country, g_InvPlateNumber[playerid][s]);
                    Gibdd_NormalizePlateText(country, g_InvPlateRegion[playerid][s]);

                    if(strcmp(before_n, g_InvPlateNumber[playerid][s]) != 0 ||
                       strcmp(before_r, g_InvPlateRegion[playerid][s]) != 0)
                    {
                        new uq[256];
                        mysql_format(db_handle, uq, sizeof uq,
                            "UPDATE `inventory_plates` SET `plate_number`='%e', `plate_region`='%e' WHERE `inv_id`=%d LIMIT 1",
                            g_InvPlateNumber[playerid][s], g_InvPlateRegion[playerid][s], inv_id);
                        mysql_tquery(db_handle, uq, "", "");
                    }
                }
                break;
            }
        }
    }
    Family_DB_LoadMember(playerid);
    return 1;
}

forward LoadPlayerInventory(playerid);
public LoadPlayerInventory(playerid)
{
    new rows = cache_num_rows();
    for(new i = 0; i < MAX_INV_SLOTS; i++)
    {
        PlayerInventory[playerid][i][invID] = 0;
        PlayerInventory[playerid][i][invItem] = 0;
        PlayerInventory[playerid][i][invCount] = 0;
        PlayerInventory[playerid][i][invValue] = 0;
        g_InvPlateNumber[playerid][i][0] = '\0';
        g_InvPlateRegion[playerid][i][0] = '\0';
    }
    for(new i = 0; i < rows; i++)
    {
        new slot = cache_get_field_content_int(i, "slot");
        if(slot >= 0 && slot < MAX_INV_SLOTS)
        {
        PlayerInventory[playerid][slot][invID] = cache_get_field_content_int(i, "id");
        PlayerInventory[playerid][slot][invItem] = cache_get_field_content_int(i, "item_id");
        PlayerInventory[playerid][slot][invCount] = cache_get_field_content_int(i, "count");
        PlayerInventory[playerid][slot][invValue] = cache_get_field_content_int(i, "value");
        }
    }

    new plate_q[256];
    mysql_format(db_handle, plate_q, sizeof plate_q,
        "SELECT p.`inv_id`, p.`plate_number`, p.`plate_region` FROM `inventory_plates` p \
         INNER JOIN `inventory` i ON i.`id` = p.`inv_id` WHERE i.`uid` = %d",
        Player[playerid][pID]);
    mysql_tquery(db_handle, plate_q, "LoadPlayerInventoryPlates", "i", playerid);

    for(new i = 0; i < MAX_INV_SLOTS; i++)
    {
        if(Inv_RawIsSimItem(PlayerInventory[playerid][i][invItem]) &&
            PlayerInventory[playerid][i][invValue] == Player[playerid][pSimCard] &&
            Player[playerid][pSimCard] > 0)
        {
            new q[128];
            mysql_format(db_handle, q, sizeof q, "DELETE FROM `inventory` WHERE `id` = %d", PlayerInventory[playerid][i][invID]);
            mysql_tquery(db_handle, q);
            PlayerInventory[playerid][i][invID] = 0;
            PlayerInventory[playerid][i][invItem] = 0;
            PlayerInventory[playerid][i][invCount] = 0;
            PlayerInventory[playerid][i][invValue] = 0;
        }
    }

    Inv_NormalizeWornAccessories(playerid);
    SetPVarInt(playerid, "inv_data_ready", 1);
    // ˜˜ ˜˜˜˜˜˜ ˜˜˜˜˜: ˜˜˜˜˜ ˜˜˜ ˜ ˜˜˜˜˜˜ ˜˜˜˜˜˜ ˜ attach ˜˜˜˜˜˜˜˜˜ ˜˜˜ SpawnPlayer.
    if(!GetPVarInt(playerid, "spawn_gui_active") && GetPlayerState(playerid) != PLAYER_STATE_SPECTATING)
        Inv_TryApplyWornAccessories(playerid);
    SetTimerEx("Sim_SanitizeDeferred", 150, false, "i", playerid);
    return 1;
}

forward OnItemInserted(playerid, slot);
public OnItemInserted(playerid, slot)
{
    PlayerInventory[playerid][slot][invID] = cache_insert_id();
    return 1;
}

stock GivePlayerItem(playerid, itemid, amount)
{
    if(itemid == ITEM_FUEL_CANISTER)
    {
        while(amount > 0)
        {
            if(!GivePlayerFuelCanister(playerid, 15)) return 0;
            amount--;
        }
        return 1;
    }

    if(itemid == 22 || itemid == 23)
    {
        for(new i = 0; i < MAX_INV_SLOTS; i++)
        {
            if(PlayerInventory[playerid][i][invItem] == itemid && PlayerInventory[playerid][i][invCount] < MAX_ITEM_STACK)
            {
                new can_add = MAX_ITEM_STACK - PlayerInventory[playerid][i][invCount];
                new to_add = (amount > can_add) ? can_add : amount;
                
                PlayerInventory[playerid][i][invCount] += to_add;
                amount -= to_add;
                
                new query[128];
                mysql_format(db_handle, query, sizeof(query), "UPDATE `inventory` SET `count` = %d WHERE `id` = %d", PlayerInventory[playerid][i][invCount], PlayerInventory[playerid][i][invID]);
                mysql_tquery(db_handle, query);
                
                if(amount <= 0) return 1;
            }
        }
    }

    while(amount > 0)
    {
        new slot = -1;
        for(new i = 0; i < MAX_INV_SLOTS; i++)
        {
            if(PlayerInventory[playerid][i][invItem] == 0) { slot = i; break; }
        }

        if(slot == -1) return 0;

        new to_add;
        if(itemid == 22 || itemid == 23) {
            to_add = (amount > MAX_ITEM_STACK) ? MAX_ITEM_STACK : amount;
        } else {
            to_add = 1; 
        }

        new store_id = Inv_ClientCatalogId(itemid);
        PlayerInventory[playerid][slot][invItem] = store_id;
        PlayerInventory[playerid][slot][invCount] = to_add;
        PlayerInventory[playerid][slot][invValue] = 0;
        amount -= to_add;

        new query[256];
        mysql_format(db_handle, query, sizeof(query), "INSERT INTO `inventory` (`uid`, `item_id`, `count`, `slot`, `value`) VALUES (%d, %d, %d, %d, 0)", Player[playerid][pID], store_id, to_add, slot);
        mysql_tquery(db_handle, query, "OnItemInserted", "ii", playerid, slot);
    }
    return 1;
}

CMD:giveitem(playerid, params[])
{
    new targetid, item, count;
    if(sscanf(params, "uii", targetid, item, count)) return SendClientMessage(playerid, -1, "use: /giveitem [id] [item_id] [count]");
    if(targetid == INVALID_PLAYER_ID) return 1;

    if(!GivePlayerItem(targetid, item, count)) return SendClientMessage(playerid, -1, "gived");
    return 1;
}

stock GivePlayerSkin(playerid, skinid)
{
    new slot = -1;
    for(new i = 0; i < MAX_INV_SLOTS; i++)
    {
        if(PlayerInventory[playerid][i][invItem] == 0) { slot = i; break; }
    }

    if(slot == -1) return 0;

    PlayerInventory[playerid][slot][invItem] = 134;
    PlayerInventory[playerid][slot][invCount] = 1;
    PlayerInventory[playerid][slot][invValue] = skinid;

    new query[256];
    mysql_format(db_handle, query, sizeof(query), "INSERT INTO `inventory` (`uid`, `item_id`, `count`, `slot`, `value`) VALUES (%d, 134, 1, %d, %d)", Player[playerid][pID], slot, skinid);
    mysql_tquery(db_handle, query, "OnItemInserted", "ii", playerid, slot);
    return 1;
}

stock GivePlayerSimCardItem(playerid, simnumber)
{
    if(!IsPlayerConnected(playerid)) return 0;

    new slot = -1;
    for(new i = 0; i < MAX_INV_SLOTS; i++)
    {
        if(PlayerInventory[playerid][i][invItem] == 0) { slot = i; break; }
    }
    if(slot == -1) return 0;

    PlayerInventory[playerid][slot][invItem] = ITEM_SIM_CARD;
    PlayerInventory[playerid][slot][invCount] = 1;
    PlayerInventory[playerid][slot][invValue] = simnumber;

    new query[256];
    mysql_format(db_handle, query, sizeof(query),
        "INSERT INTO `inventory` (`uid`, `item_id`, `count`, `slot`, `value`) VALUES (%d, %d, 1, %d, %d)",
        Player[playerid][pID], ITEM_SIM_CARD, slot, simnumber);
    mysql_tquery(db_handle, query, "OnItemInserted", "ii", playerid, slot);
    Phone_RegisterSim(simnumber, Player[playerid][pID]);
    return 1;
}

stock SetPlayerSimCardSilent(playerid, simnumber)
{
    if(!IsPlayerConnected(playerid)) return 0;
    if(simnumber > 0 && !IsPlayerOwnsSimNumber(playerid, simnumber)) return 0;
    Phone_SaveActiveSimUnits(playerid);
    Player[playerid][pSimCard] = simnumber;
    new query[128];
    mysql_format(db_handle, query, sizeof(query),
        "UPDATE `players` SET `sim_card` = %d WHERE `id` = %d", simnumber, Player[playerid][pID]);
    mysql_tquery(db_handle, query, "", "");
    Phone_AfterActiveSimSet(playerid);
    return 1;
}

stock IsPlayerOwnsSimNumber(playerid, simnumber)
{
    if(Player[playerid][pSimCard] == simnumber && simnumber > 0) return 1;
    for(new i = 0; i < MAX_INV_SLOTS; i++)
    {
        if(PlayerInventory[playerid][i][invItem] == ITEM_SIM_CARD &&
            PlayerInventory[playerid][i][invValue] == simnumber) return 1;
    }
    return 0;
}

stock UpdateInventorySimValue(playerid, slot, new_simnumber)
{
    if(slot < 0 || slot >= MAX_INV_SLOTS) return 0;
    if(PlayerInventory[playerid][slot][invItem] != ITEM_SIM_CARD) return 0;

    PlayerInventory[playerid][slot][invValue] = new_simnumber;

    if(PlayerInventory[playerid][slot][invID] > 0)
    {
        new q[128];
        mysql_format(db_handle, q, sizeof q,
            "UPDATE `inventory` SET `value` = %d WHERE `id` = %d",
            new_simnumber, PlayerInventory[playerid][slot][invID]);
        mysql_tquery(db_handle, q);
    }
    return 1;
}

stock RemoveInventorySim(playerid, slot)
{
    if(slot < 0 || slot >= MAX_INV_SLOTS) return 0;
    if(PlayerInventory[playerid][slot][invItem] != ITEM_SIM_CARD) return 0;

    if(PlayerInventory[playerid][slot][invID] > 0)
    {
        new q[128];
        mysql_format(db_handle, q, sizeof q,
            "DELETE FROM `inventory` WHERE `id` = %d",
            PlayerInventory[playerid][slot][invID]);
        mysql_tquery(db_handle, q);
    }

    PlayerInventory[playerid][slot][invID] = 0;
    PlayerInventory[playerid][slot][invItem] = 0;
    PlayerInventory[playerid][slot][invCount] = 0;
    PlayerInventory[playerid][slot][invValue] = 0;
    return 1;
}

forward OnPlateItemInserted(playerid, slot);
public OnPlateItemInserted(playerid, slot)
{
    new inv_id = cache_insert_id();
    if(slot < 0 || slot >= MAX_INV_SLOTS) return 0;
    PlayerInventory[playerid][slot][invID] = inv_id;

    new q[256];
    mysql_format(db_handle, q, sizeof q,
        "INSERT INTO `inventory_plates` (`inv_id`, `plate_number`, `plate_region`) VALUES (%d, '%e', '%e') \
         ON DUPLICATE KEY UPDATE `plate_number`=VALUES(`plate_number`), `plate_region`=VALUES(`plate_region`)",
        inv_id, g_InvPlateNumber[playerid][slot], g_InvPlateRegion[playerid][slot]);
    mysql_tquery(db_handle, q);

    // ˜˜ ˜˜˜˜˜˜˜˜˜ CEF-˜˜˜˜˜˜˜˜˜ ˜˜˜˜˜˜˜˜˜˜˜˜˜ ˜ ˜˜˜˜˜ ˜˜˜˜˜˜˜ ˜˜˜ ˜˜˜˜˜ /inv ˜˜˜ ˜˜˜˜˜˜˜˜˜˜˜˜˜.
    return 1;
}

stock GivePlayerPlateItem(playerid, country, const plate[], const region[])
{
    if(!IsPlayerConnected(playerid)) return -1;
    if(country < 0 || country > 3) return -1;

    new slot = -1;
    for(new i = 0; i < MAX_INV_SLOTS; i++)
    {
        if(PlayerInventory[playerid][i][invItem] == 0) { slot = i; break; }
    }
    if(slot == -1) return -1;

    new item_id = PlateItemFromCountry(country);
    PlayerInventory[playerid][slot][invItem] = item_id;
    PlayerInventory[playerid][slot][invCount] = 1;
    PlayerInventory[playerid][slot][invValue] = country;
    format(g_InvPlateNumber[playerid][slot], 16, "%s", plate);
    format(g_InvPlateRegion[playerid][slot], 8,  "%s", region);
    Gibdd_NormalizePlateText(country, g_InvPlateNumber[playerid][slot]);
    Gibdd_NormalizePlateText(country, g_InvPlateRegion[playerid][slot]);

    new q[256];
    mysql_format(db_handle, q, sizeof q,
        "INSERT INTO `inventory` (`uid`, `item_id`, `count`, `slot`, `value`) VALUES (%d, %d, 1, %d, %d)",
        Player[playerid][pID], item_id, slot, country);
    mysql_tquery(db_handle, q, "OnPlateItemInserted", "ii", playerid, slot);
    return slot;
}

stock RemoveInventoryPlate(playerid, slot)
{
    if(slot < 0 || slot >= MAX_INV_SLOTS) return 0;
    if(!IsPlateItem(PlayerInventory[playerid][slot][invItem])) return 0;

    new inv_id = PlayerInventory[playerid][slot][invID];
    if(inv_id > 0)
    {
        new q[160];
        mysql_format(db_handle, q, sizeof q, "DELETE FROM `inventory_plates` WHERE `inv_id` = %d", inv_id);
        mysql_tquery(db_handle, q);
        mysql_format(db_handle, q, sizeof q, "DELETE FROM `inventory` WHERE `id` = %d", inv_id);
        mysql_tquery(db_handle, q);
    }

    PlayerInventory[playerid][slot][invID] = 0;
    PlayerInventory[playerid][slot][invItem] = 0;
    PlayerInventory[playerid][slot][invCount] = 0;
    PlayerInventory[playerid][slot][invValue] = 0;
    g_InvPlateNumber[playerid][slot][0] = '\0';
    g_InvPlateRegion[playerid][slot][0] = '\0';
    return 1;
}

stock GivePlayerFuelCanister(playerid, liters)
{
    if(!IsPlayerConnected(playerid)) return 0;
    if(liters < 1) liters = 1;
    if(liters > 150) liters = 150;

    new slot = -1;
    for(new i = 0; i < MAX_INV_SLOTS; i++)
    {
        if(PlayerInventory[playerid][i][invItem] == 0) { slot = i; break; }
    }
    if(slot == -1) return 0;

    PlayerInventory[playerid][slot][invItem] = ITEM_FUEL_CANISTER;
    PlayerInventory[playerid][slot][invCount] = 1;
    PlayerInventory[playerid][slot][invValue] = liters;

    new q[256];
    mysql_format(db_handle, q, sizeof q,
        "INSERT INTO `inventory` (`uid`, `item_id`, `count`, `slot`, `value`) VALUES (%d, %d, 1, %d, %d)",
        Player[playerid][pID], ITEM_FUEL_CANISTER, slot, liters);
    mysql_tquery(db_handle, q, "OnItemInserted", "ii", playerid, slot);
    return 1;
}

// ˜˜˜˜˜ ˜ ˜˜˜˜˜˜ ˜˜˜˜˜ / ˜˜˜˜˜˜˜˜˜ (˜˜ ˜ ˜˜˜˜˜˜ ˜ ˜˜ ˜˜˜˜˜ ˜ ˜˜˜˜˜).
stock bool:IsPlayerAtTrunkZone(playerid, vehicleid, Float:max_dist = 2.5)
{
    if(!IsPlayerConnected(playerid) || vehicleid <= 0) return false;

    new Float:px, Float:py, Float:pz;
    GetPlayerPos(playerid, px, py, pz);
    new Float:vx, Float:vy, Float:vz, Float:va;
    GetVehiclePos(vehicleid, vx, vy, vz);
    GetVehicleZAngle(vehicleid, va);

    new Float:frad = va * 3.14159265 / 180.0;
    new Float:fx = floatsin(-frad, radian);
    new Float:fy = floatcos(-frad, radian);

    new Float:trad = (va - 180.0) * 3.14159265 / 180.0;
    new Float:tx = vx + floatsin(-trad, radian) * 2.2;
    new Float:ty = vy + floatcos(-trad, radian) * 2.2;

    new Float:dx = px - tx;
    new Float:dy = py - ty;
    new Float:dz = pz - vz;
    if(floatsqroot(dx*dx + dy*dy + dz*dz) > max_dist) return false;

    new Float:pdx = px - vx;
    new Float:pdy = py - vy;
    if((pdx * fx + pdy * fy) > -0.45) return false;

    new Float:lateral = floatabs(pdx * (-fy) + pdy * fx);
    if(lateral > 1.35) return false;

    return true;
}

stock GetClosestVehicleByTrunk(playerid, Float:max_distance = 4.0)
{
    if(!IsPlayerConnected(playerid)) return 0;

    new closest_veh = 0;
    new Float:closest_dist = max_distance;

    for(new vehid = 1; vehid < MAX_VEHICLES; vehid++)
    {
        if(GetVehicleModel(vehid) == 0) continue;
        if(!IsPlayerAtTrunkZone(playerid, vehid, max_distance)) continue;

        new Float:vx, Float:vy, Float:vz, Float:va;
        GetVehiclePos(vehid, vx, vy, vz);
        GetVehicleZAngle(vehid, va);

        new Float:rad = (va - 180.0) * 3.14159265 / 180.0;
        new Float:tx = vx + floatsin(-rad, radian) * 2.2;
        new Float:ty = vy + floatcos(-rad, radian) * 2.2;

        new Float:px, Float:py, Float:pz;
        GetPlayerPos(playerid, px, py, pz);
        new Float:dx = px - tx;
        new Float:dy = py - ty;
        new Float:dz = pz - vz;
        new Float:dist = floatsqroot(dx*dx + dy*dy + dz*dz);

        if(dist < closest_dist)
        {
            closest_dist = dist;
            closest_veh = vehid;
        }
    }
    return closest_veh;
}

stock Veh_ShowTrunkOrNoCarMsg(playerid, Float:near_radius = 8.0)
{
    if(GetClosestVehicleToPlayer(playerid, near_radius) == 0)
        ShowNotification(playerid, 2, 5, 0, 1, "˜˜˜˜˜ ˜ ˜˜˜˜ ˜˜˜ ˜˜˜˜˜˜˜˜˜˜.", "");
    else
        ShowNotification(playerid, 2, 5, 0, 1, "˜˜˜˜˜˜˜˜˜ ˜ ˜˜˜˜˜˜˜˜˜ ˜˜˜˜˜˜˜˜˜˜ (3˜).", "");
    return 1;
}

stock GetClosestVehicleToPlayer(playerid, Float:max_distance = 5.0)
{
	if(!IsPlayerConnected(playerid)) return 0;

	new Float:px, Float:py, Float:pz;
	GetPlayerPos(playerid, px, py, pz);

	new closest_veh = 0;
	new Float:closest_dist = max_distance;

	for(new vehid = 1; vehid < MAX_VEHICLES; vehid++)
	{
		if(GetVehicleModel(vehid) == 0) continue;

		new Float:vx, Float:vy, Float:vz;
		GetVehiclePos(vehid, vx, vy, vz);

		new Float:dx = vx - px;
		new Float:dy = vy - py;
		new Float:dz = vz - pz;
		new Float:dist = floatsqroot(dx*dx + dy*dy + dz*dz);

		if(dist < closest_dist)
		{
			closest_dist = dist;
			closest_veh = vehid;
		}
	}
	return closest_veh;
}

stock ConsumeOneInventoryItem(playerid, slot)
{
	if(slot < 0 || slot >= MAX_INV_SLOTS) return 0;
	if(PlayerInventory[playerid][slot][invItem] == 0) return 0;

	if(PlayerInventory[playerid][slot][invCount] > 1)
	{
		PlayerInventory[playerid][slot][invCount]--;
		new q[128];
		mysql_format(db_handle, q, sizeof q, "UPDATE `inventory` SET `count`=%d WHERE `id`=%d",
			PlayerInventory[playerid][slot][invCount], PlayerInventory[playerid][slot][invID]);
		mysql_tquery(db_handle, q);
		return 1;
	}

	new q[128];
	mysql_format(db_handle, q, sizeof q, "DELETE FROM `inventory` WHERE `id`=%d", PlayerInventory[playerid][slot][invID]);
	mysql_tquery(db_handle, q);
	PlayerInventory[playerid][slot][invID] = 0;
	PlayerInventory[playerid][slot][invItem] = 0;
	PlayerInventory[playerid][slot][invCount] = 0;
	PlayerInventory[playerid][slot][invValue] = 0;
	return 1;
}

stock SwapActiveSimWithInventorySlot(playerid, inv_slot)
{
    if(inv_slot < 0 || inv_slot >= MAX_INV_SLOTS) return 0;
    if(PlayerInventory[playerid][inv_slot][invItem] != ITEM_SIM_CARD) return 0;

    new clicked_sim = PlayerInventory[playerid][inv_slot][invValue];
    new old_active = Player[playerid][pSimCard];

    if(IsSimNumberOnlineTaken(clicked_sim, playerid))
        return 0;

    if(old_active > 0)
    {
        SetPlayerSimCardSilent(playerid, clicked_sim);
        UpdateInventorySimValue(playerid, inv_slot, old_active);
        Phone_RegisterSim(old_active, Player[playerid][pID]);
    }
    else
    {
        SetPlayerSimCardSilent(playerid, clicked_sim);
        RemoveInventorySim(playerid, inv_slot);
    }
    return 1;
}

stock Inv_FindItemSlot(playerid, item_id, prefer_slot)
{
    if(item_id <= 0) return -1;
    item_id = Inv_ClientCatalogId(item_id);

    if(prefer_slot >= 0 && prefer_slot < MAX_INV_SLOTS &&
        Inv_ClientCatalogId(PlayerInventory[playerid][prefer_slot][invItem]) == item_id)
        return prefer_slot;

    for(new i = 0; i < MAX_INV_SLOTS; i++)
    {
        if(Inv_ClientCatalogId(PlayerInventory[playerid][i][invItem]) == item_id)
            return i;
    }
    return -1;
}

// ˜˜˜˜˜˜ ˜˜˜˜˜˜˜˜ ˜˜˜˜˜˜˜ ˜˜˜˜ ˜˜˜˜˜˜˜˜˜ ˜˜˜˜˜˜ ˜˜ ˜˜˜˜˜ (˜˜˜˜˜ ˜ ai). ˜˜˜˜˜˜˜˜˜ value==1 ˜˜˜˜˜˜˜˜ ˜ it.
stock bool:Inv_IsKeeperWornForGrid(playerid, inv_slot)
{
    if(inv_slot < 0 || inv_slot >= MAX_INV_SLOTS) return false;
    if(PlayerInventory[playerid][inv_slot][invItem] <= 0) return false;
    if(PlayerInventory[playerid][inv_slot][invValue] != 1) return false;

    new item_id = Inv_ClientCatalogId(PlayerInventory[playerid][inv_slot][invItem]);
    if(item_id == 134) return true;

    if(Inv_IsBackpackItem(item_id))
    {
        for(new i = 0; i < MAX_INV_SLOTS; i++)
        {
            if(PlayerInventory[playerid][i][invItem] <= 0) continue;
            if(PlayerInventory[playerid][i][invValue] != 1) continue;
            if(!Inv_IsBackpackItem(Inv_ClientCatalogId(PlayerInventory[playerid][i][invItem]))) continue;
            return (i == inv_slot);
        }
        return false;
    }

    new category = Inv_GetAccessoryCategory(item_id);
    if(category == ACC_CAT_NONE) return false;

    for(new i = 0; i < MAX_INV_SLOTS; i++)
    {
        if(PlayerInventory[playerid][i][invItem] <= 0) continue;
        if(PlayerInventory[playerid][i][invValue] != 1) continue;
        new oid = Inv_ClientCatalogId(PlayerInventory[playerid][i][invItem]);
        if(Inv_GetAccessoryCategory(oid) != category) continue;
        return (i == inv_slot);
    }
    return false;
}

stock bool:Inv_ShouldSkipInvGridItem(playerid, inv_slot, bool:skip_worn_wearables)
{
    if(PlayerInventory[playerid][inv_slot][invItem] <= 0) return true;
    if(!skip_worn_wearables || PlayerInventory[playerid][inv_slot][invValue] != 1) return false;
    return Inv_IsKeeperWornForGrid(playerid, inv_slot);
}

stock Inv_FindSlotByUiIndex(playerid, ui_index, item_id, value, bool:skip_worn_wearables)
{
    if(ui_index < 0) return -1;

    // BR-˜˜˜˜˜˜ ˜˜˜ ˜˜˜˜˜˜˜˜˜˜ slot (0..39), ˜˜˜˜˜˜˜˜˜˜˜ ˜ ˜˜˜˜˜˜˜ ˜˜˜˜˜ ˜ it[].
    if(ui_index < MAX_INV_SLOTS && PlayerInventory[playerid][ui_index][invItem] > 0)
    {
        if(item_id <= 0 || Inv_ClientCatalogId(PlayerInventory[playerid][ui_index][invItem]) == item_id)
        {
            if((item_id == ITEM_SIM_CARD || item_id == 134) && value > 0 &&
                PlayerInventory[playerid][ui_index][invValue] != value)
            {
                // value ˜˜ ˜˜˜˜˜˜ ˜ ˜˜˜˜ ˜˜˜˜
            }
            else if(!skip_worn_wearables || !Inv_ShouldSkipInvGridItem(playerid, ui_index, true))
                return ui_index;
        }
    }

    new idx = 0;
    for(new i = 0; i < MAX_INV_SLOTS; i++)
    {
        if(Inv_ShouldSkipInvGridItem(playerid, i, skip_worn_wearables)) continue;
        if(idx != ui_index) { idx++; continue; }

        if(item_id > 0 && Inv_ClientCatalogId(PlayerInventory[playerid][i][invItem]) != item_id) return -1;
        if((item_id == ITEM_SIM_CARD || item_id == 134) && value > 0 &&
            PlayerInventory[playerid][i][invValue] != value)
            return -1;
        return i;
    }
    return -1;
}

stock Inv_CorrectPacketInvSlot(playerid, item_id, ui_index, value, &inv_slot, bool:skip_worn_wearables)
{
    item_id = Inv_ClientCatalogId(item_id);
    if(inv_slot == SIM_CARD_ACTIVE_POS) return 1;

    if(inv_slot >= 0 && inv_slot < MAX_INV_SLOTS && item_id > 0 &&
        Inv_ClientCatalogId(PlayerInventory[playerid][inv_slot][invItem]) == item_id)
    {
        if((item_id == ITEM_SIM_CARD || item_id == 134) && value > 0 &&
            PlayerInventory[playerid][inv_slot][invValue] != value)
        {
            // ˜˜˜˜˜ SIM/˜˜˜˜˜ ˜˜ ˜˜˜˜˜˜ ˜ ˜˜˜˜ ˜˜ UI-˜˜˜˜˜˜˜
        }
        else return 1;
    }

    new ui_slot = Inv_FindSlotByUiIndex(playerid, ui_index, item_id, value, skip_worn_wearables);
    if(ui_slot >= 0)
    {
        inv_slot = ui_slot;
        return 1;
    }

    new found = Inv_FindItemSlot(playerid, item_id, -1);
    if(found >= 0)
    {
        inv_slot = found;
        return 1;
    }
    return 0;
}

stock Inv_DeleteItemFromSlot(playerid, inv_slot)
{
    if(inv_slot < 0 || inv_slot >= MAX_INV_SLOTS) return 0;

    new item_id = PlayerInventory[playerid][inv_slot][invItem];
    if(item_id <= 0) return 0;

    if(item_id == ITEM_SIM_CARD &&
        Player[playerid][pSimCard] == PlayerInventory[playerid][inv_slot][invValue] &&
        PlayerInventory[playerid][inv_slot][invValue] > 0)
        SetPlayerSimCardSilent(playerid, 0);

    if(IsItemAccessory(item_id) > 0 && PlayerInventory[playerid][inv_slot][invValue] == 1)
        Inv_RemoveWornAttach(playerid, item_id);

    if(PlayerInventory[playerid][inv_slot][invID] > 0 && IsItemAccessory(item_id) > 0)
    {
        new q_acc[96];
        mysql_format(db_handle, q_acc, sizeof q_acc,
            "DELETE FROM `player_accessories` WHERE `inv_id`=%d",
            PlayerInventory[playerid][inv_slot][invID]);
        mysql_query(db_handle, q_acc, false);
    }

    if(IsPlateItem(item_id))
        return RemoveInventoryPlate(playerid, inv_slot);

    if(item_id == ITEM_SIM_CARD)
        return RemoveInventorySim(playerid, inv_slot);

    if(item_id != 134 && item_id != ITEM_FUEL_CANISTER && !IsPlateItem(item_id) &&
        PlayerInventory[playerid][inv_slot][invCount] > 1)
    {
        PlayerInventory[playerid][inv_slot][invCount]--;
        if(PlayerInventory[playerid][inv_slot][invID] > 0)
        {
            new q_u[128];
            mysql_format(db_handle, q_u, sizeof q_u,
                "UPDATE `inventory` SET `count`=%d WHERE `id`=%d",
                PlayerInventory[playerid][inv_slot][invCount],
                PlayerInventory[playerid][inv_slot][invID]);
            mysql_query(db_handle, q_u, false);
        }
        return 1;
    }

    if(PlayerInventory[playerid][inv_slot][invID] > 0)
    {
        new query[128];
        mysql_format(db_handle, query, sizeof(query),
            "DELETE FROM `inventory` WHERE `id`=%d",
            PlayerInventory[playerid][inv_slot][invID]);
        mysql_query(db_handle, query, false);
    }

    PlayerInventory[playerid][inv_slot][invID] = 0;
    PlayerInventory[playerid][inv_slot][invItem] = 0;
    PlayerInventory[playerid][inv_slot][invCount] = 0;
    PlayerInventory[playerid][inv_slot][invValue] = 0;
    return 1;
}

// BR-˜˜˜˜˜˜: ˜˜˜˜˜˜˜ ˜ ˜˜˜˜˜ ˜˜˜˜˜˜˜ ˜ os=-2 (positionFromSlot 0) ˜˜˜ s/os=255.
stock Inv_NormalizeSimPhonePacketPos(&pos_or_os)
{
    if(pos_or_os == -2)
        pos_or_os = SIM_CARD_ACTIVE_POS;
}

stock Inv_ResolveSimPacketPos(playerid, item_id, raw_pos, &out_pos)
{
    out_pos = raw_pos;
    if(item_id != ITEM_SIM_CARD) return 1;
    Inv_NormalizeSimPhonePacketPos(out_pos);
    if(out_pos == SIM_CARD_ACTIVE_POS) return 1;
    if(out_pos >= 0 && out_pos < MAX_INV_SLOTS && PlayerInventory[playerid][out_pos][invItem] == ITEM_SIM_CARD)
        return 1;
    if(Player[playerid][pSimCard] > 0)
        out_pos = SIM_CARD_ACTIVE_POS;
    return 1;
}

stock Inv_MoveActiveSimToInventory(playerid)
{
    if(Player[playerid][pSimCard] <= 0) return -1;

    new free_slot = -1;
    for(new i = 0; i < MAX_INV_SLOTS; i++)
    {
        if(PlayerInventory[playerid][i][invItem] == 0)
        {
            free_slot = i;
            break;
        }
    }
    if(free_slot == -1) return -1;

    new old_active = Player[playerid][pSimCard];
    SetPlayerSimCardSilent(playerid, 0);

    PlayerInventory[playerid][free_slot][invItem] = ITEM_SIM_CARD;
    PlayerInventory[playerid][free_slot][invCount] = 1;
    PlayerInventory[playerid][free_slot][invValue] = old_active;

    new q[200];
    mysql_format(db_handle, q, sizeof q,
        "INSERT INTO `inventory` (`uid`, `item_id`, `count`, `slot`, `value`) VALUES (%d, %d, 1, %d, %d)",
        Player[playerid][pID], ITEM_SIM_CARD, free_slot, old_active);
    mysql_tquery(db_handle, q, "OnItemInserted", "ii", playerid, free_slot);
    return free_slot;
}

// ˜˜˜˜˜˜: os = positionFromSlot - 2 (˜˜˜˜˜˜ os=-1 -> col 1, ˜˜˜˜˜˜˜ os=-2 -> col 0).
stock Inv_ParseEquipColumnPos(os, item_id)
{
    if(os >= -2 && os <= 7)
        return os + 2;
    if(os >= 0 && os <= 9)
        return os;
    return Inv_GetAiSlotPos(item_id);
}

stock bool:Inv_IsEquippedInSlot(playerid, inv_slot)
{
    if(inv_slot < 0 || inv_slot >= MAX_INV_SLOTS) return false;
    new id = PlayerInventory[playerid][inv_slot][invItem];
    if(id <= 0) return false;
    if(PlayerInventory[playerid][inv_slot][invValue] != 1) return false;
    if(Inv_IsBackpackItem(id)) return true;
    return (IsItemAccessory(id) > 0);
}

stock bool:Inv_ShouldHideFromInventoryGrid(playerid, inv_slot)
{
    return Inv_IsEquippedInSlot(playerid, inv_slot);
}

// ˜˜˜˜˜˜˜ ˜˜˜˜˜˜˜ (value==1) ˜˜ ˜˜˜˜˜˜˜ ˜ ˜˜˜˜˜ ˜˜˜˜˜˜˜ UI.
stock Inv_FindWornSlotByAiPos(playerid, ai_pos)
{
    if(ai_pos < 0 || ai_pos > 9) return -1;
    for(new s = 0; s < MAX_INV_SLOTS; s++)
    {
        if(!Inv_IsEquippedInSlot(playerid, s)) continue;
        if(Inv_GetAiSlotPos(PlayerInventory[playerid][s][invItem]) == ai_pos)
            return s;
    }
    return -1;
}

stock Inv_FindWornSlotByItem(playerid, item_id, equip_col_pos)
{
    new slot = Inv_FindWornSlotByAiPos(playerid, equip_col_pos);
    if(slot >= 0) return slot;

    for(new s = 0; s < MAX_INV_SLOTS; s++)
    {
        if(PlayerInventory[playerid][s][invItem] != item_id) continue;
        if(!Inv_IsEquippedInSlot(playerid, s)) continue;
        return s;
    }
    return -1;
}

stock Inv_FindFirstEmptyInvSlot(playerid)
{
    for(new s = 0; s < MAX_INV_SLOTS; s++)
    {
        if(PlayerInventory[playerid][s][invItem] <= 0)
            return s;
    }
    return -1;
}

stock Inv_MoveInventorySlot(playerid, from_slot, to_slot)
{
    if(from_slot < 0 || from_slot >= MAX_INV_SLOTS) return 0;
    if(to_slot < 0 || to_slot >= MAX_INV_SLOTS) return 0;
    if(from_slot == to_slot) return 1;
    if(PlayerInventory[playerid][to_slot][invItem] > 0) return 0;

    PlayerInventory[playerid][to_slot][invID]    = PlayerInventory[playerid][from_slot][invID];
    PlayerInventory[playerid][to_slot][invItem]  = PlayerInventory[playerid][from_slot][invItem];
    PlayerInventory[playerid][to_slot][invCount] = PlayerInventory[playerid][from_slot][invCount];
    PlayerInventory[playerid][to_slot][invValue] = PlayerInventory[playerid][from_slot][invValue];

    PlayerInventory[playerid][from_slot][invID] = 0;
    PlayerInventory[playerid][from_slot][invItem] = 0;
    PlayerInventory[playerid][from_slot][invCount] = 0;
    PlayerInventory[playerid][from_slot][invValue] = 0;

    new q[192];
    if(PlayerInventory[playerid][to_slot][invID] > 0)
    {
        mysql_format(db_handle, q, sizeof q,
            "UPDATE `inventory` SET `slot`=%d, `value`=%d WHERE `id`=%d",
            to_slot, PlayerInventory[playerid][to_slot][invValue], PlayerInventory[playerid][to_slot][invID]);
    }
    else
    {
        mysql_format(db_handle, q, sizeof q,
            "UPDATE `inventory` SET `slot`=%d, `value`=%d WHERE `uid`=%d AND `slot`=%d",
            to_slot, PlayerInventory[playerid][to_slot][invValue], Player[playerid][pID], from_slot);
    }
    mysql_tquery(db_handle, q);
    return 1;
}

// ˜˜˜˜˜ ˜˜˜˜˜˜˜ ˜˜˜˜˜˜˜˜˜ (value 1 -> 0), ˜˜˜˜˜˜ attach.
stock Inv_UnequipAccessoryAtSlot(playerid, inv_slot)
{
    if(inv_slot < 0 || inv_slot >= MAX_INV_SLOTS) return 0;
    if(!Inv_IsEquippedInSlot(playerid, inv_slot)) return 0;

    new item_id = PlayerInventory[playerid][inv_slot][invItem];

    Inv_RemoveWornAttach(playerid, item_id);
    if(Inv_IsWearableAccessory(item_id))
        Inv_UnequipWearableCategory(playerid, Inv_GetAccessoryCategory(item_id), inv_slot);

    PlayerInventory[playerid][inv_slot][invValue] = 0;

    new q[192];
    if(PlayerInventory[playerid][inv_slot][invID] > 0)
    {
        mysql_format(db_handle, q, sizeof q,
            "UPDATE `inventory` SET `value`=0 WHERE `id`=%d",
            PlayerInventory[playerid][inv_slot][invID]);
        mysql_tquery(db_handle, q);
    }
    else
    {
        mysql_format(db_handle, q, sizeof q,
            "UPDATE `inventory` SET `value`=0 WHERE `uid`=%d AND `slot`=%d",
            Player[playerid][pID], inv_slot);
        mysql_tquery(db_handle, q);
    }
    return 1;
}

// ˜˜˜˜˜˜˜˜˜˜˜˜˜˜ ˜ ˜˜˜˜˜ ˜˜˜˜˜˜˜ ˜ ˜˜˜˜˜: ga=item_id, os=positionFromSlot-2, s=UI-˜˜˜˜˜˜ ˜˜˜˜˜˜.
stock Inv_HandleAiSlotToInvUnequip(playerid, item_id, old_pos, target_ui_pos)
{
    if(item_id <= 0) return 0;
    if(item_id == ITEM_SIM_CARD || item_id == 134) return 0;
    if(IsItemAccessory(item_id) <= 0 && item_id != 141 && !Inv_IsBackpackItem(item_id)) return 0;

    new equip_col = Inv_ParseEquipColumnPos(old_pos, item_id);
    new worn_slot = Inv_FindWornSlotByItem(playerid, item_id, equip_col);
    if(worn_slot < 0) return 0;

    new target_slot = target_ui_pos;
    if(target_ui_pos >= 0)
        Inv_CorrectPacketInvSlot(playerid, item_id, target_ui_pos, 0, target_slot, true);

    if(target_slot < 0 || target_slot >= MAX_INV_SLOTS || target_slot == worn_slot)
        target_slot = Inv_FindFirstEmptyInvSlot(playerid);
    if(target_slot < 0) return -1;

    if(PlayerInventory[playerid][target_slot][invItem] > 0 && target_slot != worn_slot)
        return -1;

    if(!Inv_UnequipAccessoryAtSlot(playerid, worn_slot))
        return 0;

    if(target_slot != worn_slot)
        Inv_MoveInventorySlot(playerid, worn_slot, target_slot);

    return 1;
}

// ˜˜˜˜˜˜˜ ˜˜˜˜˜˜˜˜˜ (t=18): ga + UI-˜˜˜˜˜˜ ˜ s.
stock Inv_ParseDeletePacket(playerid, Node:json, const raw_json[], &item_id, &pos)
{
    new pkt_ga = 0, pkt_s = -1;
    item_id = 0;
    pos = -1;

    if(raw_json[0])
    {
        Tune_ExtractJsonIntField(raw_json, "ga", pkt_ga);
        if(!Tune_ExtractJsonIntField(raw_json, "s", pkt_s))
            Tune_ExtractJsonIntField(raw_json, "sl", pkt_s);
    }
    if(pkt_ga == 0 && JSON_GetType(json, "ga") != JSON_NODE_NULL)
        JSON_GetInt(json, "ga", pkt_ga);
    if(pkt_s < 0 && JSON_GetType(json, "s") != JSON_NODE_NULL)
        JSON_GetInt(json, "s", pkt_s);

    item_id = pkt_ga;
    if(item_id == ITEM_SIM_CARD && pkt_s == SIM_CARD_ACTIVE_POS)
    {
        pos = SIM_CARD_ACTIVE_POS;
        return 1;
    }

    if(pkt_s >= 0)
    {
        pos = pkt_s;
        Inv_CorrectPacketInvSlot(playerid, item_id, pkt_s, 0, pos, true);
    }

    if(pos >= 0 && pos < MAX_INV_SLOTS && item_id > 0 &&
        PlayerInventory[playerid][pos][invItem] == item_id)
        return 1;

    new found = Inv_FindItemSlot(playerid, item_id, -1);
    if(found >= 0)
    {
        pos = found;
        return 1;
    }
    return 0;
}

// ˜˜˜˜˜˜˜ ˜˜˜˜˜˜˜˜˜˜˜˜˜˜ (t=19): ˜˜˜˜˜ JSON + ga ˜˜ ˜˜˜˜˜ (˜˜˜˜˜˜ ˜˜˜˜˜ ˜˜ ˜˜˜ s=0 / ga=0).
stock Inv_ParseUsePacket(playerid, Node:json, const raw_json[], &item_id, &pos)
{
    new pkt_ga = 0, pkt_s = 0, sim_val = 0;
    new bool:got_s = false, bool:got_ga = false;
    new raw_pos = -1;

    item_id = 0;
    pos = -1;

    if(raw_json[0])
    {
        got_ga = Tune_ExtractJsonIntField(raw_json, "ga", pkt_ga);
        got_s = Tune_ExtractJsonIntField(raw_json, "s", pkt_s);
        if(!got_s)
            got_s = Tune_ExtractJsonIntField(raw_json, "sl", pkt_s);
        if(!got_s)
            got_s = Tune_ExtractJsonIntField(raw_json, "os", pkt_s);
        Tune_ExtractJsonIntField(raw_json, "v", sim_val);
    }

    if(!got_ga && raw_json[0] && Tune_JsonHasKey(raw_json, "ga"))
    {
        Tune_ExtractJsonIntField(raw_json, "ga", pkt_ga);
        got_ga = true;
    }
    if(!got_s && raw_json[0] && Tune_JsonHasKey(raw_json, "s"))
    {
        Tune_ExtractJsonIntField(raw_json, "s", pkt_s);
        got_s = true;
    }

    if(!got_ga && JSON_GetType(json, "ga") != JSON_NODE_NULL)
    {
        JSON_GetInt(json, "ga", pkt_ga);
        got_ga = (pkt_ga != 0 || (raw_json[0] && Tune_JsonHasKey(raw_json, "ga")));
    }
    if(!got_s && JSON_GetType(json, "s") != JSON_NODE_NULL)
    {
        JSON_GetInt(json, "s", pkt_s);
        got_s = (raw_json[0] ? Tune_JsonHasKey(raw_json, "s") : (pkt_s != 0));
    }

    if(got_s && pkt_s < 0)
        got_s = false;

    raw_pos = got_s ? pkt_s : -1;

    if(got_s && pkt_s >= 0 && pkt_s < MAX_INV_SLOTS)
        pos = pkt_s;
    else if(pkt_ga > 0)
    {
        new found_ga = Inv_FindItemSlot(playerid, pkt_ga, -1);
        if(found_ga >= 0)
            pos = found_ga;
        else if(pkt_ga == ITEM_SIM_CARD && Player[playerid][pSimCard] > 0)
            pos = SIM_CARD_ACTIVE_POS;
        else
            pos = 0;
    }
    else
        pos = 0;

    if(JSON_GetType(json, "v") != JSON_NODE_NULL)
        JSON_GetInt(json, "v", sim_val);
    if(sim_val == 0 && raw_json[0])
        Tune_ExtractJsonIntField(raw_json, "v", sim_val);

    if(pos == SIM_CARD_ACTIVE_POS)
    {
        item_id = ITEM_SIM_CARD;
        return 1;
    }

    if(pos >= 0 && pos < MAX_INV_SLOTS && PlayerInventory[playerid][pos][invItem] > 0)
        item_id = PlayerInventory[playerid][pos][invItem];
    else if(pkt_ga > 0)
        item_id = pkt_ga;

    if(item_id <= 0 && Player[playerid][pSimCard] > 0)
    {
        if(pkt_ga == 0 || pkt_ga == ITEM_SIM_CARD || !got_ga)
        {
            item_id = ITEM_SIM_CARD;
            pos = SIM_CARD_ACTIVE_POS;
            return 1;
        }
    }

    if(sim_val > 0 && item_id == ITEM_SIM_CARD)
    {
        for(new i = 0; i < MAX_INV_SLOTS; i++)
        {
            if(PlayerInventory[playerid][i][invItem] == ITEM_SIM_CARD &&
                PlayerInventory[playerid][i][invValue] == sim_val)
            {
                pos = i;
                return 1;
            }
        }
        if(Player[playerid][pSimCard] == sim_val)
        {
            pos = SIM_CARD_ACTIVE_POS;
            return 1;
        }
    }

    if(item_id == ITEM_SIM_CARD)
    {
        if(pos >= 0 && pos < MAX_INV_SLOTS && PlayerInventory[playerid][pos][invItem] == ITEM_SIM_CARD)
            return 1;

        new found = Inv_FindItemSlot(playerid, ITEM_SIM_CARD, pos);
        if(found >= 0)
        {
            pos = found;
            return 1;
        }

        Inv_ResolveSimPacketPos(playerid, item_id, raw_pos, pos);
        return 1;
    }

    if(item_id <= 0 && pkt_ga > 0)
        item_id = pkt_ga;

    if(item_id > 0 && pos != SIM_CARD_ACTIVE_POS)
        Inv_CorrectPacketInvSlot(playerid, item_id, raw_pos, sim_val, pos, true);

    return 1;
}

// BR-˜˜˜˜˜˜ (MigrateItemsFromAny): ˜˜˜˜˜˜˜ [id, param, slot, extra, ...], ˜˜ [[..],[..]].
// Pawn JSON: JSON_Append / JSON_ArrayAppend ˜˜ ˜˜˜˜˜˜˜˜ ˜˜˜˜˜˜˜ ˜˜˜˜ Stringify len=0 ˜ ˜˜˜˜˜˜˜˜ ˜˜˜˜˜ ˜ JSON_Parse.
stock Inv_FlatJsonPutComma(dest[], dest_size, &bool:is_first)
{
    if(is_first) { is_first = false; return; }
    strcat(dest, ",", dest_size);
}

stock Inv_FlatJsonPutInt(dest[], dest_size, value, &bool:is_first)
{
    new chunk[16];
    Inv_FlatJsonPutComma(dest, dest_size, is_first);
    format(chunk, sizeof chunk, "%d", value);
    strcat(dest, chunk, dest_size);
}

stock Inv_FlatJsonPutPlateQuad(dest[], dest_size, item_id, const plate_str[], slot, &bool:is_first)
{
    new esc[64], chunk[128];
    Inv_EscapeJsonString(plate_str, esc, sizeof esc);
    Inv_FlatJsonPutComma(dest, dest_size, is_first);
    format(chunk, sizeof chunk, "%d,\"%s\",%d,0", item_id, esc, slot);
    strcat(dest, chunk, dest_size);
}

stock Inv_EscapeJsonString(const src[], dest[], dest_size)
{
    new j;
    for(new i = 0; src[i] && j < dest_size - 2; i++)
    {
        if(src[i] == '"' || src[i] == '\\')
            dest[j++] = '\\';
        dest[j++] = src[i];
    }
    dest[j] = '\0';
}

// ˜˜˜ last/16.05.26, ˜˜ ˜˜˜˜˜˜˜ ˜˜˜˜˜˜ ˜˜˜ MigrateItemsFromAny.
stock Inv_BuildFlatItJsonString(playerid, dest[], dest_size)
{
    dest[0] = '\0';
    strcat(dest, "[", dest_size);
    new bool:is_first = true;

    for(new i = 0; i < MAX_INV_SLOTS; i++)
    {
        new raw_item = PlayerInventory[playerid][i][invItem];
        if(raw_item <= 0) continue;
        if(Inv_ShouldHideFromInventoryGrid(playerid, i)) continue;

        new packet_id = Inv_PacketItemId(raw_item);
        if(packet_id <= 0) continue;

        if(raw_item == 134)
        {
            new skin_param = PlayerInventory[playerid][i][invValue];
            if(skin_param < 1) skin_param = GetPlayerSkin(playerid);
            if(skin_param < 1) skin_param = 1;
            Inv_FlatJsonPutInt(dest, dest_size, 134, is_first);
            Inv_FlatJsonPutInt(dest, dest_size, skin_param, is_first);
            Inv_FlatJsonPutInt(dest, dest_size, i, is_first);
            Inv_FlatJsonPutInt(dest, dest_size, PlayerInventory[playerid][i][invCount], is_first);
        }
        else if(Inv_RawIsSimItem(raw_item))
        {
            new sim_param = PlayerInventory[playerid][i][invValue];
            if(sim_param < 1) sim_param = 1;
            Inv_FlatJsonPutInt(dest, dest_size, ITEM_SIM_CARD, is_first);
            Inv_FlatJsonPutInt(dest, dest_size, sim_param, is_first);
            Inv_FlatJsonPutInt(dest, dest_size, i, is_first);
            Inv_FlatJsonPutInt(dest, dest_size, 0, is_first);
        }
        else if(Inv_RawIsFuelCanister(raw_item))
        {
            new fuel_param = PlayerInventory[playerid][i][invValue];
            if(fuel_param < 1) fuel_param = PlayerInventory[playerid][i][invCount];
            if(fuel_param < 1) fuel_param = 1;
            Inv_FlatJsonPutInt(dest, dest_size, ITEM_FUEL_CANISTER, is_first);
            Inv_FlatJsonPutInt(dest, dest_size, fuel_param, is_first);
            Inv_FlatJsonPutInt(dest, dest_size, i, is_first);
            Inv_FlatJsonPutInt(dest, dest_size, 0, is_first);
        }
        else if(IsPlateItem(raw_item))
        {
            new combined[48];
            if(strlen(g_InvPlateRegion[playerid][i]) > 0)
                format(combined, sizeof combined, "%s|%s", g_InvPlateNumber[playerid][i], g_InvPlateRegion[playerid][i]);
            else
                format(combined, sizeof combined, "%s", g_InvPlateNumber[playerid][i]);

            Inv_FlatJsonPutPlateQuad(dest, dest_size, packet_id, combined, i, is_first);
        }
        else
        {
            new disp_val = PlayerInventory[playerid][i][invCount];
            if(IsItemAccessory(raw_item) > 0 || Inv_IsBackpackItem(raw_item))
            {
                if(PlayerInventory[playerid][i][invValue] > 0)
                    disp_val = PlayerInventory[playerid][i][invValue];
            }
            if(disp_val < 1) disp_val = 1;
            Inv_FlatJsonPutInt(dest, dest_size, packet_id, is_first);
            Inv_FlatJsonPutInt(dest, dest_size, disp_val, is_first);
            Inv_FlatJsonPutInt(dest, dest_size, i, is_first);
            Inv_FlatJsonPutInt(dest, dest_size, 0, is_first);
        }
    }
    strcat(dest, "]", dest_size);
    return 1;
}

// ˜˜˜˜˜˜˜ it[] ˜˜˜ BR: JSON_Parse(flat) ˜ ˜˜˜˜˜˜ JSON_Array() ˜˜˜ node_len=0 ˜ ˜˜˜˜˜˜˜˜ ˜˜˜˜˜ JSON_Append ˜˜˜˜˜˜˜˜˜˜.
stock Node:Inv_FlatNodePushInt(Node:arr, value)
{
    return JSON_Append(arr, JSON_Int(value));
}

stock Node:Inv_FlatNodePushStr(Node:arr, const str[])
{
    return JSON_Append(arr, JSON_String(str));
}

stock Node:Inv_BuildItemArrayFlatNodes(playerid)
{
    new Node:arr = JSON_Array();

    for(new i = 0; i < MAX_INV_SLOTS; i++)
    {
        new raw_item = PlayerInventory[playerid][i][invItem];
        if(raw_item <= 0) continue;
        if(Inv_ShouldHideFromInventoryGrid(playerid, i)) continue;

        new packet_id = Inv_PacketItemId(raw_item);
        if(packet_id <= 0) continue;

        if(raw_item == 134)
        {
            new skin_param = PlayerInventory[playerid][i][invValue];
            if(skin_param < 1) skin_param = GetPlayerSkin(playerid);
            if(skin_param < 1) skin_param = 1;
            arr = Inv_FlatNodePushInt(arr, 134);
            arr = Inv_FlatNodePushInt(arr, skin_param);
            arr = Inv_FlatNodePushInt(arr, i);
            arr = Inv_FlatNodePushInt(arr, PlayerInventory[playerid][i][invCount]);
        }
        else if(Inv_RawIsSimItem(raw_item))
        {
            new sim_param = PlayerInventory[playerid][i][invValue];
            if(sim_param < 1) sim_param = 1;
            arr = Inv_FlatNodePushInt(arr, ITEM_SIM_CARD);
            arr = Inv_FlatNodePushInt(arr, sim_param);
            arr = Inv_FlatNodePushInt(arr, i);
            arr = Inv_FlatNodePushInt(arr, 0);
        }
        else if(Inv_RawIsFuelCanister(raw_item))
        {
            new fuel_param = PlayerInventory[playerid][i][invValue];
            if(fuel_param < 1) fuel_param = PlayerInventory[playerid][i][invCount];
            if(fuel_param < 1) fuel_param = 1;
            arr = Inv_FlatNodePushInt(arr, ITEM_FUEL_CANISTER);
            arr = Inv_FlatNodePushInt(arr, fuel_param);
            arr = Inv_FlatNodePushInt(arr, i);
            arr = Inv_FlatNodePushInt(arr, 0);
        }
        else if(IsPlateItem(raw_item))
        {
            new combined[48];
            if(strlen(g_InvPlateRegion[playerid][i]) > 0)
                format(combined, sizeof combined, "%s|%s", g_InvPlateNumber[playerid][i], g_InvPlateRegion[playerid][i]);
            else
                format(combined, sizeof combined, "%s", g_InvPlateNumber[playerid][i]);

            arr = Inv_FlatNodePushInt(arr, packet_id);
            arr = Inv_FlatNodePushStr(arr, combined);
            arr = Inv_FlatNodePushInt(arr, i);
            arr = Inv_FlatNodePushInt(arr, 0);
        }
        else
        {
            new disp_cnt = PlayerInventory[playerid][i][invCount];
            if(disp_cnt < 1) disp_cnt = 1;
            arr = Inv_FlatNodePushInt(arr, packet_id);
            arr = Inv_FlatNodePushInt(arr, disp_cnt);
            arr = Inv_FlatNodePushInt(arr, i);
            arr = Inv_FlatNodePushInt(arr, 0);
        }
    }
    return arr;
}

// ˜˜˜ last/16.05.26: ˜˜˜˜˜˜˜˜˜ [[id,...],...] ˜ JSON_SetArray ˜ ˜˜˜˜˜˜ stringify-˜˜˜˜ ˜˜˜˜˜˜˜˜˜.
stock Node:Inv_BuildItemArrayNested(playerid)
{
    new Node:itArray = JSON_Array();

    for(new i = 0; i < MAX_INV_SLOTS; i++)
    {
        new raw_item = PlayerInventory[playerid][i][invItem];
        if(raw_item <= 0) continue;
        if(Inv_ShouldHideFromInventoryGrid(playerid, i)) continue;

        new packet_id = Inv_PacketItemId(raw_item);
        if(packet_id <= 0) continue;

        new Node:tempItem;

        if(raw_item == 134)
        {
            new skin_param = PlayerInventory[playerid][i][invValue];
            if(skin_param < 1) skin_param = GetPlayerSkin(playerid);
            if(skin_param < 1) skin_param = 1;
            tempItem = JSON_Array(
                JSON_Int(134),
                JSON_Int(skin_param),
                JSON_Int(i),
                JSON_Int(PlayerInventory[playerid][i][invCount])
            );
        }
        else if(Inv_RawIsSimItem(raw_item))
        {
            new sim_param = PlayerInventory[playerid][i][invValue];
            if(sim_param < 1) sim_param = 1;
            tempItem = JSON_Array(
                JSON_Int(ITEM_SIM_CARD),
                JSON_Int(sim_param),
                JSON_Int(i),
                JSON_Int(0)
            );
        }
        else if(Inv_RawIsFuelCanister(raw_item))
        {
            new fuel_param = PlayerInventory[playerid][i][invValue];
            if(fuel_param < 1) fuel_param = PlayerInventory[playerid][i][invCount];
            if(fuel_param < 1) fuel_param = 1;
            tempItem = JSON_Array(
                JSON_Int(ITEM_FUEL_CANISTER),
                JSON_Int(fuel_param),
                JSON_Int(i),
                JSON_Int(0)
            );
        }
        else if(IsPlateItem(raw_item))
        {
            new combined[48];
            if(strlen(g_InvPlateRegion[playerid][i]) > 0)
                format(combined, sizeof combined, "%s|%s", g_InvPlateNumber[playerid][i], g_InvPlateRegion[playerid][i]);
            else
                format(combined, sizeof combined, "%s", g_InvPlateNumber[playerid][i]);

            tempItem = JSON_Array(
                JSON_Int(packet_id),
                JSON_String(combined),
                JSON_Int(i),
                JSON_Int(0)
            );
        }
        else
        {
            new disp_cnt = PlayerInventory[playerid][i][invCount];
            if(disp_cnt < 1) disp_cnt = 1;
            tempItem = JSON_Array(
                JSON_Int(packet_id),
                JSON_Int(disp_cnt),
                JSON_Int(i),
                JSON_Int(0)
            );
        }
        itArray = JSON_Append(itArray, tempItem);
    }
    return itArray;
}

stock Node:Inv_BuildItemArrayFromFlat(const flat[], dest_size)
{
    #pragma unused dest_size
    new Node:itArray;
    if(strlen(flat) > 2)
        JSON_Parse(flat, itArray);
    return itArray;
}

stock Node:Inv_BuildItemArray(playerid)
{
    new Node:arr = Inv_BuildItemArrayFlatNodes(playerid);
    new alen, dbg[256];
    JSON_ArrayLength(arr, alen);
    JSON_Stringify(arr, dbg, sizeof dbg);
    if(alen > 0 && strlen(dbg) > 2) return arr;

    print("[INV it] FlatNodes empty ˜ fallback nested");
    return Inv_BuildItemArrayNested(playerid);
}

// ai[] ˜ ˜˜˜˜˜˜ ˜˜˜˜˜˜˜ ˜˜˜˜˜˜˜ ˜˜˜˜˜˜˜˜ (˜˜˜ ˜˜˜˜˜˜˜˜˜ id 2/141).
stock Inv_BuildDefaultAiArray(playerid, &Node:aiArray)
{
    new flat[1024];
    Inv_BuildFlatAiJsonString(playerid, flat, sizeof flat);
    aiArray = JSON_Array();
    if(strlen(flat) > 2)
        JSON_Parse(flat, aiArray);
    else
    {
        aiArray = JSON_Array(
            JSON_Int(134), JSON_Int(GetPlayerSkin(playerid)), JSON_Int(6), JSON_Int(0)
        );
    }
    return 1;
}

stock Inv_CountPackedInvItems(playerid)
{
    new cnt;
    for(new i = 0; i < MAX_INV_SLOTS; i++)
    {
        if(PlayerInventory[playerid][i][invItem] <= 0) continue;
        if(Inv_ShouldHideFromInventoryGrid(playerid, i)) continue;
        if(Inv_PacketItemId(PlayerInventory[playerid][i][invItem]) > 0) cnt++;
    }
    return cnt;
}

stock Inv_LogItFlatPreview(playerid, const flat_json[])
{
    new line[560];
    format(line, sizeof line, "[INV it] uid=%d build=v5 len=%d data=%.480s",
        Player[playerid][pID], strlen(flat_json), flat_json);
    print(line);
}

// JSON_Parse ˜˜˜˜˜˜˜˜ it[] ˜˜ ˜˜˜˜˜˜˜˜ ˜ ˜˜˜˜˜˜˜˜˜ ˜˜˜˜˜˜˜ flat_it ˜ JSON-˜˜˜˜˜ ˜˜˜˜˜˜ (BR GUI 33).
stock Inv_BuildFlatAiJsonString(playerid, dest[], dest_size)
{
    Inv_NormalizeWornAccessories(playerid);
    new bool:cat_added[ACC_CAT_BACKPACK + 1];
    for(new c = 0; c <= ACC_CAT_BACKPACK; c++) cat_added[c] = false;

    dest[0] = '\0';
    strcat(dest, "[", dest_size);
    new bool:is_first = true;

    Inv_FlatJsonPutInt(dest, dest_size, 134, is_first);
    Inv_FlatJsonPutInt(dest, dest_size, GetPlayerSkin(playerid), is_first);
    Inv_FlatJsonPutInt(dest, dest_size, 6, is_first);
    Inv_FlatJsonPutInt(dest, dest_size, 0, is_first);

    for(new i = 0; i < MAX_INV_SLOTS; i++)
    {
        new item_id = Inv_ClientCatalogId(PlayerInventory[playerid][i][invItem]);
        if(item_id <= 0 || PlayerInventory[playerid][i][invValue] != 1) continue;
        if(IsItemAccessory(item_id) <= 0 && !Inv_IsBackpackItem(item_id)) continue;

        if(Inv_IsWearableAccessory(item_id))
        {
            new category = Inv_GetAccessoryCategory(item_id);
            if(cat_added[category]) continue;
            cat_added[category] = true;
        }

        new disp_cnt = PlayerInventory[playerid][i][invCount];
        if(IsItemAccessory(item_id) > 0 || Inv_IsBackpackItem(item_id))
        {
            if(PlayerInventory[playerid][i][invValue] > 0)
                disp_cnt = PlayerInventory[playerid][i][invValue];
        }
        if(disp_cnt < 1) disp_cnt = 1;
        Inv_FlatJsonPutInt(dest, dest_size, item_id, is_first);
        Inv_FlatJsonPutInt(dest, dest_size, disp_cnt, is_first);
        Inv_FlatJsonPutInt(dest, dest_size, Inv_GetAiSlotPos(item_id), is_first);
        Inv_FlatJsonPutInt(dest, dest_size, 0, is_first);
    }
    strcat(dest, "]", dest_size);
    return 1;
}

stock Inv_BuildInventoryOpenJson(playerid, const flat_it[], dest[], dest_size)
{
    new name[MAX_PLAYER_NAME], esc[64];
    GetPlayerName(playerid, name, sizeof name);
    Inv_EscapeJsonString(name, esc, sizeof esc);

    new flat_ai[1024];
    Inv_BuildFlatAiJsonString(playerid, flat_ai, sizeof flat_ai);

    format(dest, dest_size,
        "{\"o\":1,\"i\":0,\"it\":%s,\"ai\":%s,\"nm\":%d,\"n\":\"%s\",\"lv\":%d,\"id\":%d,\"w\":%d,\"mw\":%d,\"sl\":%d,\"s\":%d,\"v\":%d,\"ps\":%d,\"m\":%d}",
        flat_it, flat_ai,
        GetPlayerSimCard(playerid), esc,
        Player[playerid][pLevel], playerid,
        Inventory_GetTotalWeight(playerid), Inventory_GetMaxCarryWeight(playerid), MAX_INV_SLOTS,
        Satiety_Get(playerid),
        Player[playerid][pVipType], GetPlayerSkin(playerid), GetPlayerMoneyEx(playerid));
    return 1;
}

stock Inv_BuildExchangeOpenJson(playerid, targetid, dest[], dest_size)
{
    new flat_it[4096], flat_ai[1024];
    new name[MAX_PLAYER_NAME], partner[MAX_PLAYER_NAME], esc[64], esc_en[64];
    Inv_BuildFlatItJsonString(playerid, flat_it, sizeof flat_it);
    Inv_BuildFlatAiJsonString(playerid, flat_ai, sizeof flat_ai);
    GetPlayerName(playerid, name, sizeof name);
    GetPlayerName(targetid, partner, sizeof partner);
    Inv_EscapeJsonString(name, esc, sizeof esc);
    Inv_EscapeJsonString(partner, esc_en, sizeof esc_en);

    format(dest, dest_size,
        "{\"o\":1,\"i\":1,\"it\":%s,\"ai\":%s,\"nm\":%d,\"n\":\"%s\",\"en\":\"%s\",\"lv\":%d,\"id\":%d,\"w\":%d,\"mw\":%d,\"sl\":%d,\"s\":%d,\"v\":%d,\"ps\":%d,\"m\":%d}",
        flat_it, flat_ai,
        GetPlayerSimCard(playerid), esc, esc_en,
        Player[playerid][pLevel], playerid,
        Inventory_GetTotalWeight(playerid), Inventory_GetMaxCarryWeight(playerid), MAX_INV_SLOTS,
        Satiety_Get(playerid),
        Player[playerid][pVipType], GetPlayerSkin(playerid), GetPlayerMoneyEx(playerid));
    return 1;
}

stock Inv_LogJsonItSnippet(const full_json[])
{
    new pos = strfind(full_json, "\"it\":");
    if(pos == -1)
    {
        print("[INV json] it field MISSING in packet");
        return;
    }
    new line[256];
    format(line, sizeof line, "[INV json] %.220s", full_json[pos]);
    print(line);
}

stock Inv_LogInventoryOpenDiagnostics(playerid)
{
    new raw_cnt;
    for(new i = 0; i < MAX_INV_SLOTS; i++)
        if(PlayerInventory[playerid][i][invItem] > 0) raw_cnt++;

    new packed = Inv_CountPackedInvItems(playerid);
    new line[144];
    format(line, sizeof line, "[INV diag] uid=%d raw=%d packed=%d weight=%d",
        Player[playerid][pID], raw_cnt, packed, Inventory_GetTotalWeight(playerid));
    print(line);

    for(new i = 0; i < MAX_INV_SLOTS; i++)
    {
        if(PlayerInventory[playerid][i][invItem] <= 0) continue;
        new raw_item = PlayerInventory[playerid][i][invItem];
        new pkt = Inv_PacketItemId(raw_item);
        format(line, sizeof line, "[INV pkt] slot %d raw=%d pkt=%d cnt=%d val=%d",
            i, raw_item, pkt, PlayerInventory[playerid][i][invCount], PlayerInventory[playerid][i][invValue]);
        print(line);
    }
}

// ˜˜˜˜˜˜ ˜˜˜˜˜˜˜˜˜˜ ˜˜˜˜˜ + ˜˜˜˜˜˜ (BR GUI 33, MigrateItemsFromAny ˜ ˜˜˜˜˜˜˜ it[]).
// it/ai ˜ ˜˜˜˜˜˜ ˜˜˜˜˜˜˜: ˜˜˜ ˜˜˜˜˜˜˜ ˜˜˜˜˜˜˜˜˜˜˜ JSON (~1 KB) ˜˜˜˜˜ ˜˜˜˜˜˜˜˜˜ ˜˜˜˜˜, ˜ w ˜˜˜˜˜˜˜.
stock Inv_AttachFullInventoryArrays(playerid, Node:response)
{
    new Node:itArray = Inv_BuildItemArray(playerid);
    new Node:aiArray;
    Inv_BuildDefaultAiArray(playerid, aiArray);

    JSON_SetArray(response, "it", itArray);
    JSON_SetArray(response, "ai", aiArray);
    JSON_SetInt(response, "nm", GetPlayerSimCard(playerid));
    return 1;
}

stock bool:Inv_MoveActiveSimToInventorySlot(playerid, inv_slot)
{
    if(inv_slot < 0 || inv_slot >= MAX_INV_SLOTS) return false;
    if(Player[playerid][pSimCard] <= 0) return false;

    new old_active = Player[playerid][pSimCard];

    if(PlayerInventory[playerid][inv_slot][invItem] == 0)
    {
        SetPlayerSimCardSilent(playerid, 0);
        PlayerInventory[playerid][inv_slot][invItem] = ITEM_SIM_CARD;
        PlayerInventory[playerid][inv_slot][invCount] = 1;
        PlayerInventory[playerid][inv_slot][invValue] = old_active;
        new q[200];
        mysql_format(db_handle, q, sizeof q,
            "INSERT INTO `inventory` (`uid`, `item_id`, `count`, `slot`, `value`) VALUES (%d, %d, 1, %d, %d)",
            Player[playerid][pID], ITEM_SIM_CARD, inv_slot, old_active);
        mysql_tquery(db_handle, q, "OnItemInserted", "ii", playerid, inv_slot);
        return true;
    }

    if(Inv_RawIsSimItem(PlayerInventory[playerid][inv_slot][invItem]))
    {
        new clicked_sim = PlayerInventory[playerid][inv_slot][invValue];
        SetPlayerSimCardSilent(playerid, clicked_sim);
        UpdateInventorySimValue(playerid, inv_slot, old_active);
        return true;
    }
    return false;
}

// ˜˜˜˜˜ ˜˜˜˜ ˜˜˜˜˜˜ GUI 33 ˜˜˜ ˜˜˜˜˜˜˜˜˜˜˜˜ (o=1 ˜˜˜˜˜˜˜˜˜ ˜˜˜˜˜˜˜ ˜˜˜˜˜˜˜˜˜ ˜˜ ˜˜˜˜˜˜˜).
// it/ai ˜˜˜˜ ˜˜ ˜˜˜˜˜: ˜˜˜˜˜˜ ˜˜˜˜˜˜˜˜˜ ˜˜˜˜˜ ˜˜˜˜˜ t + i (migrate), ˜ ˜˜ ˜˜˜˜˜˜ reload.
stock Inv_ApplyActionResponseDefaults(playerid, Node:response)
{
    JSON_SetInt(response, "nw", Inventory_GetMaxCarryWeight(playerid));
    JSON_SetInt(response, "ns", MAX_INV_SLOTS);
    JSON_SetInt(response, "w", Inventory_GetTotalWeight(playerid));
    return 1;
}

forward Inv_ClearRefreshFlag(playerid);
public Inv_ClearRefreshFlag(playerid)
{
    if(IsPlayerConnected(playerid))
        DeletePVar(playerid, "inv_refreshing");
    return 1;
}

// BR-˜˜˜˜˜˜ ˜˜˜˜˜ ˜˜˜˜˜˜˜˜˜/˜˜˜˜˜˜˜˜˜˜˜˜˜˜ ˜˜˜˜˜˜˜˜˜ ˜˜˜˜˜ ˜˜˜˜˜˜ ˜˜˜˜˜˜˜˜ (deleteItem/migrate).
// ˜˜˜˜˜˜ ˜˜˜˜˜˜˜˜ (c:1) ˜ ˜˜˜˜˜˜˜˜ (o:1) ˜ ˜˜˜˜˜ it[]/ai[] ˜˜˜˜˜˜˜ ˜ ˜˜˜˜˜˜˜˜.
stock Inv_RefreshInventoryGui(playerid)
{
    if(!IsPlayerConnected(playerid))
        return 0;

    new trade_peer = INVALID_PLAYER_ID;
    if(Trade_IsActive(playerid))
        trade_peer = g_TradePartner[playerid];

    SetPVarInt(playerid, "inv_refreshing", 1);
    SetTimerEx("Inv_ClearRefreshFlag", 800, false, "i", playerid);

    if(GetPVarInt(playerid, "inv_gui_open"))
    {
        new Node:closePkt = JSON_Object();
        JSON_SetInt(closePkt, "c", 1);
        OnPacketIncoming(playerid, 33, closePkt);
        JSON_Cleanup(closePkt);
    }
    DeletePVar(playerid, "inv_gui_open");

    if(trade_peer != INVALID_PLAYER_ID && IsPlayerConnected(trade_peer))
        Trade_PushExchangeUi(playerid, trade_peer);
    else
        Inventory(playerid);
    return 1;
}

stock Inv_DispatchInvActionResult(playerid, Node:response, bool:no_full_reload, bool:force_refresh = false)
{
    new pkt_t = 0, pkt_s = 0, pkt_i = 0;
    JSON_GetInt(response, "t", pkt_t);
    JSON_GetInt(response, "s", pkt_s);
    JSON_GetInt(response, "i", pkt_i);

    // SIM (t:19) ˜ ˜˜˜˜˜˜˜˜˜ migrate. ˜˜˜˜˜˜˜˜ (t:18) ˜ ˜˜˜˜˜˜˜˜˜˜ (˜˜˜˜˜˜˜ ˜ ˜.˜.) ˜ c:1 + o:1.
    if(pkt_s == 1 && (force_refresh || (!no_full_reload && pkt_t == 18)))
    {
        JSON_Cleanup(response);
        Inv_RefreshInventoryGui(playerid);
        return 1;
    }

    OnPacketIncoming(playerid, 33, response);
    JSON_Cleanup(response);
    return 1;
}

stock Inv_SwapInventorySlots(playerid, slot_a, slot_b)
{
    if(slot_a < 0 || slot_a >= MAX_INV_SLOTS) return 0;
    if(slot_b < 0 || slot_b >= MAX_INV_SLOTS) return 0;
    if(slot_a == slot_b) return 1;

    new tmp_id, tmp_item, tmp_cnt, tmp_val;
    new tmp_plate[16], tmp_reg[8];

    tmp_id = PlayerInventory[playerid][slot_a][invID];
    tmp_item = PlayerInventory[playerid][slot_a][invItem];
    tmp_cnt = PlayerInventory[playerid][slot_a][invCount];
    tmp_val = PlayerInventory[playerid][slot_a][invValue];
    format(tmp_plate, sizeof tmp_plate, "%s", g_InvPlateNumber[playerid][slot_a]);
    format(tmp_reg, sizeof tmp_reg, "%s", g_InvPlateRegion[playerid][slot_a]);

    PlayerInventory[playerid][slot_a][invID] = PlayerInventory[playerid][slot_b][invID];
    PlayerInventory[playerid][slot_a][invItem] = PlayerInventory[playerid][slot_b][invItem];
    PlayerInventory[playerid][slot_a][invCount] = PlayerInventory[playerid][slot_b][invCount];
    PlayerInventory[playerid][slot_a][invValue] = PlayerInventory[playerid][slot_b][invValue];
    format(g_InvPlateNumber[playerid][slot_a], 16, "%s", g_InvPlateNumber[playerid][slot_b]);
    format(g_InvPlateRegion[playerid][slot_a], 8, "%s", g_InvPlateRegion[playerid][slot_b]);

    PlayerInventory[playerid][slot_b][invID] = tmp_id;
    PlayerInventory[playerid][slot_b][invItem] = tmp_item;
    PlayerInventory[playerid][slot_b][invCount] = tmp_cnt;
    PlayerInventory[playerid][slot_b][invValue] = tmp_val;
    format(g_InvPlateNumber[playerid][slot_b], 16, "%s", tmp_plate);
    format(g_InvPlateRegion[playerid][slot_b], 8, "%s", tmp_reg);

    new q[192];
    if(PlayerInventory[playerid][slot_a][invID] > 0)
    {
        mysql_format(db_handle, q, sizeof q, "UPDATE `inventory` SET `slot`=%d, `value`=%d WHERE `id`=%d",
            slot_a, PlayerInventory[playerid][slot_a][invValue], PlayerInventory[playerid][slot_a][invID]);
        mysql_tquery(db_handle, q);
    }
    else if(Player[playerid][pID] > 0)
    {
        mysql_format(db_handle, q, sizeof q, "UPDATE `inventory` SET `slot`=%d, `value`=%d WHERE `uid`=%d AND `slot`=%d",
            slot_a, PlayerInventory[playerid][slot_a][invValue], Player[playerid][pID], slot_b);
        mysql_tquery(db_handle, q);
    }

    if(PlayerInventory[playerid][slot_b][invID] > 0)
    {
        mysql_format(db_handle, q, sizeof q, "UPDATE `inventory` SET `slot`=%d, `value`=%d WHERE `id`=%d",
            slot_b, PlayerInventory[playerid][slot_b][invValue], PlayerInventory[playerid][slot_b][invID]);
        mysql_tquery(db_handle, q);
    }
    else if(Player[playerid][pID] > 0)
    {
        mysql_format(db_handle, q, sizeof q, "UPDATE `inventory` SET `slot`=%d, `value`=%d WHERE `uid`=%d AND `slot`=%d",
            slot_b, PlayerInventory[playerid][slot_b][invValue], Player[playerid][pID], slot_a);
        mysql_tquery(db_handle, q);
    }
    return 1;
}

CMD:addskin(playerid, params[])
{
    new targetid, skin;
    if(sscanf(params, "ui", targetid, skin)) return SendClientMessage(playerid, -1, "use: /addskin [id] [skin_id]");
    if(targetid == INVALID_PLAYER_ID) return 1;

    if(!GivePlayerSkin(targetid, skin)) return SendClientMessage(playerid, -1, "Failed to give skin.");
    
    return 1;
}

stock Inventory(playerid)
{
    Inv_NormalizeWornAccessories(playerid);

    new name[MAX_PLAYER_NAME];
    GetPlayerName(playerid, name, sizeof(name));

    new dbg_open[144];
    format(dbg_open, sizeof dbg_open, "[INV open] uid=%d packed=%d weight=%d/%d",
        Player[playerid][pID], Inv_CountPackedInvItems(playerid),
        Inventory_GetTotalWeight(playerid), Inventory_GetMaxCarryWeight(playerid));
    print(dbg_open);
    Inv_LogInventoryOpenDiagnostics(playerid);

    new flat_it[4096];
    Inv_BuildFlatItJsonString(playerid, flat_it, sizeof flat_it);
    Inv_LogItFlatPreview(playerid, flat_it);

    if(strlen(flat_it) > 2)
    {
        Inv_BuildInventoryOpenJson(playerid, flat_it, g_GuiJsonOutBuf, sizeof g_GuiJsonOutBuf);
        new json_len = strlen(g_GuiJsonOutBuf);
        format(dbg_open, sizeof dbg_open, "[INV json] total_len=%d mode=direct", json_len);
        print(dbg_open);
        Inv_LogJsonItSnippet(g_GuiJsonOutBuf);

        new Node:probe = Inv_BuildItemArray(playerid);
        new probe_buf[256], probe_elems;
        JSON_Stringify(probe, probe_buf, sizeof probe_buf);
        JSON_ArrayLength(probe, probe_elems);
        format(dbg_open, sizeof dbg_open, "[INV it] nodes_str=%d elems=%d preview=%.120s",
            strlen(probe_buf), probe_elems, probe_buf);
        print(dbg_open);
        JSON_Cleanup(probe);

        if(json_len >= 1000)
            print("[INV json] WARNING: packet >= 1000 bytes, client may truncate");

        OnPacketIncomingStr(playerid, 33, g_GuiJsonOutBuf);
        SetPVarInt(playerid, "inv_gui_open", 1);
        return 1;
    }

    print("[INV it] flat empty ˜ fallback JSON_Object nested");
    new Node:JSONObject = JSON_Object();
    new Node:itArray = Inv_BuildItemArrayNested(playerid);
    new Node:aiArray;
    Inv_BuildDefaultAiArray(playerid, aiArray);

    JSON_SetInt(JSONObject, "o", 1);
    JSON_SetInt(JSONObject, "i", 0);
    JSON_SetArray(JSONObject, "it", itArray);
    JSON_SetArray(JSONObject, "ai", aiArray);
    JSON_SetInt(JSONObject, "nm", GetPlayerSimCard(playerid));
    JSON_SetString(JSONObject, "n", name);
    JSON_SetInt(JSONObject, "lv", Player[playerid][pLevel]);
    JSON_SetInt(JSONObject, "id", playerid);
    JSON_SetInt(JSONObject, "w", Inventory_GetTotalWeight(playerid));
    JSON_SetInt(JSONObject, "mw", Inventory_GetMaxCarryWeight(playerid));
    JSON_SetInt(JSONObject, "sl", MAX_INV_SLOTS);
    JSON_SetInt(JSONObject, "s", Satiety_Get(playerid));
    JSON_SetInt(JSONObject, "v", Player[playerid][pVipType]);
    JSON_SetInt(JSONObject, "ps", GetPlayerSkin(playerid));
    JSON_SetInt(JSONObject, "m", GetPlayerMoneyEx(playerid));

    g_GuiJsonOutBuf[0] = '\0';
    JSON_Stringify(JSONObject, g_GuiJsonOutBuf, sizeof g_GuiJsonOutBuf);
    format(dbg_open, sizeof dbg_open, "[INV json] total_len=%d", strlen(g_GuiJsonOutBuf));
    print(dbg_open);
    Inv_LogJsonItSnippet(g_GuiJsonOutBuf);
    OnPacketIncoming(playerid, 33, JSONObject);
    JSON_Cleanup(JSONObject);
    SetPVarInt(playerid, "inv_gui_open", 1);
    return 1;
}

// ˜˜˜˜˜: ˜˜˜˜ ˜˜˜˜˜˜˜˜˜ ˜˜˜ ˜˜˜˜˜˜ ˜ ˜˜˜˜˜˜ t:17 (˜˜˜ o:1, ˜˜˜˜˜ ˜˜˜˜˜ ˜˜˜˜˜˜˜˜ ˜ ˜˜˜˜ ˜˜˜˜˜˜˜˜).
stock Trade_PushExchangeUi(playerid, targetid)
{
    if(!IsPlayerConnected(playerid) || !IsPlayerConnected(targetid))
        return 0;

    Inv_NormalizeWornAccessories(playerid);

    if(GetPVarInt(playerid, "inv_gui_open"))
    {
        new esc_en[64], layout[160];
        Inv_EscapeJsonString(Player[targetid][pName], esc_en, sizeof esc_en);
        format(layout, sizeof layout, "{\"t\":17,\"en\":\"%s\"}", esc_en);
        Trade_SendJsonStr(playerid, layout);
        return 1;
    }

    g_GuiJsonOutBuf[0] = '\0';
    Inv_BuildExchangeOpenJson(playerid, targetid, g_GuiJsonOutBuf, sizeof g_GuiJsonOutBuf);
    OnPacketIncomingStr(playerid, 33, g_GuiJsonOutBuf);
    SetPVarInt(playerid, "inv_gui_open", 1);
    return 1;
}

stock InventoryExchange(playerid, targetid)
{
    return Trade_PushExchangeUi(playerid, targetid);
}

CMD:accedit(playerid, params[])
{
    new slot = -1;
    if(sscanf(params, "d", slot) != 1 || slot < 0 || slot >= MAX_INV_SLOTS)
    {
        for(new i = 0; i < MAX_INV_SLOTS; i++)
        {
            if(PlayerInventory[playerid][i][invValue] == 1 && IsItemAccessory(PlayerInventory[playerid][i][invItem]) > 0)
            {
                slot = i;
                break;
            }
        }
    }
    if(slot < 0 || slot >= MAX_INV_SLOTS || PlayerInventory[playerid][slot][invItem] <= 0 || IsItemAccessory(PlayerInventory[playerid][slot][invItem]) <= 0)
    {
        SendClientMessage(playerid, 0xFF5555FF, "˜˜˜˜˜˜˜ ˜˜˜˜˜˜˜˜ ˜˜˜˜˜˜˜˜˜ ˜˜˜˜˜ ˜˜˜˜˜˜˜˜˜˜˜˜˜˜ ˜ ˜˜˜˜˜˜˜˜˜.");
        return 1;
    }
    if(PlayerInventory[playerid][slot][invValue] != 1)
    {
        SendClientMessage(playerid, 0xFF5555FF, "˜˜˜˜ ˜˜˜˜˜˜˜˜˜ ˜˜ ˜˜˜˜˜.");
        return 1;
    }
    new inv_db = Inv_EnsureInventoryDbId(playerid, slot);
    if(inv_db <= 0)
    {
        SendClientMessage(playerid, 0xFF5555FF, "˜˜ ˜˜˜˜˜˜˜ ˜˜˜˜˜˜˜˜ ID ˜˜˜˜˜˜˜˜. ˜˜˜˜˜˜˜˜ ˜˜˜˜˜˜˜˜˜ ˜ ˜˜˜˜˜˜˜˜˜.");
        return 1;
    }

    new item_id = PlayerInventory[playerid][slot][invItem];
    new model_acs = IsItemAccessory(item_id);
    if(model_acs <= 0)
    {
        SendClientMessage(playerid, 0xFF5555FF, "˜˜˜˜˜˜˜˜˜˜˜ ˜˜˜˜˜˜˜˜˜ (˜˜˜ modelid ˜ ˜˜˜˜˜˜˜˜).");
        return 1;
    }
    Inv_EnsureAccessoryRow(playerid, slot);
    new edit_bone;
    new Float:ebx, Float:eby, Float:ebz, Float:erx, Float:ery, Float:erz, Float:esc;
    Inv_GetAccessoryPreset(item_id, edit_bone, ebx, eby, ebz, erx, ery, erz, esc);
    StartAccessoryEdit(playerid, model_acs, edit_bone, Inv_GetAttachSlot(item_id), inv_db, slot);
    return 1;
}

CMD:inv(playerid, params[])
{
    Inventory(playerid);
    return 1;
}

CMD:exchange(playerid, params[])
{
    if(Trade_IsActive(playerid))
    {
        SendClientMessage(playerid, 0xFF6347FF, "˜˜ ˜˜˜ ˜ ˜˜˜˜˜˜. ˜˜˜˜˜˜˜ ˜˜˜˜˜˜˜˜˜ ˜˜˜˜˜˜.");
        return 1;
    }
    Trade_ClearGhostTradeState(playerid);
    new targetid;
    if(sscanf(params, "u", targetid))
        return Trade_BeginPlayerSelect(playerid);

    if(!IsPlayerConnected(targetid) || targetid == playerid || Player[targetid][pID] <= 0)
    {
        SendClientMessage(playerid, 0xFF6347FF, "˜˜˜˜˜ ˜˜ ˜˜˜˜˜˜.");
        return 1;
    }
    if(!Trade_SendInvite(playerid, targetid))
        SendClientMessage(playerid, 0xFF6347FF, "˜˜ ˜˜˜˜˜˜˜ ˜˜˜˜˜˜˜˜˜ ˜˜˜˜˜˜˜˜˜˜˜ (˜˜˜˜˜˜˜˜˜ 5 ˜).");
    return 1;
}

// ----- begin: trunk (GUI 34) -----
#define GUI_TRUNK_ID            34
#define MAX_TRUNK_SLOTS         30
#define TRUNK_MAX_WEIGHT        380
#define NOTIFY_OFFER_TRUNK      46
#define VEH_UI_OFFER_DURATION   (5)

forward bool:ResolveVehicleOwnerSlot(vehicleid, &owner, &slot);

enum E_TRUNK_SLOT
{
    trID,
    trItem,
    trCount,
    trValue
}

new g_Trunk[MAX_VEHICLES][MAX_TRUNK_SLOTS][E_TRUNK_SLOT];
new g_TrunkPlateNum[MAX_VEHICLES][MAX_TRUNK_SLOTS][16];
new g_TrunkPlateReg[MAX_VEHICLES][MAX_TRUNK_SLOTS][8];
new g_TrunkLoadedDbId[MAX_VEHICLES];
new g_PlayerTrunkVeh[MAX_PLAYERS] = {INVALID_VEHICLE_ID, ...};
new bool:g_TrunkOfferShown[MAX_PLAYERS];
new g_TrunkOfferVeh[MAX_PLAYERS];
new g_TrunkOfferLastTime[MAX_PLAYERS];

stock bool:Trunk_CanStoreItem(item_id)
{
    if(item_id <= 0) return false;
    if(item_id == ITEM_SIM_CARD) return true;
    if(item_id == 134) return true;
    if(item_id == ITEM_MEDKIT || item_id == ITEM_REPAIR_KIT || item_id == ITEM_FUEL_CANISTER) return true;
    if(IsPlateItem(item_id)) return true;
    if(IsItemAccessory(item_id) > 0) return true;
    return false;
}

stock Trunk_ResetVehicle(vehicleid)
{
    if(vehicleid <= 0 || vehicleid >= MAX_VEHICLES) return 0;
    for(new i = 0; i < MAX_TRUNK_SLOTS; i++)
    {
        g_Trunk[vehicleid][i][trID] = 0;
        g_Trunk[vehicleid][i][trItem] = 0;
        g_Trunk[vehicleid][i][trCount] = 0;
        g_Trunk[vehicleid][i][trValue] = 0;
        g_TrunkPlateNum[vehicleid][i][0] = '\0';
        g_TrunkPlateReg[vehicleid][i][0] = '\0';
    }
    g_TrunkLoadedDbId[vehicleid] = 0;
    return 1;
}

stock Trunk_GetWeight(vehicleid)
{
    new total;
    for(new i = 0; i < MAX_TRUNK_SLOTS; i++)
    {
        if(g_Trunk[vehicleid][i][trItem] <= 0) continue;
        new cnt = g_Trunk[vehicleid][i][trCount];
        if(cnt < 1) cnt = 1;
        total += Inventory_GetItemUnitWeight(g_Trunk[vehicleid][i][trItem]) * cnt;
    }
    return total;
}

stock Trunk_FindFreeSlot(vehicleid)
{
    for(new i = 0; i < MAX_TRUNK_SLOTS; i++)
        if(g_Trunk[vehicleid][i][trItem] == 0) return i;
    return -1;
}

stock bool:Trunk_PlayerCanAccess(playerid, vehicleid)
{
    if(Player[playerid][pAdminVeh] == vehicleid) return true;
    new owner, slot;
    if(!ResolveVehicleOwnerSlot(vehicleid, owner, slot)) return false;
    if(owner == playerid) return true;
    if(Family_TryFamilyTrunkAccess(playerid, vehicleid, owner, slot))
        return true;
    return false;
}

stock bool:Trunk_GetCarDbId(vehicleid, &car_dbid)
{
    car_dbid = 0;
    new owner, slot;
    if(!ResolveVehicleOwnerSlot(vehicleid, owner, slot)) return false;
    car_dbid = VehicleInfo[owner][slot][vDBID];
    return (car_dbid > 0);
}

stock Trunk_AppendItemToFlatString(vehicleid, slot, dest[], dest_size, &bool:is_first)
{
    new raw_item = g_Trunk[vehicleid][slot][trItem];
    if(raw_item <= 0) return 0;

    new packet_id = Inv_PacketItemId(raw_item);
    if(packet_id <= 0) return 0;

    if(raw_item == 134)
    {
        Inv_FlatJsonPutInt(dest, dest_size, 134, is_first);
        Inv_FlatJsonPutInt(dest, dest_size, g_Trunk[vehicleid][slot][trValue], is_first);
        Inv_FlatJsonPutInt(dest, dest_size, slot, is_first);
        Inv_FlatJsonPutInt(dest, dest_size, g_Trunk[vehicleid][slot][trCount], is_first);
    }
    else if(Inv_RawIsSimItem(raw_item))
    {
        Inv_FlatJsonPutInt(dest, dest_size, ITEM_SIM_CARD, is_first);
        Inv_FlatJsonPutInt(dest, dest_size, g_Trunk[vehicleid][slot][trValue], is_first);
        Inv_FlatJsonPutInt(dest, dest_size, slot, is_first);
        Inv_FlatJsonPutInt(dest, dest_size, 0, is_first);
    }
    else if(Inv_RawIsFuelCanister(raw_item))
    {
        Inv_FlatJsonPutInt(dest, dest_size, ITEM_FUEL_CANISTER, is_first);
        Inv_FlatJsonPutInt(dest, dest_size, g_Trunk[vehicleid][slot][trValue], is_first);
        Inv_FlatJsonPutInt(dest, dest_size, slot, is_first);
        Inv_FlatJsonPutInt(dest, dest_size, 0, is_first);
    }
    else if(IsPlateItem(raw_item))
    {
        new combined[48];
        if(strlen(g_TrunkPlateReg[vehicleid][slot]) > 0)
            format(combined, sizeof combined, "%s|%s", g_TrunkPlateNum[vehicleid][slot], g_TrunkPlateReg[vehicleid][slot]);
        else
            format(combined, sizeof combined, "%s", g_TrunkPlateNum[vehicleid][slot]);
        Inv_FlatJsonPutPlateQuad(dest, dest_size, packet_id, combined, slot, is_first);
    }
    else
    {
        new disp_cnt = g_Trunk[vehicleid][slot][trCount];
        if(disp_cnt < 1) disp_cnt = 1;
        Inv_FlatJsonPutInt(dest, dest_size, packet_id, is_first);
        Inv_FlatJsonPutInt(dest, dest_size, disp_cnt, is_first);
        Inv_FlatJsonPutInt(dest, dest_size, slot, is_first);
        Inv_FlatJsonPutInt(dest, dest_size, 0, is_first);
    }
    return 1;
}

stock Trunk_BuildFlatIcJsonString(vehicleid, dest[], dest_size)
{
    dest[0] = '\0';
    strcat(dest, "[", dest_size);
    new bool:is_first = true;
    for(new t = 0; t < MAX_TRUNK_SLOTS; t++)
        Trunk_AppendItemToFlatString(vehicleid, t, dest, dest_size, is_first);
    strcat(dest, "]", dest_size);
    return 1;
}

stock Trunk_BuildOpenJson(playerid, vehicleid, dest[], dest_size)
{
    new name[MAX_PLAYER_NAME], esc[64];
    GetPlayerName(playerid, name, sizeof name);
    Inv_EscapeJsonString(name, esc, sizeof esc);

    new flat_it[4096], flat_ic[4096], flat_ai[1024];
    Inv_BuildFlatItJsonString(playerid, flat_it, sizeof flat_it);
    Trunk_BuildFlatIcJsonString(vehicleid, flat_ic, sizeof flat_ic);
    Inv_BuildFlatAiJsonString(playerid, flat_ai, sizeof flat_ai);

    format(dest, dest_size,
        "{\"o\":1,\"i\":0,\"tb\":0,\"it\":%s,\"ic\":%s,\"ai\":%s,\"nm\":%d,\"n\":\"%s\",\"lv\":%d,\"id\":%d,\"w\":%d,\"mw\":%d,\"bw\":%d,\"cw\":%d,\"sl\":%d,\"sb\":%d,\"v\":%d,\"ps\":%d,\"m\":%d,\"s\":100}",
        flat_it, flat_ic, flat_ai,
        GetPlayerSimCard(playerid), esc,
        Player[playerid][pLevel], playerid,
        Inventory_GetTotalWeight(playerid), Inventory_GetMaxCarryWeight(playerid),
        Trunk_GetWeight(vehicleid), TRUNK_MAX_WEIGHT,
        MAX_INV_SLOTS, MAX_TRUNK_SLOTS,
        Player[playerid][pVipType], GetPlayerSkin(playerid), GetPlayerMoneyEx(playerid));
    return 1;
}

stock Trunk_LogOpenJson(playerid, vehicleid, const json_str[])
{
    new line[256];
    format(line, sizeof line, "[TRUNK open] uid=%d veh=%d len=%d ic_pos=%d",
        Player[playerid][pID], vehicleid, strlen(json_str), strfind(json_str, "\"ic\":"));
    print(line);
    new ic_pos = strfind(json_str, "\"ic\":");
    if(ic_pos == -1)
        print("[TRUNK json] ic field MISSING");
    else
    {
        format(line, sizeof line, "[TRUNK json] %.180s", json_str[ic_pos]);
        print(line);
    }
}

stock Trunk_BuildPlayerItems(playerid, &Node:itArray)
{
    itArray = Inv_BuildItemArray(playerid);
    return 1;
}

stock Trunk_BuildActiveSlots(playerid, &Node:aiArray)
{
    Inventory_BuildActiveSlots(playerid, aiArray);
    return 1;
}

stock Trunk_ShowGUI(playerid, vehicleid)
{
    if(vehicleid <= 0 || vehicleid >= MAX_VEHICLES || !GetVehicleModel(vehicleid)) return 0;

    g_PlayerTrunkVeh[playerid] = vehicleid;
    g_TrunkOfferShown[playerid] = false;

    g_GuiJsonOutBuf[0] = '\0';
    Trunk_BuildOpenJson(playerid, vehicleid, g_GuiJsonOutBuf, sizeof g_GuiJsonOutBuf);
    Trunk_LogOpenJson(playerid, vehicleid, g_GuiJsonOutBuf);
    OnPacketIncomingStr(playerid, GUI_TRUNK_ID, g_GuiJsonOutBuf);
    return 1;
}

stock Trunk_DeleteSlotDb(vehicleid, slot)
{
    new row_id = g_Trunk[vehicleid][slot][trID];
    if(row_id <= 0) return 0;
    new q[128];
    mysql_format(db_handle, q, sizeof q, "DELETE FROM `trunk_plates` WHERE `trunk_id` = %d", row_id);
    mysql_tquery(db_handle, q);
    mysql_format(db_handle, q, sizeof q, "DELETE FROM `trunks` WHERE `id` = %d LIMIT 1", row_id);
    mysql_tquery(db_handle, q);
    g_Trunk[vehicleid][slot][trID] = 0;
    g_Trunk[vehicleid][slot][trItem] = 0;
    g_Trunk[vehicleid][slot][trCount] = 0;
    g_Trunk[vehicleid][slot][trValue] = 0;
    g_TrunkPlateNum[vehicleid][slot][0] = '\0';
    g_TrunkPlateReg[vehicleid][slot][0] = '\0';
    return 1;
}

stock Trunk_SaveSlot(vehicleid, slot, car_dbid)
{
    new item_id = g_Trunk[vehicleid][slot][trItem];
    if(item_id <= 0)
    {
        if(g_Trunk[vehicleid][slot][trID] > 0)
            Trunk_DeleteSlotDb(vehicleid, slot);
        return 1;
    }

    new q[384];
    if(g_Trunk[vehicleid][slot][trID] > 0)
    {
        mysql_format(db_handle, q, sizeof q,
            "UPDATE `trunks` SET `item_id`=%d, `amount`=%d, `value`=%d, `slot`=%d WHERE `id`=%d LIMIT 1",
            item_id, g_Trunk[vehicleid][slot][trCount], g_Trunk[vehicleid][slot][trValue], slot, g_Trunk[vehicleid][slot][trID]);
        mysql_tquery(db_handle, q);
        if(IsPlateItem(item_id))
        {
            mysql_format(db_handle, q, sizeof q,
                "INSERT INTO `trunk_plates` (`trunk_id`, `number`, `region`) VALUES (%d, '%e', '%e') \
                ON DUPLICATE KEY UPDATE `number`='%e', `region`='%e'",
                g_Trunk[vehicleid][slot][trID],
                g_TrunkPlateNum[vehicleid][slot], g_TrunkPlateReg[vehicleid][slot],
                g_TrunkPlateNum[vehicleid][slot], g_TrunkPlateReg[vehicleid][slot]);
            mysql_tquery(db_handle, q);
        }
        return 1;
    }

    mysql_format(db_handle, q, sizeof q,
        "INSERT INTO `trunks` (`oc_id`, `slot`, `item_id`, `amount`, `value`) VALUES (%d, %d, %d, %d, %d)",
        car_dbid, slot, item_id, g_Trunk[vehicleid][slot][trCount], g_Trunk[vehicleid][slot][trValue]);
    mysql_tquery(db_handle, q, "Trunk_OnRowInserted", "iii", vehicleid, slot, car_dbid);
    return 1;
}

forward Trunk_OnRowInserted(vehicleid, slot, car_dbid);
public Trunk_OnRowInserted(vehicleid, slot, car_dbid)
{
    #pragma unused car_dbid
    g_Trunk[vehicleid][slot][trID] = cache_insert_id();
    if(IsPlateItem(g_Trunk[vehicleid][slot][trItem]) && g_Trunk[vehicleid][slot][trID] > 0)
    {
        new q[256];
        mysql_format(db_handle, q, sizeof q,
            "INSERT INTO `trunk_plates` (`trunk_id`, `number`, `region`) VALUES (%d, '%e', '%e')",
            g_Trunk[vehicleid][slot][trID],
            g_TrunkPlateNum[vehicleid][slot], g_TrunkPlateReg[vehicleid][slot]);
        mysql_tquery(db_handle, q);
    }
    return 1;
}

stock Trunk_Load(vehicleid, car_dbid, playerid = INVALID_PLAYER_ID)
{
    Trunk_ResetVehicle(vehicleid);
    g_TrunkLoadedDbId[vehicleid] = car_dbid;
    if(playerid != INVALID_PLAYER_ID)
        SetPVarInt(playerid, "trunk_open_veh", vehicleid);
    new q[320];
    mysql_format(db_handle, q, sizeof q,
        "SELECT t.`id`, t.`slot`, t.`item_id`, t.`amount`, t.`value`, IFNULL(p.`number`, '') AS `pnum`, IFNULL(p.`region`, '') AS `preg` \
        FROM `trunks` t LEFT JOIN `trunk_plates` p ON p.`trunk_id` = t.`id` WHERE t.`oc_id` = %d ORDER BY t.`slot` ASC",
        car_dbid);
    mysql_tquery(db_handle, q, "Trunk_OnDbLoad", "ii", vehicleid, playerid);
    return 1;
}

forward Trunk_OnDbLoad(vehicleid, playerid);
public Trunk_OnDbLoad(vehicleid, playerid)
{
    new rows = cache_num_rows();
    new auto_slot;
    for(new i = 0; i < rows; i++)
    {
        new slot = cache_get_field_content_int(i, "slot");
        if(slot < 0 || slot >= MAX_TRUNK_SLOTS)
        {
            slot = auto_slot;
            auto_slot++;
            if(slot >= MAX_TRUNK_SLOTS) continue;
        }
        else if(slot >= auto_slot) auto_slot = slot + 1;

        g_Trunk[vehicleid][slot][trID] = cache_get_field_content_int(i, "id");
        g_Trunk[vehicleid][slot][trItem] = cache_get_field_content_int(i, "item_id");
        g_Trunk[vehicleid][slot][trCount] = cache_get_field_content_int(i, "amount");
        g_Trunk[vehicleid][slot][trValue] = cache_get_field_content_int(i, "value");
        if(IsPlateItem(g_Trunk[vehicleid][slot][trItem]))
        {
            cache_get_field_content(i, "pnum", g_TrunkPlateNum[vehicleid][slot], db_handle, 16);
            cache_get_field_content(i, "preg", g_TrunkPlateReg[vehicleid][slot], db_handle, 8);
        }
    }

    if(playerid != INVALID_PLAYER_ID && IsPlayerConnected(playerid) &&
        GetPVarInt(playerid, "trunk_open_veh") == vehicleid)
    {
        DeletePVar(playerid, "trunk_open_veh");
        if(GetClosestVehicleByTrunk(playerid, 4.5) == vehicleid)
            Trunk_ShowGUI(playerid, vehicleid);
    }
    return 1;
}

stock Trunk_OpenForPlayer(playerid, vehicleid)
{
    if(!IsPlayerConnected(playerid)) return 0;
    if(vehicleid <= 0 || vehicleid >= MAX_VEHICLES || !GetVehicleModel(vehicleid))
    {
        ShowNotification(playerid, 0, 5, 0, 0, "˜˜˜˜˜˜˜˜˜ ˜˜˜˜˜˜˜˜˜˜.", "");
        return 0;
    }
    if(GetPlayerState(playerid) != PLAYER_STATE_ONFOOT)
    {
        ShowNotification(playerid, 0, 5, 0, 0, "˜˜˜˜˜˜˜ ˜˜ ˜˜˜˜˜˜˜˜˜˜.", "");
        return 0;
    }
    if(GetClosestVehicleByTrunk(playerid, 3.0) != vehicleid)
    {
        Veh_ShowTrunkOrNoCarMsg(playerid, 8.0);
        return 0;
    }
    new model = GetVehicleModel(vehicleid);
    if(model == 481 || model == 509 || model == 510)
    {
        ShowNotification(playerid, 0, 5, 0, 0, "˜ ˜˜˜˜˜ ˜˜˜˜˜˜˜˜˜˜ ˜˜˜ ˜˜˜˜˜˜˜˜˜.", "");
        return 0;
    }
    if(!Trunk_PlayerCanAccess(playerid, vehicleid))
    {
        ShowNotification(playerid, 0, 5, 0, 0, "˜˜˜ ˜˜˜˜˜˜˜ ˜ ˜˜˜˜˜˜˜˜˜.", "");
        return 0;
    }
    new car_dbid;
    if(!Trunk_GetCarDbId(vehicleid, car_dbid))
    {
        ShowNotification(playerid, 0, 5, 0, 0, "˜˜˜˜˜˜˜˜ ˜˜˜˜˜˜˜˜˜˜ ˜˜˜ ˜˜˜˜˜ ˜˜.", "");
        return 0;
    }

    if(g_TrunkLoadedDbId[vehicleid] != car_dbid)
    {
        Trunk_Load(vehicleid, car_dbid, playerid);
        return 1;
    }
    return Trunk_ShowGUI(playerid, vehicleid);
}

stock Trunk_Close(playerid)
{
    g_PlayerTrunkVeh[playerid] = INVALID_VEHICLE_ID;
    new Node:res = JSON_Object();
    JSON_SetInt(res, "c", 1);
    HidePlayerGUI(playerid, GUI_TRUNK_ID, res);
    JSON_Cleanup(res);
    return 1;
}

stock Trunk_RemoveFromInv(playerid, inv_slot)
{
    if(inv_slot < 0 || inv_slot >= MAX_INV_SLOTS) return 0;
    if(PlayerInventory[playerid][inv_slot][invItem] == 0) return 0;

    if(IsPlateItem(PlayerInventory[playerid][inv_slot][invItem]))
        return RemoveInventoryPlate(playerid, inv_slot);

    if(PlayerInventory[playerid][inv_slot][invItem] == ITEM_SIM_CARD)
        return RemoveInventorySim(playerid, inv_slot);

    if(PlayerInventory[playerid][inv_slot][invID] > 0)
    {
        new q[96];
        mysql_format(db_handle, q, sizeof q, "DELETE FROM `inventory` WHERE `id`=%d", PlayerInventory[playerid][inv_slot][invID]);
        mysql_tquery(db_handle, q);
    }
    PlayerInventory[playerid][inv_slot][invID] = 0;
    PlayerInventory[playerid][inv_slot][invItem] = 0;
    PlayerInventory[playerid][inv_slot][invCount] = 0;
    PlayerInventory[playerid][inv_slot][invValue] = 0;
    return 1;
}

stock Trunk_PutToInvSlot(playerid, inv_slot, item_id, count, value, const num[], const reg[])
{
    if(inv_slot < 0 || inv_slot >= MAX_INV_SLOTS) return 0;
    if(PlayerInventory[playerid][inv_slot][invItem] != 0) return 0;

    if(IsPlateItem(item_id))
    {
        new country = PlateCountryFromItem(item_id);
        PlayerInventory[playerid][inv_slot][invItem] = item_id;
        PlayerInventory[playerid][inv_slot][invCount] = 1;
        PlayerInventory[playerid][inv_slot][invValue] = country;
        format(g_InvPlateNumber[playerid][inv_slot], 16, "%s", num);
        format(g_InvPlateRegion[playerid][inv_slot], 8, "%s", reg);
        new q[256];
        mysql_format(db_handle, q, sizeof q,
            "INSERT INTO `inventory` (`uid`, `item_id`, `count`, `slot`, `value`) VALUES (%d, %d, 1, %d, %d)",
            Player[playerid][pID], item_id, inv_slot, country);
        mysql_tquery(db_handle, q, "OnPlateItemInserted", "ii", playerid, inv_slot);
        return 1;
    }

    PlayerInventory[playerid][inv_slot][invItem] = item_id;
    PlayerInventory[playerid][inv_slot][invCount] = count;
    PlayerInventory[playerid][inv_slot][invValue] = value;

    new q[256];
    mysql_format(db_handle, q, sizeof q,
        "INSERT INTO `inventory` (`uid`, `item_id`, `count`, `slot`, `value`) VALUES (%d, %d, %d, %d, %d)",
        Player[playerid][pID], item_id, count, inv_slot, value);
    mysql_tquery(db_handle, q, "OnItemInserted", "ii", playerid, inv_slot);
    return 1;
}

stock Trunk_ResolveInvSlot(playerid, item_id, hint_slot, value)
{
    new slot = hint_slot;
    if(item_id > 0)
    {
        if(Inv_CorrectPacketInvSlot(playerid, item_id, hint_slot, value, slot, false))
            return slot;
    }
    else if(hint_slot >= 0 && hint_slot < MAX_INV_SLOTS && PlayerInventory[playerid][hint_slot][invItem] > 0)
        return hint_slot;

    for(new i = 0; i < MAX_INV_SLOTS; i++)
    {
        if(PlayerInventory[playerid][i][invItem] != item_id) continue;
        if((item_id == ITEM_SIM_CARD || item_id == 134) && value > 0 && PlayerInventory[playerid][i][invValue] != value)
            continue;
        return i;
    }
    return -1;
}

stock Trunk_SendTransferResult(playerid, transfer_type, bool:success)
{
    new vehicleid = g_PlayerTrunkVeh[playerid];
    new trunk_w;
    if(vehicleid > 0 && vehicleid < MAX_VEHICLES && GetVehicleModel(vehicleid))
        trunk_w = Trunk_GetWeight(vehicleid);
    else trunk_w = 0;

    new Node:response = JSON_Object();
    JSON_SetInt(response, "t", transfer_type);
    JSON_SetInt(response, "s", success ? 1 : 0);
    JSON_SetInt(response, "w", Inventory_GetTotalWeight(playerid));
    JSON_SetInt(response, "bw", trunk_w);
    OnPacketIncoming(playerid, GUI_TRUNK_ID, response);
    JSON_Cleanup(response);
    return 1;
}

stock Trunk_MoveInvToTrunk(playerid, vehicleid, inv_slot, trunk_slot)
{
    if(inv_slot < 0 || inv_slot >= MAX_INV_SLOTS) return 0;
    if(trunk_slot < 0 || trunk_slot >= MAX_TRUNK_SLOTS) return 0;
    if(g_Trunk[vehicleid][trunk_slot][trItem] != 0) return 0;

    new item_id = PlayerInventory[playerid][inv_slot][invItem];
    if(!Trunk_CanStoreItem(item_id)) return -1;
    if(IsItemAccessory(item_id) > 0 && PlayerInventory[playerid][inv_slot][invValue] == 1) return -2;

    new count = PlayerInventory[playerid][inv_slot][invCount];
    if(count < 1) count = 1;
    new add_w = Inventory_GetItemUnitWeight(item_id) * count;
    if(Trunk_GetWeight(vehicleid) + add_w > TRUNK_MAX_WEIGHT) return -3;

    new car_dbid;
    if(!Trunk_GetCarDbId(vehicleid, car_dbid)) return 0;

    g_Trunk[vehicleid][trunk_slot][trItem] = item_id;
    g_Trunk[vehicleid][trunk_slot][trCount] = count;
    g_Trunk[vehicleid][trunk_slot][trValue] = PlayerInventory[playerid][inv_slot][invValue];

    if(IsPlateItem(item_id))
    {
        format(g_TrunkPlateNum[vehicleid][trunk_slot], 16, "%s", g_InvPlateNumber[playerid][inv_slot]);
        format(g_TrunkPlateReg[vehicleid][trunk_slot], 8, "%s", g_InvPlateRegion[playerid][inv_slot]);
    }
    else
    {
        g_TrunkPlateNum[vehicleid][trunk_slot][0] = '\0';
        g_TrunkPlateReg[vehicleid][trunk_slot][0] = '\0';
    }

    Trunk_SaveSlot(vehicleid, trunk_slot, car_dbid);
    Trunk_RemoveFromInv(playerid, inv_slot);
    return 1;
}

stock Trunk_MoveTrunkToInv(playerid, vehicleid, trunk_slot, inv_slot)
{
    if(trunk_slot < 0 || trunk_slot >= MAX_TRUNK_SLOTS) return 0;
    if(inv_slot < 0 || inv_slot >= MAX_INV_SLOTS) return 0;
    if(PlayerInventory[playerid][inv_slot][invItem] != 0) return 0;

    new item_id = g_Trunk[vehicleid][trunk_slot][trItem];
    if(item_id <= 0) return 0;

    new count = g_Trunk[vehicleid][trunk_slot][trCount];
    if(count < 1) count = 1;
    new add_w = Inventory_GetItemUnitWeight(item_id) * count;
    if(Inventory_GetTotalWeight(playerid) + add_w > 50) return -3;

    if(!Trunk_PutToInvSlot(playerid, inv_slot, item_id, count, g_Trunk[vehicleid][trunk_slot][trValue],
        g_TrunkPlateNum[vehicleid][trunk_slot], g_TrunkPlateReg[vehicleid][trunk_slot]))
        return 0;

    Trunk_DeleteSlotDb(vehicleid, trunk_slot);
    return 1;
}

stock Trunk_HandlePacket(playerid, Node:json)
{
    new vehicleid = g_PlayerTrunkVeh[playerid];
    if(vehicleid <= 0 || vehicleid >= MAX_VEHICLES)
    {
        Trunk_SendTransferResult(playerid, 0, false);
        return 1;
    }

    new type = -1;
    JSON_GetInt(json, "t", type);

    if(type == 8)
    {
        Trunk_Close(playerid);
        return 1;
    }

    new item_id = 0, old_pos = -1, new_pos = -1, val = 0;
    JSON_GetInt(json, "ga", item_id);
    JSON_GetInt(json, "os", old_pos);
    if(JSON_GetType(json, "ns") != JSON_NODE_NULL)
        JSON_GetInt(json, "ns", new_pos);
    else
        JSON_GetInt(json, "s", new_pos);
    JSON_GetInt(json, "v", val);

    switch(type)
    {
        case 0:
        {
            new inv_slot = Trunk_ResolveInvSlot(playerid, item_id, old_pos, val);
            if(inv_slot < 0)
            {
                ShowNotification(playerid, 2, 4, 0, 1, "˜˜˜˜˜˜˜ ˜˜ ˜˜˜˜˜˜.", "");
                Trunk_SendTransferResult(playerid, 0, false);
                return 1;
            }

            new trunk_slot = new_pos;
            if(trunk_slot < 0 || trunk_slot >= MAX_TRUNK_SLOTS || g_Trunk[vehicleid][trunk_slot][trItem] != 0)
                trunk_slot = Trunk_FindFreeSlot(vehicleid);
            if(trunk_slot < 0)
            {
                ShowNotification(playerid, 2, 5, 0, 1, "˜˜˜ ˜˜˜˜˜ ˜ ˜˜˜˜˜˜˜˜˜.", "");
                Trunk_SendTransferResult(playerid, 0, false);
                return 1;
            }

            new res = Trunk_MoveInvToTrunk(playerid, vehicleid, inv_slot, trunk_slot);
            if(res == -1)
                ShowNotification(playerid, 2, 5, 0, 1, "˜˜˜˜ ˜˜˜˜˜˜˜ ˜˜˜˜˜˜ ˜˜˜˜˜˜˜˜ ˜ ˜˜˜˜˜˜˜˜.", "");
            else if(res == -2)
                ShowNotification(playerid, 2, 5, 0, 1, "˜˜˜˜˜˜˜ ˜˜˜˜˜˜˜ ˜˜˜˜˜˜˜˜˜.", "");
            else if(res == -3)
                ShowNotification(playerid, 2, 5, 0, 1, "˜˜˜˜˜˜˜˜ ˜˜˜˜˜ ˜˜˜˜ ˜˜˜˜˜˜˜˜˜.", "");
            else if(res == 0)
                ShowNotification(playerid, 2, 4, 0, 1, "˜˜ ˜˜˜˜˜˜˜ ˜˜˜˜˜˜˜˜˜˜˜ ˜˜˜˜˜˜˜.", "");

            Trunk_SendTransferResult(playerid, 0, bool:(res == 1));
            return 1;
        }
        case 1:
        {
            new trunk_slot = old_pos;
            if(trunk_slot < 0 || trunk_slot >= MAX_TRUNK_SLOTS || g_Trunk[vehicleid][trunk_slot][trItem] != item_id)
            {
                trunk_slot = -1;
                for(new t = 0; t < MAX_TRUNK_SLOTS; t++)
                {
                    if(g_Trunk[vehicleid][t][trItem] == item_id)
                    {
                        if(item_id == ITEM_SIM_CARD || item_id == 134)
                        {
                            if(val > 0 && g_Trunk[vehicleid][t][trValue] != val) continue;
                        }
                        trunk_slot = t;
                        break;
                    }
                }
            }
            if(trunk_slot < 0)
            {
                ShowNotification(playerid, 2, 4, 0, 1, "˜˜˜˜˜˜˜ ˜˜ ˜˜˜˜˜˜ ˜ ˜˜˜˜˜˜˜˜˜.", "");
                Trunk_SendTransferResult(playerid, 1, false);
                return 1;
            }

            new inv_slot = new_pos;
            if(inv_slot < 0 || inv_slot >= MAX_INV_SLOTS || PlayerInventory[playerid][inv_slot][invItem] != 0)
            {
                inv_slot = -1;
                for(new i = 0; i < MAX_INV_SLOTS; i++)
                {
                    if(PlayerInventory[playerid][i][invItem] == 0) { inv_slot = i; break; }
                }
            }
            if(inv_slot < 0)
            {
                ShowNotification(playerid, 2, 5, 0, 1, "˜˜˜ ˜˜˜˜˜ ˜ ˜˜˜˜˜˜˜˜˜.", "");
                Trunk_SendTransferResult(playerid, 1, false);
                return 1;
            }

            new res = Trunk_MoveTrunkToInv(playerid, vehicleid, trunk_slot, inv_slot);
            if(res == -3)
                ShowNotification(playerid, 2, 5, 0, 1, "˜˜˜˜˜˜˜ ˜˜˜˜˜˜ ˜˜˜ ˜˜˜˜˜˜˜˜˜.", "");
            else if(res == 0)
                ShowNotification(playerid, 2, 4, 0, 1, "˜˜ ˜˜˜˜˜˜˜ ˜˜˜˜˜˜˜˜˜˜˜ ˜˜˜˜˜˜˜.", "");

            Trunk_SendTransferResult(playerid, 1, bool:(res == 1));
            return 1;
        }
        case 2:
        {
            Trunk_SendTransferResult(playerid, 2, false);
            return 1;
        }
        case 9:
        {
            new trunk_slot = new_pos;
            if(trunk_slot < 0 || trunk_slot >= MAX_TRUNK_SLOTS || g_Trunk[vehicleid][trunk_slot][trItem] != 0)
                trunk_slot = Trunk_FindFreeSlot(vehicleid);
            if(trunk_slot < 0)
            {
                ShowNotification(playerid, 2, 5, 0, 1, "˜˜˜ ˜˜˜˜˜ ˜ ˜˜˜˜˜˜˜˜˜.", "");
                Trunk_SendTransferResult(playerid, 9, false);
                return 1;
            }
            if(Player[playerid][pSimCard] <= 0)
            {
                ShowNotification(playerid, 2, 4, 0, 1, "˜˜˜˜˜˜˜˜ SIM-˜˜˜˜˜ ˜˜ ˜˜˜˜˜˜˜.", "");
                Trunk_SendTransferResult(playerid, 9, false);
                return 1;
            }

            new sim_num = Player[playerid][pSimCard];
            new add_w = Inventory_GetItemUnitWeight(ITEM_SIM_CARD);
            if(Trunk_GetWeight(vehicleid) + add_w > TRUNK_MAX_WEIGHT)
            {
                ShowNotification(playerid, 2, 5, 0, 1, "˜˜˜˜˜˜˜˜ ˜˜˜˜˜ ˜˜˜˜ ˜˜˜˜˜˜˜˜˜.", "");
                Trunk_SendTransferResult(playerid, 9, false);
                return 1;
            }

            new car_dbid;
            if(!Trunk_GetCarDbId(vehicleid, car_dbid))
            {
                Trunk_SendTransferResult(playerid, 9, false);
                return 1;
            }

            SetPlayerSimCardSilent(playerid, 0);
            g_Trunk[vehicleid][trunk_slot][trItem] = ITEM_SIM_CARD;
            g_Trunk[vehicleid][trunk_slot][trCount] = 1;
            g_Trunk[vehicleid][trunk_slot][trValue] = sim_num;
            g_TrunkPlateNum[vehicleid][trunk_slot][0] = '\0';
            g_TrunkPlateReg[vehicleid][trunk_slot][0] = '\0';
            Trunk_SaveSlot(vehicleid, trunk_slot, car_dbid);
            Trunk_SendTransferResult(playerid, 9, true);
            return 1;
        }
    }
    return 0;
}

stock Trunk_TickOffer(playerid)
{
    if(!IsPlayerConnected(playerid)) return 1;
    if(g_PlayerTrunkVeh[playerid] != INVALID_VEHICLE_ID) return 1;

    if(GetPlayerState(playerid) != PLAYER_STATE_ONFOOT || IsPlayerInAnyVehicle(playerid))
    {
        g_TrunkOfferShown[playerid] = false;
        g_TrunkOfferVeh[playerid] = 0;
        return 1;
    }

    new veh = GetClosestVehicleByTrunk(playerid, 2.2);
    if(veh <= 0 || !Trunk_PlayerCanAccess(playerid, veh))
    {
        g_TrunkOfferShown[playerid] = false;
        g_TrunkOfferVeh[playerid] = 0;
        return 1;
    }

    new model = GetVehicleModel(veh);
    if(model == 481 || model == 509 || model == 510)
    {
        g_TrunkOfferShown[playerid] = false;
        return 1;
    }

    if(!g_TrunkOfferShown[playerid] || g_TrunkOfferVeh[playerid] != veh)
    {
        new now = gettime();
        if(now - g_TrunkOfferLastTime[playerid] < 15)
            return 1;

        ShowNotification(playerid, 4, VEH_UI_OFFER_DURATION, NOTIFY_OFFER_TRUNK, veh,
            "˜˜˜˜˜˜˜ ˜˜˜˜˜˜˜˜?", ">>");
        g_TrunkOfferShown[playerid] = true;
        g_TrunkOfferVeh[playerid] = veh;
        g_TrunkOfferLastTime[playerid] = now;
    }
    return 1;
}

stock Trunk_OnPlayerDisconnect(playerid)
{
    g_PlayerTrunkVeh[playerid] = INVALID_VEHICLE_ID;
    g_TrunkOfferShown[playerid] = false;
    g_TrunkOfferVeh[playerid] = 0;
    g_TrunkOfferLastTime[playerid] = 0;
    g_TrunkOfferLastTime[playerid] = 0;
    return 1;
}

CMD:bagazh(playerid, params[])
{
    #pragma unused params
    new veh = GetClosestVehicleByTrunk(playerid, 3.0);
    if(veh <= 0)
    {
        if(GetClosestVehicleToPlayer(playerid, 8.0) == 0)
            return SendClientMessage(playerid, COLOR_RED, "˜˜˜˜˜ ˜ ˜˜˜˜ ˜˜˜ ˜˜˜˜˜˜˜˜˜˜.");
        return SendClientMessage(playerid, COLOR_RED, "˜˜˜˜˜˜˜˜˜ ˜ ˜˜˜˜˜˜˜˜˜ ˜˜˜˜˜˜˜˜˜˜.");
    }
    Trunk_OpenForPlayer(playerid, veh);
    return 1;
}
