					"{FF5252}˜˜˜˜˜˜˜˜ ˜˜˜˜˜˜˜",
					"˜˜˜˜˜˜˜ ID ˜˜˜˜˜˜˜ ˜˜˜ ˜˜˜˜˜˜˜˜:",
